<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">-Ndendele Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kitabo chu Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabo chikijhandikwe na Mucha chikikemwa Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kubh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabo chikijhandikwe na Mucha chikikemwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kubhoka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha Kubhoka kijhendele kuchimulila malobhe ghighatumbwi mu kitabo Chukutumbula mu lukolo lwa Ulahimo. Lilobhe lende Kubhoka, lilichimulila kitendwa cha bhando bhuku Ichilahele, chibhaholita kubhoka mu ubhanda gwa Akamichile na kubhujha mu kilambo Bhambo Chapanga chanaghila kumpe Ulahimo. Kwa mapokelo gha akachomi bhijheketela kubhehe chehemo ngolongwa jha kitabo chenje kikajhandikwe na nnondole jwa Chapanga Mucha, na lilobhe lyenie ikilangiya mu kitabo chenje. Kitabo chukutumbu 24:4, kichimulila namuna jha Mucha chakajhandike chehemo jha kitabo chenje. Yoshuwa 8:21, kilangiya mihilo ibhii mu kitabo chu Kubhoka muchula jha 20:25, ilonge, “Ngita chijhandikwe mukitabo cha mihilo jha Mucha.” Itabo ya Lilaghano Liyono, ichimulila mala kwa mala nu kubhujhila itabo ijhandikwe na Mucha, kwa kulandanikiya pala kiheghejha pikijhaka mwotu nambo kitinika jhe. Kilebhe chenje kijhandikwe mukitabo cha Mucha, “Kitabo cha Mucha, Maluku mu chula jha 12:26, malobhe ghanga ghichimulila panane jha kiheghejha chikijhaka mwotu nambo kitinika jhe. Pange Akaichilahele bhabhokita kukilambo chu ku Michile panakate jha chaka cha 1300 amu 1400, kabula jhukubhelukwa Kilichitu. Mu kitabo cha akanahota chukutumbula mu chula jha 6:1, ilonge kubhehe kitendwa chenie chu Kubhoka kitendika mu chaka 480 kabula jha chaka cha ncheche cha ulongoche gwake munahota nkolongwa Chulemane ku Ichilahele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha Kubhoka kighaghalila namuna Chapanga kuhobholeka kwake kupala kujhendelecha lilaghilo lyake chanaghalikiya Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu. Kitabo kichimulila itendwa ikolongwa ya ukomboche gwa Chapanga kwa yana ya Ulahimo, ndi bhando bhikilambo chuku Ichilahele, pibhakibha bhabhokita mu kilambo chuku Michile, Kubhoka muchula jha 1-12. Kubhoka kwenio Chapanga ngabhalongwicha bhando bhake ade chehemo jha ndika pahe jha kitombe cha Chinae, chehemo Chapanga kwampila Mucha malaghalikilo twe kupala Akaichilahele bhaikamule, mu chula jha 12-19. Malaghalikilo ghanga ghichimulila Akaichilahele chibhapalitwa kuhenga na pibhapalitwa kupiya matambiko na machimulilo ghamahena panane jha kutendekeya Lihema li Nyahinyahi, chehemo papalitwa kubhehe matamo cha Chapanga pakate jhabhe, na helahela Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na ilebhe henge kunhwalo gwa kunyinamila nkate jha lihema li nyahinyahi, na ngobho kunhwalo gwa upiya litambiko, Kubhoka muchula jha 20-31. Peniya, pibhaghalwika Akaichilahe, pala pibhakitengenechela kinyagho cha ng'ombi cha chaabo, Mucha akakongine na Chapanga kabhele pala puupetita ughaluko gwenio, Kubhoka mu chula jha 32-33. Chehemo jha kujhomolela jha kitabo chenje, namuna jhukutengenecha ilebhe ilongilwa, Kubhoka 33-40.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Machimulilo gha yana ya Akaichilahele pibhakibha kuubhanda, mu chula jha 1.</para>
  <para style="io">Malobhe gha Mucha kuhumii umwana gwake ade pakemwa kwakombola yana ya Chapanga, mu chula jha 2 ade 4.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhele jwajhandika ichimulila Chapanga chahengita ikangacho na kuibula kilambo chuku Michile kwa mabulo makolongwa kunhwalo gwa kwakombola bhando bhake hele kubhoka mu lilaka lya Falao, mu chula jha 5 ade 15, 21.</para>
  <para style="io">Peniya, bhando bhuku Ichilahele bhabhii umwanja nu kujhenda kukitombe chuku Chinae, muchula jha 15 ade 19, 22</para>
  <para style="io">Chapanga namuna champila Mucha mihilo jhibhii na machimulilo ghamahele kwa bhando bhuku Ichilahele, chibhapalitwa kutama nu kunnyinamila Chapanga, mu chula jha 20 ade 31.</para>
  <para style="io">Ijhandikwe namuna jha yana ya Akaichilahele chibhannekita Chapanga pibhankolwiya nnongo mundo Mucha jwakemitwa Alune, abhatengenechele kinyagho cha ng'ombi cha chaabo, mu chula jha 32.</para>
  <para style="io">Tuchoma namuna Mucha chauwene ung'alicho amu ung'alo gwa Chapanga na kwabhola Akaichilahele mihilo jha Chapanga, pamonga na kwalobholela namuna jha kutendekeya Lihema li Linyahinyahi na Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na ilebhe henge yukujhinamila mu Lihema lyenio na mambu ghighachimulila malobhe gha ngobho yukuwala mpiya litambiko, mu chula jha 33 ade 40.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhing'ahichwa ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />“Ghanga ndi maina gha yana inalome ya Akaichilahele bhibhakalongoine na Yakobu kujhenda ku kilambo chuku Michile, kila mundo na kibheluko chake. <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Lubene na Simone na Lawe na Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />na Isakale na Zabulone na Benjamine, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dane na Nafutale na Gade na Achele. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Bhahe, kibheluko choha cha Yakobu kikibha na bhando makome chaba. Na kipinde chene Uchupo akibha atamita koko ku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Yene, paipetita yaka yamahele Uchupo ngawila na akalongo mundo bhoha na kibheluko na lungolo lwoha ngaluwila. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Nambo kibheluko cha Akaichilahele kikabhelukine hake, kijhakubhehe hoku na kina makakala hake, yene kijhakujhene kila chehemo ku kilambo chuku Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Peniya, ngapitila munahota nkolongwa jhonge akibha aumanyitijhe Uchupo kweno ku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Ngabhalobholila bhando bhake, “Dola, Akaichilahele chibhajholwike na bhina makakala kupeta twenga. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Ngohe, tupalwa kutenda nginyika jha kwapongocha bhakoto kujholokana, anda yene jhe ipitii ngondo nabhalombana na akamakoko bhito na kukomana na twenga paligha kunyogholoka mu kilambo.” <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Yene, Akamichile ngabhahagwila akanahota bha kwajhemelela na kwang'aya Akaichilahele kwa lihengo linonopaho. Yene, ngabhachenga majhumba gha kubheke kihukilo gha Falao ku muche gwaku Pitomu na Lamesesi. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Nambo pibhang'ahita hake Akaichilahele, ndi pibhajhojhikika na kubhehe twe mu kilambo. Yene, Akamichile ngabhapwelila hake Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Yene, Akamichile ngabhachokolekiya kuhenga mahengo Akaichilahele kwa ukokotoko, <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />itamo jhabhe Akaichilahele ngaibhila lipyanda kwa mahengo manonopaho gha kutengenecha chokaa na kubhutu matofale na mahengo ghoha gha mughonda, kwa mahengo gheniya ghoha Akaichilahele bhachokolikilwa kuhenga kwa ukokotoo.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Peniya, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile ngabhalobholila akakunga bhuku Michile Chifula na Puwa, bhibhapapicha akakeghe bha Kiebulaniya, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />ngalongila, “Pimapapakiya akakeghe bha Kiebulaniya, nningukiya anda abhelwike mwana munalome munkome, nambo anda abhii mwikeghe munneka.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Nhwalo akakunga bhakibha bhando bha Chapanga bhakannyokanikii jhe chalongila munahota jwenio jwaku Michile, yene, bhakaikomiti jhe yana inalome ya Kiebulaniya. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Yene, munahota jwa ku Michile ngabhakema na kwakonya, “Ntehi kilebhe ghane? Mbone mwikomitii jhe yana inalome?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Ngabhanyangwila munahota jwenio, “Akakeghe bha Kiebulaniya bhina makakala bhilandanajhe na akakeghe bhuku Michile, yene upapa yana yabhe kabula nkunga anaika jhe.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Yene, Chapanga ajhakwatende ilebhe ya mbone akakunga bhena. Akaichilahele ndi pibhajhonjikika na kubhehe twe hake. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Nhwalo akakunga bheniya bhakibha bhando bha Chapanga, Chapanga ngabhatangatila kubhehe na yana twe. <verse eid="EXO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Yene Falao ngalaghila kwa bhando bhoha, “Mwana munalome abhelukwa jwa Kiebulaniya ataghilwa kulukemba lwaku Naile. Nambo mwana mwikeghe munneke ghome.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelukwa kwa Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Peniya pakibha na munalome jwa likabila lya Lawe na jwenio ngantole mwikeghe jhumo jwa likabila lya Lawe, <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />na mwikeghe jwenio ngapatita ndumbo na kupapa mwana munalome. Palola kubhehe king'enya jhuna kuhalala, yene ngakiita nkate kwa miyehe mitato. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Nambo pamanyita anhoto ng'o kunhiya kabhele, bhahe, ngatenganicha kitandabhala kamatete, ngakilima lange jha lame. Mwenio ngakibheka king'enya chela na kukinhiya na mu matete muupele jha lukemba Naile. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Nnombo jwa mwana jhonio ngajhobha pahina na lukemba lweno kupala kulola chikipa kumpitii mwana jhono.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Yene, kamwale jwa Falao ngahelela ku lukemba kujhogha na akatumiche bhake, ngabhatyanga tyanga muupele mu lukemba. Kamwale jwa Falao ngakibhona kitandabhala chela panakate jha matete, ajhakuntuma ntumiche gwake akakitole. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Payekwila, ngamwena mwana king'enya chela kilela, ngammonila kiya, ngalongila, “Chenje ndi king'enya pakate jha Akaebulaniya.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Papa ngapitila nnombo jwa mwana jhola, ngannobholela kamwale jhola, “Bho, nyende nikampalaye yaya jwakunnela mwana jhonjo pakate jha akakeghe bha Akaebulaniya?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Kamwale jwa Falao nganyangwila, “Hena kanetela.” Peniya nchikana jhola ngajhawila nganetita majhe jwa mwana. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Yene, kamwale gwa Falao ngannobholela majhe jhola, “Munnele mwana jhone, nenga nanipela malepo ghino.” Yene, majhe jhola ngantoila mwana na kunnela. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Mwana pakolita, majhe mundo ajhakumpeleka kwa kamwale gwa Falao, na jwene ngantoila na kuntenda mwana mundo. Ankemita liina lya Mucha, ngalongila “Ninhohwi umache.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha abhutukii ku Mediane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Lichiko limo Mucha pabhila kangombo, ngajhenda kwatyangii Akaebulaniya ajhake kupala amanye mang'ahe ghabhe. Peniya ngammona mu Michile jhumo ibula Mwibulaniya, pakate jha akalongo mundo Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Mucha ngalola oko na oko, akabhwe jhe mundo, bhahe ngakomita Mmichile jhola na kunhwininka muncheke. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Lichiko lilikengema, Mucha ngabhokita kabhele, na ngabhona Akaebulaniya chika bhibulana. Yene Mucha ngakonyita jhola jwa lemwite, “Kilebhe ghane chamibuli nnyino?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Na jwene ngajhangwila, “Ghane jwamekite kubhehe mwatemula pakate jhito? Bho, mipala kungoma ngita chamunkomita Mmichile jhola? Peniya Mucha ngajhogwipa hake na kuhole kubhehe, lijambu lyandei limanyikine!” <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Falao pajhohina kilebhe chene, ngapala kunkoma Mucha. Nambo Mucha ngantilila kukilambo chuku Mediane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Lichiko limo Mucha ngatamita pahina jha kilibha. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Bhahe, akachikabhale chaba bha Yetulo mpiya litambiko jwa ku Mediane, ngabhajhenda kuteka mache gha kuinkenga mbuhe na mambelele gha tate gwabhe.<verse eid="EXO 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Akalucha bhange bhajhakuhika na kwabhenga akachikabhale bhena. Nambo Mucha ngajhema na kwatangatii kuikenga inyama jhabhe. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Ngabhujhita ukajha kwa tate gwabhe, Yetulo ngabhakonyita, “Mboni nnyombotike kubhujha?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Na bhene ngabhanyangwila, “Mmichile jhumo atughombwi mumabhoko gha akalucha. Jwene ndi jwatekita mache na kuinkenga inyama hito.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Tate gwabhe ajhakwakonya, “Munnekite ko? Nhwalo gwa nike nhikite nako jhe? Nnyendengane, munkeme ahike alyeghe.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Mucha ngajheketela kutama kwa mundo jhono. Peniya mundo jwenio ngampeila Mucha kamwale gwake jwakemitwa Chipola abhehe nhwana mundo. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Chipola ngabhila na ndumbo, ngapapa mwana munalome. Mucha ngankemita Gelichomu, ngalongila, “Mutukile mu kilambo chakighene.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Puipetita yaka yamahele, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile ngajhomwika. Akaichilahele ngabhajhendelila kulela na kukokoleka kwa nhwalo gwa ubhanda na kulela kwabhe Chapanga ngajhoha. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Chapanga ngajhohina kukokoleka kweno, na jwene ngakombwika lilaghano lyateila kwa Ulahimo na kwa Ichaka na kwa Yakobu. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Kwa yene, Chapanga ngabhalolokeya Akaichilahele chibhalaghita na ngabhabhone kiya.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ankema Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Lichiko limo Mucha akibha alucha lilongo lya mambelele lya nkoano mundo, Yetulo mpiya litambiko jwa ku Mediane. Mucha ngalilongocha lilongo lyene ade kunjenga, ngahika kukitombe chuku Holebu, kitombe cha Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Peniya ntumiche jwa kunane jwa Chapanga ngampitila Mucha kupete lulime lwa mwotu panakate jha kiheghejha. Mucha ngalola na ngakangicha pakiheghejha pijhaka mwotu na pitinika jhe. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Mucha ngahechwika na kulonge, “Chenje ndi kilebhe cha kukangacha hake! Kiheghejha kijhaka mwotu nambo kitinika jhe, denda ningukiye maha.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Chapanga palola kubhehe Mucha aghalambwike kukilingulii kiheghejha, ngankemita kubhoke pena, “Mucha! Mucha!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Mucha ngajhangwila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">“Mii pamba!”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Chapanga nganobholela, “Nkoto kuheghele pamba na hula maghubache ghino, nhwalo chehemo jhanyemite ndi jha nyahinyahi.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Peniya Chapanga ngannobholela Mucha, “Nenga ndi Chapanga jwa tate gwino ndi Chapanga jwa Ulahimo ndi Chapanga jwa Ichaka ndi Chapanga jwa Yakobu.” Mucha pajhohina gheniya ngayekilila kumiho kwake, nhwalo ajhogwipa kunninguli Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Nighabwene mang'ahe gha bhando bhango bhibhabhi Ku Michile na nyohine kulela kwabhe, nhwalo gwa bhibhang'aha bhena bhibhajhemelela mahengo ghabhe. Na nenga nighamanye mang'ahe ghabhe, <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />bhahe nhulwike kwakombola mu mang'ahe gha Akamichile, nimmohe mu kilambo chene na kumpeleka kukilambo cha maha na kikolongwa, kilambo chikibholile na yamaha kulema na kukoleka. Kilambo cha Akakanane na Akaahite na Akaamole na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche na ngohe bhitama Akayebuche. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Chakaka kulela kwa Akaichilahele kunhikile, na nenga mwene chiming'awa na Akamichile. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Ngohe nanintuma kwa munanhota nkolongwa Falao, kupala makabhohe bhando bhango, kubhoka mu kilambo chuku Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Nambo Mucha ngannyangwila Chapanga, “Ne meneke ade nyende kwa Falao kwabhoha Akaichilahele ku Michile?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Nambo Chapanga ngajhendilila kunnobholela, “Nenga namma pamonga na mwenga. Chamwabhoha Akaichilahele na kuhika kunnyinamii nenga Chapanga pa kitombe chenje. Chene naibha nginyililo ngolongwa kubhehe nenga Chapanga ndi jhunitumite.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Nambo Mucha ngannyangwila kabhele, “Anda najhendi Akaichilahele na kwalobhole, ‘Chapanga jwa tate gwino andumite kwino,’ nabhene nabhangonya, ‘Ikemwa ghane?’ Nalobholela nike?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “NENGA NDI JHUMILE. Yene mwalobholela Akaichilahele bhoha. Jwajho Jwaikemwa, NENGA JHUMILE, ndi jwandumite kwino.”<verse eid="EXO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Hele, Chapanga ngannobholela Mucha, mwalobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe, Bhambo Chapanga jwa Ulahimo na Chapanga jwa Ichaka na Chapanga jwa Yakobu, andumite kwino. Lyene ndi liina lyango machiko ghoha ghangapeta, na ndi chibhangomboka mu ibheluko yoha. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Nnyende makakonganiche ighogholo ya Akaichilahele na kwalobhole Chapanga jwa tate gwino, Chapanga jwa Ulahimo, jwa Ichaka, jwa Yakobu, ambitile na kunobholela ningukii na kulola gheniya ghimitendelwa kwenio ku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Nilaghi kubhehe nanimmoha mu malagho ghino, kwenio ku Michile na kumpeleka mu kilambo cha Akakanane na Akaahite na Akaamole na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche, chinimpeleka mu kilambo chikibholile na chamaha kukoleka na kulema.<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />Bhene nabhanyokanakiya, pena mwenga na ighogho na munyendela munanhota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile na kunnobholela, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaebulaniya atupitile. Ngohe tunyopa nyeketele tujhende kunjenga tukatame kwa machiko matato, tukampii litambiko Bhambo Chapanga gwito. <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Nambo nimanya kubhehe munanhota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile nanekekeya jhe nnyende ade achokelekewe. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Yene nahatambula lubhoko lwango kwabula Akamichile kwa ikangacho yimbandenda pakate jhabhe. Pughapetita gheniya munanhota nkolongwa nanekekeya nnyendengane.<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />Kabhele chanatenda Akamichile bhapale Akaichilahele, na kwenio ku Michile nammoke jhe jhajhe. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Kila mwikeghe Mwichilahele nannyopa nkoche mundo Mmichile na mwikeghe jhojhoha jwaitama pakajhake ampe yombo ya feza na chaabo pamonga ngobho. Mawalika bhana bhino na akachikana bhino. Yene ndi chimwapoka Akamichile ilebhe yabhe.<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga impe Mucha makakala gha kuhenga ikangacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Mucha ngannobholela Chapanga, “Nambo Akaichilahele nabhanyokanakiya jhe, nabhalongela, mwenga ampitii ng'o Bhambo Chapanga?”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngankonya Mucha, “Nkamwii nike mulubhoko lwino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Mucha ngajhangwila, “Ngamwi nkongocho.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Ntaghii pahe.” Mucha ngatagha tepe, papa nkongocho ngalughalambwika kubhehe lijhoka, na jwene ngatila. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Pena Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila, “Kamula nkela jwa lijhoka.” Bhahe, Mucha ngakamula nkela gwa lijhoka lyene, papa lijhoka ngalighalambwika kabhele kubhehe nkongocho mulubhoko lwake. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Chapanga ngannobholila, “Chakaka Akaichilahele nabhanyokanakiya kubhehe nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa tate gwino, Chapanga jwa Ulahimo, jwa Ichaka na jwa Yakobu, nimpitile.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Kabhele Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholela Mucha, “Ngohe bheka lubhoko lwino panganga.” Mucha ngatenda yene. Palubhohita lubhoko lwake lujhakubhehe na malohe mahuo mbuu ngita cheluji. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Peniya Chapanga ngannobholila, “Bheka kabhele panganga.” Mucha ngatenda yene, palubhohita lubhoko lwake lujhakubhehe njelembo ngita chiukibha. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholela, “Anda bhanyokanaki jhe amu kujheketela nginyililo jhela jhitumbwila, pange nabhajheketela nginyililo jha ubhele. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Nambo anda bhajheketii jhe nginyililo henge ibhele hilu kunnyokanakiya malobhe ghino, nteka mache gha mu lukemba Naile na kughajhitii kundumba. Mache ghimipa kunteka mu lukemba naghaghalambuka kubhehe miyahe pandumba.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Nambo Mucha ngannobholela Bhambo Chapanga, “Mabhambo gwango, ne kulonge kwene kumamatila kuhumii makacho, ata mwenga punnongila na nenga natumiche bhino. Nhwalo lulime lwango lutopao.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Bhambo Chapanga ngankonya Mucha, “Ghane jwaupangine nnomo? Ghane jwatei mundo alongele amu jwangalongela? Ghane jwampeki mundo kulola amu kubhehe jwangalola? Nei jhe Bhambo Chapanga? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Ngohe, nnyende! Nanintangatila na kummola kila kilebhe chakulongela.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Nambo Mucha ngalongila, “Mabhambo, chonde ne nihoto jhe, muntume mundo jhonge.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Peniya Chapanga nganchimwa Mucha, ngalongila, “Bho, chi abhii nnongo gwino Alune, Mlawe? Jwene ilonge maha. Kabhele abhii undela ihika kukongana na mwenga, pumpa kukongana nahangana hake ku mwojho gwake. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Mwenga nannongela nako na kunnobholela ghoha ghapakulongela. Nenga nanitangatila na kummolangana ilebhe ipakuhenga. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Alune nalongela na Akaichilahele kwa nhwalo gwino. Jwene nabhaha nnondole gwino, na mwenga namma ngita Chapanga kwa jwenio. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Nantola nkongocho ghongo mulubhoko lwino, ntumila kutende nginyililo yela.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha abhujha ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Pena Mucha ngabhujhita kwa Yetulo, nkohano mundo, ngannobholila, “Chonde unekekeye nnyende ku Michile kwa akalongo bhango, nikamanye pange bhabhii ghome.” Yetulo ngannobholela, “Nnyenda kwa uteeke.” <verse eid="EXO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Mucha pakibha ammela kukilambo chuku Mediane, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholela, “Mmujhe ku Michile, nhwalo bhala bhoha bhibhapala kunkoma bhajhomwike.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Pena Mucha ngantoila nhwana mundo na yana yake, na kwahobhokela panane jha liponda na kutumbuu mwanja gwa kubhujha ku Michile. Mu lubhoko lwake akamwi nkongocho gwalobholilwa na Chapanga atole.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Kabhele, Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Ngohe mibhuja ku Michile, chakaka henga ikangacho yoha yanimpekii uhotolo gwa kuihenga palonge jha munanhota nkolongwa Falao. Nambo nenga chaniutenda mwojho gwa Falao kubhehe unonoho, na jwene nabhalekekeya jhe Akaichilahele bhabhoka. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Na mwe namnnobholela Falao, Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Ichilahele ndi mwanango jwa litibho munalome. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nenga ninnobholela, munneke mwanango abhoke, kupala andumikile! Anda munnekiki jhe abhoke, naninkoma mwana gwino jwalitibho munalome.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Mucha pakibha pa kighono cha akaghene kongo abhii undela kubhujha ku Michile, Chapanga ngakongina nako na kupala kunkoma. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Pena, Chipola ngatoila lighanga lilitema hake, ngahekita lindole lya mwana mundo munalome na kunkilimi Mucha mu magholo ghake. Na kulonge, “Chakaka mwenga ndi manyinamwale gwango gwa miyahe.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga nganneka Mucha. Chipola alongila “Nnyinamwale gwa miyahe,” nhwalo gwa kuheketa lindole lya mwana mundo munalome.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Chapanga ngannobholela Alune, “Nnyende kunjenga makakongane na Mucha.” Pena Alune ngajhenda ngankongana na Mucha kukitombe cha Chapanga, ngankumbatila. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune hotuhotu ghala ghalaghilwa na Chapanga kughalonge, helehela nginyililo na ikangacho yoha yalaghilwa kuhenga.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Peniya, Mucha na Alune ngabhajhenda na kwakonganicha ighogholo yoha ya Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Alune ngabhalobholila hotuhotu malobhe ghoha, ghalaghilwa Mucha na Bhambo Chapanga, na kuitenda ikangacho palonge jha bhando bhoha. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Bhando ngabhanyeketela. Na pibhajhohina kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ahikita kwatangatila Akaichilahele na kubhehe aghabwene mang'ahe ghabhe, bhoha ngabhalita na kunyinamila.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Mucha na Alune palonge jha Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Peniya, Mucha na Alune ngabhanyendela Falao munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile na kunnobholela, “Bhambo Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele ilonge naha, ‘Maleke bhando bhango bhabhoke, bhakahenge unyagho kunjenga.’” <verse eid="EXO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Falao ngalongila, “Jweno Bhambo Chapanga ndi ghane, ade nninyokanikiye, na kwaleka Akaichilahele bhabhoke? Ne nimanye jhe jwenio Bhambo Chapanga, hilu nalekeke jhe Akaichilahele bhabhoke.” <verse eid="EXO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Mucha na Alune ngabhannyangwila, “Chapanga jwa Akaebulaniya akongine natwenga. Tumpembekeya mutuleke tujhende mwanja gwa kunjenga kwa machiko matato, tukampikiye Chapanga litambiko, Chapanga gwito, nayene jhe natunkoma kwa malwalo amu kwa ngondo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Nambo munanhota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile ngabhajhangwila, “Mwe ma Mucha na Alune kilebhe ghane chimikolobhecha bhando mu mahengo ghabhe? Nnyende kumahengo ghino.” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Peniya Falao ngalongila kabhele, “Ngohe bhando bhino bhajholokine hake kupeta bhando na mangota mwahibhikiya kuhenga mahengo!”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Lichiko lele munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile, ngabhalaghila akatumiche pamonga na bhibhajhemelela, kwa kulonge, <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Kuhumii ngohe mangape ng'o manyahe gha kubhutuki matopwale ngita chimihenga, bhapalaha manyahe ghabhe bhene. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Nambo bhabhutuha matopwale ghaghala kwa lichiko, lyangapongo jhe hilu limo, nhwalo bhando bhamba akatotoho na bhilonge, ‘Mutulekekeye tujhende tukampihi Chapanga gwito litambiko.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Makundicha hake mulihengo kupala bhapita lihuke na bhaleke malobhe gha uwange.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Bhahe, akatumiche na bhibhajhemelela bhajhakujhenda na kwalobhole bhando, “Munanhota nkolongwa ilonge naha, na nimpeke ng'o manyahe. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Nnyende kwokwoha kumipakupata, nambo lihengo lino nalitamila papa.” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Yene, bhando ngabhapechengina mu kilambo choha kupalaha manyahe gha kupyatuli matopwale. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Na akatumiche ngabhaghaghita kulonge, “Nnyomolela mahengo ghino gha kila lichiko ngita kipinde chela pinnetilwa manyahe.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Bhibhajhemelela bhuku Michile ngabhabula bhibhajhemelela bha Akaichilahele bhibhahaghulilwa kujhemelela mahengo, nu kulonge, “Nhwalo gwa nike mihenga yene na mihikicha jhe matopwale ghaghalaghala ngita chinteila putumbwila?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Peniya, bhibhajhemelela bha Akaichilahele ngabhanyendela Falao nu kulonge. “Kibhii nike kututende naha twenga? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Nnekite kolya kutulete manyahe ghoghoha, na mutughaghalii tupyatula matopwale. Na akatumiche bhino bhatubula, kone lilemo lyene lya bhando bhino.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Nambo Falao ngalongila mangota makatotoho, ndi nhwalo milonge, mutulekekeye tujhende tukampikiye litambiko Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Ngohe nnyende makahenge lihengo, nhwalo nampelwa jhe manyahe, na pamonga na gheniya mipalwa kupyatu matopwale ghimbangilwe ghangapongoka! <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Bhajhemelela bha Akaichilahele ngibhamanya kubhehe bhabhii mu mang'ahe pibhalobholilwa, “Matopwale ghino naghabhaha ghaghalaghala hilu limo nalipongochwa jhe.”<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Pubhabhokita kweno kwa Falao, ngabhakongana na Mucha na Alune bhibhakibha bhalendilila. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Ngabhalobholila Mucha na Alune, “Bhambo Chapanga akilole kilebhe chenje nanhadabulwa mangota. Nhwalo mutubhekite mu maghonga kwa munahota nkolongwa Falao na akatumiche yake. Mangota ndi kihokola cha jwenio kutukoma twenga.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha ankokoleke Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Peniya, Mucha ngang'alambwikila Chapanga na kulonge, “Mabhambo, kibhii nike kwang'aya bhando bhamba? Nike chundumila nenga? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Nhwalo kuhumii pinnongila na Falao kwa liina lino, abhang'aya bhando bhamba. Mwenga mmii nuu hilu kwakombola pandina!”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngannyangwila Mucha, “Ngohe nannola chimbakunhina Falao, naghaghalilwa kwalekekeya bhando bhango bhabhoke. Kwa makakala nabhabhenga bhabhoke mu kilambo chake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga inkema Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Ne, ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Nikampitii Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu manyikina ngita Chapanga Jhuna Makakala, nambo nakalobholii jhe liina lyango. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Kabhele nikalaghine nabho kwape kilambo chuku Kaanane, na kwenio bhatamita ngita akaghene. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Kupeta kwa gheniya, nyohine kulela kwa Akaichilahele bhighaghalilwa kuhenga mahengo gha kibhanda na Akamichile, yene ngombwike lilaghano lyango. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Yene, mwalobholele Akaichilahele naha, ‘Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga! Nanimmoha kubhoke muubhanda gwino. Kwa makakala gha lubhoko lwango nanachwapula hake Akamichile nu konkombola mangota. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Nanintenda kubhehe mabhando bhango, na namma Chapanga gwino. Na mangota naumanya kubhehe ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhunimohite mulingolengole lyuubhanda lya Akamichile. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Nane nanimpeleka mukilambo chela chinaghila kumpe Ulaaimo na Ichaka na Yakobu. Nanapela kubhehe kilambo chino. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Yene, Mucha ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele malobhe gheniya. Nambo bhakanyokanakii jhe nhwalo bhahengelike mwojho nhwalo gwa ubhanda utekuchocha.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Nnyende kwa munanhota nkolongwa Falao jwaku Michile, abhalekeyeye Akaichilahele mu kilambo chake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Nambo Mucha ngannobholela Bhambo Chapanga, “Anda Akaichilahele bhinnyokanikii jhe, kwa Falao naitenda kuchocha jhe? Ne lulime lwango lutopalo!”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngalongela kabhele na Mucha na Alune, ngabhalaghila bhajhende kwa munahota nkolongwa jwaku Michile na jwenie ngalaghila bhabhohe Akaichilahele mu kilambo chenio.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Mucha na Alune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Bhamba ndi bhakibha akanahota bha ngolo yabhe. Yana inalome ya Leubene jwakibha mwana jwa litibho jwa Ichilahele ikemitwa, Henoke na Palu na Hechilone na Kalomi. Henge ndi ikibha ibheluko ya ngolo ya Leubene. <verse eid="EXO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Yana inalome ya Chimone ikemitwa, Yemeele na Yamine na Oade na Yakine na Sohale na Shaule, na Shaule ndi jwakampapii kwa mwikeghe Nkaanane. Bhamba ndi akahokolo bha lukolo lwa Chimone. <verse eid="EXO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Ghanga ndi mahina gha yana ya Akalawe, Gechone na Koate na Melale. Lawe ngalama yaka miya jhimo na makome matato na chaba. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Yana inalome ya Gelichone ikemitwa Libune na Simei. Ngolo yabhe ikemitwa kwa mahina ghabhe. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Yana inalome ya Koate ikemitwa, Amulamo na Ishale na Hebulone na Uziele. Koate ngalama yaka miya jhimo na makome matato na mitato. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Yana inalome ya Melale ikemitwa, Male na Mushe. Henge ndi ngolo jha Akalawe na ibheluko yabhe.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amulamo ngantolila Yokobedi nihenga mundo na jwenio ngampapila yana inalome ikemitwa, Halune na Mucha. Amulamo ngalama yaka miya jhimo na makome matato na chaba. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Na yana inalome ya Ishale ikemitwa, Kola na Nefege na Zikile. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Yana ya kilome ya Uziele ikemitwa, Mishaele na Elisafane na Sitile.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Alune ngantolila Elicheba, bite Aminadabo, nnombo mundo Nachone, jwenio ngampapila Nadabo na Abiu na Elezale na Itamale. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Yana inalome ya Kola ikemitwa, Asile na Elukana na Abisafu. Bhamba ndi akahokolo bha bhando bha Kola. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleazale mwana jwa Alune, ngantolila jhumo jwa mwana jwa Pituele, na jwenio ngampapila mwana jwakemwa, Finehase. Henge ndi ngolo ya Akalawe, kukengama na ngolo yabhe.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Alune na Mucha ndi bhibhalobholilwa na Bhambo Chapanga kubhehe, “Malongoche Akaichilahele kubhoka mu kilambo chuku Michile ntomontomo.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Ndi bhabha Mucha na Alune bhibhalongila na Falao munahota nkolongwa jwaku Michile, kupala bhalekekelwe Akaichilahele mu kilambo chenio.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhambo Chapanga abhalaghii Mucha na Alune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Lichiko lela Bhambo Chapanga palongila na Mucha mu kilambo chuku Michile, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />pannobholila, “Ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga. Munnobholela Falao hotuhotu ilebhe yoha inninobholila.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Nambo Mucha pannyangwila, “Ne lulime lwango lutopalo, Falao chakaka nanyokanikiya jhe?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Dola, ngohe nintei ngita ma Chapanga kwa Falao, na nnongo gwino Alune nabhaha nnondole gwino. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Munnobholela nnongo gwino Alune kila kilebhe chinipa kunnaghalikiya, na Alune nannobholela Falao, abhalekekeya Akaichilahele bhabhoke mu kilambo chake. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Nambo naniutenda mwojho gwa Falao kubhehe unonoho. Ata nikachochite kuhenga nginyililo na ikangacho yango mu Michile, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Falao nanyokanakiya jhe mangota, peniya nahatambula lubhoko lwango lulubhii na makakala na kuchwapula kilambo cha ku Michile, na kwabhoha bhando bhango, makabila gha Akaichilahele kubhoka ku Michile. Nandenda yene kwa itendwa yabhe ikolo ya luhadabulo kwa Akamichile. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Akamichile nabhamanya kubhehe nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, pimbakuhatambu lubhoko lwango na kwabhoha Akaichilahele mwenio. <verse eid="EXO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Mucha na Alune ngabhateila telatela, ngita chibhalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Pibhalongila na munahota nkolongwa Falao, Mucha akibha muughohe gwa yaka makome nane na Alune akibha mughohe gwa yaka makome nane na itato.”<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongocho gwa Alune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha na Alune, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Falao papakunnobhole, ntende ikangacho, pena munnobholela Alune akamula nkongocho gwake na autaghila pahe palonge jha Falao, nkongocho gwenio naughalambuka kubhehe lijhoka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Yene Mucha na alune ngabhanyendila Falao na kuhenga ngita chibhalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. Alune ngautagha nkongocho gwake pahe palonge jha Falao na palonge jha akatumiche ajhake, na nkongocho papa ngaughalambwika kubhehe lijhoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Nambo Falao ngabhakema bhando bhina malango na akahabhe bha ku Michile, na bhene ngabhateila uhabhe gwabhe helahela. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Kila mundo ngautaghila nkongocho gwake pahe, yene ngaighalambwika nukubhehe majhoka. Nambo nkongocho gwa Alune ngaimila mikongocho jhoha. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Pamonga na gheniya, mwojho gwa Falao ngauhighilika unonoho, hilu akannyokaniki jhe Mucha na Alune, ngita chalongila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabulo kome</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 7:14-12:36">Kubhoka 7:14-12:36</ref></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lya kutumbula miyahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Mwojho gwa Falao unonoho hake, apaijhe kwalekekeya Akaichilahele bhabhoke. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Bhahe, nnyenda makakongane nako lukela, pajhenda kulukemba Naile. Na mulubhoko lwino nkamula nkongocho ghola ghughalambwika nukubhehe lijhoka. Makannendela paupele jha lukemba. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Peniya, munnobholela, Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaebulaniya andumite kwino, kunnobholela, ‘Malekekeye bhando bhango bhajhende kunjenga bhakanyinamile, nambo mwe nkanite mbe kunyokanikiya. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Bhambo Chapanga ilonge kubhehe, kwa lende naumanya ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga. Dola nakumbughana mache gha lukemba Naile kwa nkongocho ghongo, na ghene naghaghalambuka kubhehe miyahe. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Na homba yoha yabhii mwenio mulukemba Naile naiwa na mache ghoha naghanunga njii, na Akamichile nabhanywe ng'o mache gheniya.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Munnobholela Alune, atola nkongocho gwake na kujhinuu panane jha mache ghaku Michile na ngemba yoha na michinge na ilibha na mu matanda ghoha, yene naighambwika kubhehe miyahe. Miyahe ngaijhenila kila chehemo mu Michile na mu yombo yoha ya mikongo na ya undope.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Mucha na Alune ngabhateila ngita chabhalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. Alune ngatondobhiya nkongocho gwake palonge jha Falao na akatumiche bhake, ngaghabula mache gha lukemba Naile, papa ngaghalambwika kubhehe miyahe pyuu. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Homba yoha ngaiwila na lukemba ngalununga hake na Akamichile bhakahotwi ng'o kunywe mache gheniya. Miyahe ngaijhenila kila chehemo mu kilambo chaku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Nambo akahabhe bhaku Michile kwa uhabhe gwabhe ngabhateila hele. Yene mwojho gwa Falao ngauhighilika kubhehe unonoho, ngakanita mbe kunnyokaniki Mucha na Alune ngita chalongila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Bhahe, Falao ngabhujha mu ukajhake, ata ghighapitii akaghakamwii ndeka umwojho gwake. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Akamichile ngabhahemba ilibha pahina jha lukemba Naile, kupala mache gha kunywegha, nhwalo bhakahotwi ng'o kunywe mache gha mu lukemba lwenio.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Libulo lyene lya lukemba Naile likatamikii kwa machiko chaba.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Libulo lyubhele, Madokwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nnyende kwa Falao makannobholele, Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Maleke bhando bhango bhabhoke bhajhende bhakannyinamile. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Anda nkanite kwalekekeya, kilambo chino chinikibula kwa kunnete madokwa. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Lukemba Naile nautwelela madokwa, na madokwa gheniya naghajhingila mu nyumba jhino na mu chumbi chino ade pakindanda chino, na mu nyumba jha akatumiche bhino na bhando bhino. Madokwa gheniya naghajhingila pa kihinja chino na muyombo ya kuteleke mabumunda. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Madokwa gheniya naghabhaha kwii pahyegha jhino na pahyegha jha bhando bhino na akatumiche bhino.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Munnobholela Alune, antondobheya nkongocho gwake panane jha mungemba na michinge na ilibha na madokwa gheniya naghapitila nu kujhenela mu kilambo choha chuku Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Bhahe, Alune ngateila yene, na madokwa ngaghapitila nu kujhene mu kilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Nambo akahabhe bhu ku Michile kwa uhabhe gwabhe helahela ngabhaletita madokwa mu kilambo chuku Michile.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Peniya Falao ngankema Mucha na Alune, ngabhalobholila, “Munyope Bhambo Chapanga ammohe madokwa ghano, kwanenga na kwa bhando bhango, na ne chinalekekeya Akaichilahele bhajhende bhakampikii Bhambo Chapanga litambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Mucha nganyangwila Falao, “Tela! Kipinde ghane chimipala ninnyope Chapanga, aghakomelekeya madokwa ghighabhii mu nyumba jhino, na akatumiche bhino na bhando bhino, kupala naghahighilika ghala tugha ghighabhii mu lukemba Naile!”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Falao ngannobholila, “Kilabho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Mucha ngannyangwila, “Nandenda ngita channongi, mbala umanye abhii jhe jwalengana na Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito.”<verse eid="EXO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Madokwa ghanga naghabhoka pa nyumba jhino na mu nyumba jha akatumiche bhino na bhando bhino, naghahighilika ghala tugha ghighabhii mulukemba Naile. <verse eid="EXO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Bhahe, Mucha na Alune ngabhabhokita ukajha kwa Falao, na Mucha ngannelila Bhambo Chapanga ammoheke Falao madokwa ghighanyingilila. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Na Bhambo Chapanga ngateila ngita Mucha channyopita, madokwa gha munyumba na gha palubhanja na ghakung'onda ngaghawila. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Bhando bha ku Michile ngabhajholita malundo gha madokwa gheniya na kilambo choha ngakinunganila njii. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Nambo Falao pabwehina mbaha kilambo kinunga jhe kabhele, ngajhendelela kubhehe na lighoho, ngankanita mbe kunnyokanikiya Mucha na Alune, ngita chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lyuutato, Mipapane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Munnobholela Alune, antondobheya nkongocho gwake na kulubula lutukunda lwa pannema, na lwene lutukunda nalughalambwika kubhehe upapane mu kilambo choha chuku Michile.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Mucha na Alune ngabhateila yene. Alune ngantondobheya nkongocho gwake na kulubula lutukunda, na lwene ngalughalambwika kubhehe mipapane na kwanyomanila bhando na inyama. Lutukunda lwa kukilambo choha chuku Michile ngalughalambwika kubhehe mipapane. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Nambo akahabhe bha ku Michile pibhajhighita kuhenga yene kwa uhabhe gwabhe, ngabhalepilila. Na mipapane jhene ngajhanyomanila bhando na inyama. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Peniya akahabhe bhala bhajhakunnobholela Falao, “Lende ndi lihengo lya lubhoko lwa Bhambo Chapanga.” Nambo mwojho gwa Falao ngaujhendilila na lighoho, ngakanita mbe kunnyokanakii Mucha na Alune, ngita chalongila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lyu ncheche, Mabhembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Kilabho jhimka putepute munyendela Falao pajhenda kuloche munnobholela, ‘Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, malekekeya bhando bhango bhajhende bhakannyimile. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Anda mahibhilila kubhoka, nanimbula kwa malongo gha mabhembe ghighaluma, mwenga pamonga na akatumiche bhino na bhando bhii bhoha. Naghajhingila mu nyumba hino na nyumba yoha ya Akamichile naghatwelela mabhembe, na kila chehemo jhoha ku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Nambo lichiko lyene chanibhabheka kutale ku Gochene, kwabhitama bhando bhango, mwenio mabhembe naghabhe jhe. Peniya ndi namanya kubhehe nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga mmi mu kilambo chino. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Bhando bhango naghakolejhe ilebhe ipakwakole bhando bhino. Na nginyililo jhene jha kukangacha naipitila kilabho.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Bhambo Chapanga ngateila yene, malongo makolongwa gha mabhembe ngaghajhingila mu nyumba jha unahota nkolongwa gwa Falao, na munyumba ya akatumiche bhake na kilambo choha chuku Michile kikahangabhinwe na mabhembe.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Peniya Falao ngabhakema Mucha na Alune, na kwalobholela, “Nyendengane makapiye litambiko Chapanga gwino, nambo ibhaha mombonemone mu kilambo cha Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Nambo Mucha ngajhangwila, “Nahijhe! Lyene nalibhaha jhe lenga, nhwalo litambiko yatupakumpii Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, naihanganicha jhe Akamichile. Anda tubhohite litambiko palonge jhabhe, bho, nabhatunkong'onda jhe maghanga? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Ngita chitulaghila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwito, tupalwa tubhaha na mwanja gwa machiko matato kunjenga kupala kumpikiya Chapanga litambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Falao ngabhalobholila, “Naninnekekeya nnyende makampiki litambiko Bhambo Chapanga gwino, kunjenga. Nambo nkotoka kujhenda kutale, na makanyopela na nenga.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Mucha nganyangwila, “Pimoka tu pamba chininyopa Bhambo Chapanga kilabho ammohe malongo gha mabhembe pa nyumba jhino mwenga pamonga na akatumiche bhino na bhando bhino. Nambo mwenga mangatutendejhe chanake kabhele, kukana kwalekekeya bhando kujhenda kumbikii litambiko Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Bhahe Mucha ngabhokita ukajha kwa Falao, ajhakunyopa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Bhambo Chapanga ngateila ngita Mucha chanyopita, na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhohita mabhembe kwa Falao na akatumiche bhake na bhando bhake, hilu likahighi jhe libhembe ata limo. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Nambo kipinde chene Falao ngajhendelila kubhehe na mwojho unonoho, ngakanita kwalekekeya Akaichilahele bhabhoke.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Libulo lya nhwano, Kuwe kwa ipugho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nnyende kwa munahota Falao makannobholela, nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaebulaniya nilonge naha, ‘Malekekeye bhando bhango bhajhende bhakanyinamile. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Anda mwenga mahibhilii kabhele bhakoto kubhoka, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />lubhoko lwango nalukoma ipugho hino kwa malwalo mu mighonda, ng'ombi hino na falache na maponda na ngamiya na mbuhe na mambelele. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Nambo namaghanicha ipugho ya Akaichilahele na ipugho ya Akamichile, kupala mipugho jha Akaichilahele ikoto kuwegha.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Kabhele Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha kilabho nandenda kilebhe mu kilambo chenie.<verse eid="EXO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Kilabho jhake Bhambo Chapanga ngateila ngita chalongila. Ipugho yoha ya Akamichile ngaiwila, nambo ipugho ya Akaichilahele ikawi jhe ata chimo. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Falao ngatuma bhando kulingukiya mipugho ya Akaichilahele, na bhene pibhajhomolila ngabhamanya kubhehe ipugho ya Akaichilahele iwii ng'o. Nambo mwojho gwa Falao ukajheketii jhe kwalekekeya Akaichilahele bhajhabhule.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lya chita, Mapute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha na Alune, “Kila mundo atola lukohe lwa liho lya mulitanule, kubhoke peniya Mucha alitaghila kunane palonge jha Falao. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Na maliho gheniya naghabhaha lutukunda lujhojhoho na nalujhenela pa kilambo choha chuku Michile. Hele nakupitila mapute na gheniya naghatupa na kutolokana kubhehe ilonda kwii kwa bhando na ipugho, kila chehemo pakilambo chuku Michile.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Bhahe ngabhatola liho mulitanule na kujhema palonge jha Falao. Mucha ngaghataghila kunane, na mapute ghene ngaghapita muyegha jha bhando na ipugho. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Akahabhe bhakahotwii jhe kujhema palonge jha Mucha nhwalo bhene pamonga na Akamichile bhoha bhakibha na mapute kwii. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngauteila mwojho gwa Falao kubhehe unonoho, jwenie akajhokanakii jhe Mucha na Alune, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channobholila Mucha.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lya chaba, Hula jha maghanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Kilabho putepute, munyendele Falao makannobholela jwene, nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaebulaniya, nilonge naha, ‘Malekekeye bhando bhango bhakanyinamile. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Mwanja ghongo, mwenga na akatumiche ajhino na bhando bhino nankongana na mabulo ghango makolongwa hake kwino. Namwenga namanya kubhehe abhii jhe jhonge ngita nenga pannema ghoha. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Nganikomelikeye njwe, mwenga pamonga na bhando bhino kwa malwalo, na mangota ngankomelikilwe njwenjwe. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Nambo nitei nnyendelele kutama kupala ninnangi uhotolo ghango, na liina lyango nalitangachwa pannema gwoha. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Nambo mamela munalighoho panane jha bhando bhango, hilu mipala jhe kwaleka bhabhoke. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Kilabho lichaa ngita lende, naneta hula ngolongwa jha maghanga na jhikoma jhe mu kilambo chuku Michile kuhumii mu kupanganwa kwake ade deleno. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Ngohe nnaghila ipugho hino na chochoha chikibhii kung'onda makakibheke chehemo njelembo, hula jha maghanga nainkomela kila mundo na ipugho yaibhii kung'onda, yoha naijhomwika.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Akatumiche yela ya Falao pubhajhohina lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhateila kajhombe kwaleta akabhanda na ipugho yabhe ukajha. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Nambo bhala bhubhapuchita lilobhe lya Bhambo Chapanga, na kwaleka akabhanda na ipugho yabhe kung'onda.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Hatambula lubhoko lwino kunane, kupala hula jha maghanga ikome kukilambo chuku Michile kwoha. Ikomela mundo na mipugho na kila kilebhe chikimelite mung'onda.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Bhahe, Mucha ngantondobheya nkongocho gwake kunane. Bhambo Chapanga ngaleta mbamba na hula jha maghanga, lumule lwa mbamba ngaumulika mu kilambo. Bhambo Chapanga ngaikomechecha hula jha maghanga kukilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Hula jhene ngolonga jha maghanga ngaikomita kila chehemo ighalongohina pamonga na mule ya mbamba yukujhoghoha mukilambo choha chu ku Michile. Hula jhene jhinakoma jhe kuhumii mukupanganwa kwa Michile, kuhumi kilambo chene kubhehe nnema. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Hula jhene jha maghanga ngaihangabhina kila kilebhe cha mung'onda na mu kilambo chuku Michile, ipugho na bhando. Maghanga gha hula ngaghahangabhina yoha yaimelite na kila nkongo gwa mung'onda. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Nambo ku muche gwa Gochene kanjika hula jha maghanga ikakomite jhe, nhwalo Akaichilahele bhatamita kwenio.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Peniya, Falao ngabhakema Mucha na Alune, ngabhalobholila, “Chakaka nenga ndi jhumi na uhakaho. Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwabhii telatela, nenga na bhando bhango ndi akalemwa. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Munyope Bhambo Chapanga, kubhehe milindimilo na hula jha maghanga ite kuchocha. Nenga chaninnekekeya nnyabhule hilu nahighilika jhe pamba kabhele.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Mucha nganyangwila Falao, “Pambakubhoka tugha panja jha Muche, nannyinula mabhoko ghango na kunyopa Bhambo Chapanga. Nnindimilo na hula jha maghanga naikotoka, kupala manye nnema ndi gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Nambo nimanya mwenga na akatumiche bhino mamela minnyoghopa jhe Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Nkongo gwa litonje na mimeya jhikemwa chayile yoha ikahangabhinwe, nhwalo chayile ikibha na manjwanjwane, na mimeya jhene jha kutengenechela ngobho na chayile jhibhonikina ngita ngano ikibhe imelite malobha. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Nambo ngano na ilebhe henge yalandina ngita ngano, ikahangabhinwe jhe, nhwalo yene yakibha ikolitijhe.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Bhahe, Mucha ngabhoka ukajha kwa Falao, ngajhenda panja na muche gwenio. Peniya ngajhinula mabhoko ghake kwa Bhambo Chapanga. Nnindimilo na hula na jha maghanga bhahe, hula ngikotwika mu kilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Falao palolita milindimilo na hula jha maghanga ikotwike, ngabhujhila kabhele uhakaho, ngabhaha jhuna lighoho jwene pamonga na akatumiche bhake. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Anda Bhambo Chapanga channongolila kunnobholela Mucha, mwojho gwa Falao ngaujhendelela kubhehe nnonoho ngakanita kwalekekeya Akaichilahele bhajhabhule.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Libulo lya nane, Madidima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nnyende kabhele kwa Falao. Nenga nintei abhehe na mwojho unonoho, pamonga na akatumiche bhake, kupala ndende nginyililo henge panakate jhabhe, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />kupala mangota mwachimuli yana hino na ichokolo hino, chinatendi ubhiche Akamichile kwakuhenga nginyililo kwa ngaghandandela panakate jhabhe. Yene nabhamanya nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Peniya, Mucha na Alune ngabhanyendela Falao na kunnobholela, “Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaebulaniya, ilonge naha, bho, nankana ade ligha kukitembekecha? Malekekeye bhando bhango bhajhende bhannyinamile. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Anda nkanite kwalekekeya bhando bhango bhabhoke, bhahe, kilabho naneta madidima kwii mu kilambo chino. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Kilambo choha chuku Michile nakibha na lubhendo, nhwalo gwa madidima. Nabhahachulana kila kilebhe chakihighilika na hula jha maghanga, helahela nabhahachulana mikongo yoha yaimelite mu mighonda jhino. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Madidima gheniya naghatwelela mu nyumba jhino na mu nyumba ya akatumiche bhino na mu nyumba ya Akamichile, madidima naghabhaha hoko, akahoko bhino bhinaghabhona jhe kubhoke kubhelukwa kwabhe, ade deleno.” Peniya Mucha ngabhoka kwa Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Akatumiche bhakolo ngabhankonya Falao, “Bho, mundo jhonju natuntotoha ade ligha? Malekekeye bhando bhajhende bhakanyinamii Bhambo Chapanga gwabhe. Bho, mihola jhe kilambo chuku Michile kihangabhana?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Peniya Mucha na Alune ngabhakemitwa kwa Falao na kwalobhole, “Nnyendengane mukannyinamila Bhambo Chapanga gwino. Nambo nikonya, nannyenda achighane?”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Mucha nganyangwila, “Natujhenda na ingombo hito na ighogholo hito na yana hito na achikabhale bhito. Natujhenda na mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi, nhwalo tupalwa tukanhenge Bhambo Chapanga unyagho.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Falao ngalongila, “Bhambo Chapanga abhaha pamonga na mangota, anda ninnekekekiye nnyende na akahana bhino na yana hino. Hotu namma na ilebhe yanganandela umalango ghino. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Nai jhe! Akanalome tugha ndi nabhajhenda kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo lyene ndi lyamlipala.” Peniya Mucha na Alune ngabhabhengwa palonge jha Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nnyinula mabhoko ghino mu kilambo chuku Michile, kupala madidima ghapitile na kulye ilebhe yoha yaimelite mumighonda na ilebhe yoha yaihighilika pipetita hula jha maghanga.” <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Peniya Mucha ngantondobhiya nkongocho gwake panane jha kilambo chuku Michile. Na Bhambo Chapanga ngaleta upepo kuhumii upande gwalipitii lyobha, ngaupoghita mu kilambo choha muhe jhoha na kilo nda, na pukuchila tugha upepo gwenio ngauletita madidima. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Madidima ngaghapukila kila chehemo mu kilambo chenie ngaghatolita mu kilambo choha chuku Michile tyoo. Madidima gheniya ngaghajhingila twe hake, ghinapitii jhe ata naghapitii jhe ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Ngayekelila kilambo choha chuku Michile, na kilambo ngakibhonekana lubhendo. Ngabhalila kila kilebhe na uhoe kikahighilika pipetita hula jha maghanga na kila kilebhe chikimelete mumighonda. Likahighilike jhe lihamba lyolyoha munkongo amu mimeya mu kilambo chuku Michile.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Peniya Falao ngankema kajhombe Mucha na Alune na kwalobholela, “Ne nindendi uhakaho Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino helahela kwino. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Chonde ninyopa unekekeye uhakaho gwango kwa mala jhenge, na mukanyopele kwa Bhambo Chapanga gwino ammohe lilagho lende.” <verse eid="EXO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhoka kwa Falao ngajhenda kunnyopa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Bhambo Chapanga ngauletita upepo ngaupoghita kulitipiki lyobha, ghubhii na makakala, ngaubhoha madidima na kughapeleka ku mbwane jha Chamu. Akahighilike jhe lididima hilu jhumo mu kilambo choha chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngautenda mwojho gwa Falao ngaujhendelila kubhehe na lighoho, hilu akalekeki jhe Akaichilahele bhabhoke.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lya ticha, Lubhendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Peniya Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Jhinula lubhoko lwino kunane, kupala lubhendo tyoo lujhenele mu kilambo choha chuku Michile, bhando nabhatyanga kwa kupapakila.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Bhahe, Mucha ngajhinula lubhoko lwake kunane, ngalupitila lubhendo tyoo mu kilambo chuku Michile kwa machiko matato. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Akibha jhe mundo kukilambo chuku Michile jwahotwila kummona mundo jhonge hilu bhakahotwi jhe kuheghele kwa machiko matato. Nambo kwabhatamita Akaichilahele kukibha na lumule ndaa.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Peniya, Falao ngankema Mucha na kunnobholela, “Nyendengane makannyinami Bhambo Chapanga. Yana hino na akahana bhino mihoto kulongohana nabho, nambo malongo gha mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi hino muileke.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Nambo Mucha ngalongila yene jhe, “Yene jhe, tupalwa tujhende na mipugho jhito kupala tukampikii Bhambo Chapanga gwito litambiko lya kukomelekelwa.” <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Twenga natubhoka na inyama hito, kibhii jhe kipagha chikipa kuhighilika. Nhwalo tupalwa kubhohe pakate jha inyama, kupala kunnyinamii Bhambo Chapanga gwito. Tumanya jhe kinyama ghane chakumpikii Bhambo Chapanga litambiko ade pitupa kuhika kwenio.<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngajhendelila kuutenda mwojho gwa Falao kubhe unonoho, ngakana kwalekekeya Akaichilahele bhajhende. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Falao ngannobholila Mucha, “Bokela oko! Mukilolekeye, chakaka naummone ng'o kabhele! Lichiko lyampa kukubhona kumiho kwango nahwa!”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Mucha ngannyangwila, “Tela! Ibha ngita channongile, nanikubhone ng'o kumiho kwino kabhele.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Libulo lya kome kuwe kwa yana ya litibho bhando na inyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Mbakunnetela libulo limo kwa munahota nkolongwa Falao na bhando bhake. Peniya nanekekeya mmokengane na papakunekekeya jwene nammenga mmoke pyepye mu kilambo. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Ngohe malobholela Akaichilahele, kila jhumo munalome na mwikeghe anyope nnyake ilebhe ya madine gha feza na chaabo.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhatenda Akaichilahele bhapalwe hake na Akamichile. Kabhele Mucha jwene akibha mundo jwamanyikina hake mu kilambo chenie, na palonge jha akatumiche bha Falao na bhando bhoha.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Mucha ngannobholila Falao, “Bhambo Chapanga ilonge naha, ‘Deleno uhiko, nambeta kilambo choha chuku Michile, <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />na kila mwana munalome jwa litibho jwa kilambo chenie najhomoka, kutumbuli mwana gwino jwa litibho mwe ma Falao ndi mujhila gwino ade mwana jwa litibho jwa ntumiche gwino jwaiyagha palwalwa, na ata kinyama chilitibho cha Akamichile nangoma. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Bhando bhoha bhu ku Michile nabhalela kwa njobhelo ngolongwa hake, njobhelo yene inapiti jhe hilu naipitii ng'o kabhele. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Nambo panakate jha Akaichilahele, abhii jhe ata ghimbwa jwapakumbumila kwa mundo amu kinyama chochoha, kupala mmanye kubhehe nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga nanibhabheka jhe pamonga Akaichilahele na Akamichile.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Mucha ngajhomolila kwa kulonge, “Akatumiche bhino nabhahika na kulita palonge jhango kwa ichima, ‘Nukumbembekeya moke mu kilambo chuku Michile, nenga pamonga na bhando bhango bhubhingengama.’ Pughapetita gheniya nammoka.” Peniya Mucha ngabhokita kwa Falao kongo abhii na lilaka hake.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Falao nannyokanikiya jhe, ade ikangacho yango ijhonjekeke mu kilambo chuku Michile.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Bhahe, Mucha na Alune ngabhateila ikangacho yene yoha palonge jha Falao. Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngauteila mwojho gwa Falao kubhehe unonoho, ngakana kwalekekeya Akaichilahele bhabhoke mu kilambo chake.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pachaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalobholila Mucha na Alune mu kilambo chuku Michile, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mwehe ghongo kwino ubhaha mwehe gwa kutumbula kwa chaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Mwalobholela Akaichilahele bhoha kubhehe lichiko lya kome lya mwehe ghongo, bhatola litohe lya limbelele lyakambako limo lyalihatite kwa kila nyumba. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Anda ibhii nyumba jhojhoha inabhando bhandina bhangahoto kujhomo limbelele lyene, nyumba jhene ipalwa kulombana na nyumba jhenge. Peniya nabhahaghula kinyama lenga na bhando bhakulye nyama na kujhomola. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Mihoto kuhaghula litohe lya limbelele amu mbuhe lyankambako na abha jwa chaka chimo, jwangalemala. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Kila nyumba itunja inyama yene ade lichiko lya kome na ncheche lya mwehe ghogho. Lichiko lyene Akaichilahele nabhachinja inyama yene kimiye. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Peniya nabhatola miyahe jha inyama yene na kukilima mu mihimbate na ikolomino ya kunane jha kila nyumba jhimpakulele mwana limbelele lyene. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Kilo jhejhe nabhamemena nyama jhakubanika. Nabhalya pamonga na mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule na likolo lya mahamba libhabha. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Mangalye jhe nyama bhehe amu jhukututuha, nambo ibhaha jhakubanika pa mwotu, mangadumu jhe muto gwake hilu magholo ghake, mbanika pamonga ibhende yake. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Mipalwa kulye nyama jhoha kilo hilu mangahighalajhe ade lukela. Nyama jhojhoha anda ihighilike ade lukela mipalwa kutiniya pa mwotu. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Yene ndi chimipalwa kulyegha nyama jhene, chimikikonga luhunga mu kibhuno, na kuwala maghubache ghino na mumabhoko nkamula nkongocho gwino. Na kulye kajhombe jhene ndi Pachaka jha Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Kilo jhejhe nambeta mu kilambo choha chuku Michile na kuikoma yana ya litibho ya Akamichile na inyama. Na kuibula ichapanga yoha ya ku Michile. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Bhahe, miyahe jhenie naibha nginyililo jhino jha mu nyumba yimitama mangota. Na nenga pambakuibhona miyahe jhene naninhomba, peniya nalinkole jhe lilagho lyolyoha pimbakukibula kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Lichiko lende nalibha ukombochelo kwino, nabhatenda unyagho gwa Bhambo Chapanga mu ibheluko hino yoha. Nankamula nhwilo gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />Bhambo Chapanga ngalongila, “Kwa machiko chaba mipalwa kulye mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule. Mu lichiko lya kutumbula lya machiko gheniya chaba, namoha ngedule mu nyumba hino. Mundo jhojhoha jwapakulye chikilekilwe ngedule mu machiko gheniya, jwenio nabhengwa kutale pakate jha Akaichilahele bhoha. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Mu lichiko lya kutumbula na lichiko lya chaba napabhaha na likonganiko lya nyahinyahi. Mu machiko ghene mipalwa jhe kuhenga lihengo lyolyoha, nambo kulenganiki chakulya cha kila mundo, lyene tugha ndi limipalwa kuhenga. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Na mangota nankomboka unyagho gwa mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule, nhwalo lichiko lyene lyanabhohita akakomana ngondo bhino kuhumi ku Michile. Unyagho gwenio nabhatenda ibheluko hino yoha, kubhehe minhilo jha machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Yene, kimiye jha lichiko lya kome na ncheche lya mwehe gwa kutumbula nalyangana mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule, ade kimiye jha lichiko lya makome mabhele na limo lya mwehe ghogho. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Mu machiko gheniya chaba mangabheka jhe ngedule mu nyumba hino. Mundo jhojhoha abha nng'ene amu nkolo nyumba anda alile kilebhe chikilekilwe ngedule, jwenio nabhengwa kutale pakate jha Akaichilahele bhoha. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Popoha pumitama, mipalwa ng'o kulye kilebhe chochoha chikilekilwe ngedule. Mipalwa kulye mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pachaka jha kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Bhahe, Mucha ngabhakema ighogholo bha Akaichilahele, na kwalobholela, “Kila mundo ahaghula litohe lya limbelele amu mbuhe na kuchinja kwa nhwalo gwa Pachaka tela na bhando bhake. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Ntola lituto lilikemwa hichopo na kulichwiya mu libakule jhibhii na miyahe, na nkilima mu ikolomino yoha ibhele na mu nnyango. Mundo jhojhoha angapita jhe panja ade lukela. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Nhwalo nenga Bhambo Chapanga nambeta mu kilambo choha na kwakoma Akamichile. Nambo pambakuibhona miyahe jhikilimwe mu ikolomino ya nnyango, nanhomba hilu nanineka jhe jwakoma ajhingii nkate, ankome. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Nkamula lilobhe lende mwenga na ibheluko hino, ngita nhwilo gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Na pumpakujhingii mu kilambo chalaghila Bhambo Chapanga kumpela, ntenda naha ngita chinnaghalikiya. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Yana hino pibhapala kunkonya, ‘Unyagho ghongo mana ghane nike kwino?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Mangota majhangula, ‘Lende ndi litambiko lya Pachaka kwa ichima jha Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo akahombite nyumba ya Akaichilahele ku kilambo chuku Michile. Pibhakomitwa Akamichile nambo twenga ngatuleka ghome.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Akaichilahele ngabhatamita makilikite na kunnyinamila Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Akaichilahele ngabhajhenda nukutenda tela ngita Bhambo Chapanga chabhalaghila Mucha na Alune.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libulo lya kome, Kuwe yana ya litibho ya bhando bha ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Uwiko gwa kilo, Bhambo Chapanga ngakoma ibheluko yoha ya litibho ya ku Michile. Mwana jwa litibho jwa Falao jwapakubhe mmujhila jwa Falao na mwana jwa litibho jwapungwa. Na mwana jwa litibho jwa kila Mmichile. Yene ngankoma inyama yoha yukutumbula kubhelukwa. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Uwiko ghogho, Falao na akatumiche ajhake na bhando bhoha bhu ku Michile ngabhajhimwika, na kukibha na kilelo kikolongwa hake ku Michile, nhwalo pakibha jhe na nyumba ata jhimo jhanga malelo kwa mwana jwa litibho munalome. <verse eid="EXO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Peniya, uwiko ghola Falao ngankema Mucha na Alune, na kwalobholela, “Jhimuka! Mmokengane mangota na bhando bhino Akaichilahele. Nnyendengane, makannyinami Bhambo Chapanga ngita channongila. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Mmokangana na malongo ghino gha mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi hino, ngita channongila, nnyendengane, na helahela unnyopela mota na nenga.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Akamichile ngabhaghaghalila Akaichilahele bhabhoke kajhombe, kongo bhakalongila, “Mmokengane anda naijhe natuwa tabhoha!” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Peniya, Akaichilahele ngabhatola lihunya lyabhe lilihunywitwe lya mabumunda gwangalekelwa ngedule, na yombo yakuhunyila ngabhakongita mu ngobho na kughegha mu mabhegha ghabhe. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Akaichilahele ngabhateila ngita chibhalobholilwa na Mucha pakutumbula, ngabhajhopita Akamichile ilebhe ya madine gha feza na chaabo na ngobho. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Bhahe, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhateila Akamichile bhabhe bhaumbone kwa Akaichilahele, ngabhapilwa kila kilebhe chibhajhopita kwa Akamichile. Yene ndi Akaichilahele chibhatoila ilebhe mbwe ya Akamichile.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhibhoka ku Michile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Akaichilahele ngabhabhoka ku muche gwa Lamesesi nu kujhenda ku Sukosi kwa makongono. Akanalome bhakibha ngita lake chita, changabhalangila akakeghe na yana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Ngabhalongohina na nchambe gwa bhando bhange. Helahela Akaichilahele ngabhabhokita na mipugho jhabhe jha mambelele na mbuhe na ng'ombi. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Ngabhalenganikiya lihunye lya mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule kwa uhembe ghola kuhumita ku Michile, bhakahotwi jhe kulenganikiya chukukomelela undela, nhwalo bhakabhengwitwe kajhombe.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Akaichilahele ngabhatamita ku kilambo chuku Michile kwa kipinde cha yaka miya ncheche na makome matato. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Mu lichiko lya kupehekeya lya chaka cha miya ncheche na makome matato, ndi lichiko lele makabila ghoha gha Bhambo Chapanga ngighabhabhokita mu kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Uwiko gwenio, Bhambo Chapanga ngakelwiya kwabhoha Akaichilahele mu kilambo chuku Michile, yene ipalwa ikombokwa na Akaichilahele bhoha na ibheluko yabhe yoha kwa uwiko gwenio, ngita ichima jha kukeluwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha Pachaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha na Alune, jhenje ndi mihilo jha Pachaka, nng'ene jhojhoha ipalwa jhe kulye chakulya cha Pachaka, <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />nambo mmanda jhojhoha jhumunhemile kwa mbijha, ahoto kulye anda ajhingi jando, <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />mundo jhojhoha jwabhii nng'ene amu ntumiche jhojhoha, angalye jhe chakulya chenie cha Pachaka, <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />nyama jha litohe lya limbelele ipalwa ilyegwa nkate jha nyumba jhejhe jhilenganikilwa. Nkoto kubhoha nyama jhojhoha mu nyumba jhene, hilu nkoto kukekechula kihupa chochoha. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele bhipalwa bhahanganila unyagho gwenio, <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Anda abhi nng'ene jwatama panakate jhino jwapala kukomboka kulye chakulya cha Pachaka, ipalwa akanalome bhoha bhubhabhii mu nyumba jhino, bhajhingila jando, ndi nabhahotola kulye ngita nkolo muche. Munalome jhojhoha jwangajhingi jando ipalwa jhe kulyegha chakulya cha Pachaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Nhwilo gwenio ubhaha kwa Mwichilahele na akaghene bhibhatama na mangota. <verse eid="EXO 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhakamwila mbone nhwilo gwenio ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha na Alune. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Lichiko lele, Bhambo Chapanga ngabhabhoita Akaichilahele mu kilambo chuku Michile ntomontomo.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Lilaghilo lya kupiwa litambiko kwa yana ya litibho palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Mabhohe yana ya litibho yoha inalome, nhwalo akabhelukwa bhoha akanalome bha litibho bha Akaichilahele na kila kinyama chankambako chukutumbuu kubhelukwa ndi chango.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unyagho gwa mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Mucha ngabhalobholila bhando, “Mulikomboke lichiko lende lyamokita ku Michile kwamakibha akabhanda. Nhwalo lende ndi lichiko lya Bhambo Chapanga lyamoita mwenio kwa lubhoko lulubhii na makakala. Lichiko lende, nanyakila ng'o mabumunda ghighalekilwe ngedule. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Mangota nammoka mu kilambo chuku Michile, lichiko lya kutumbula lya mwehe gwa Abibu yane mwehe gwa kutumbula. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Bhambo Chapanga papakunhikicha ku kilambo cha Akaanane na Akaahite na Akaamole na Akaahive na Akayebuche, kilambo chalaghila akahoko bhino kubhehe nampela mangota. Kilambo china undope ghubholile na chamaha kukoleka, chakaka mipalwa kukomboka unyagho ghongo mu mwehe gwa kutumbula, mu kila chaka. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Milya mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule kwa machiko chaba, na lichiko lele lya chaba, nantenda unyagho kwa ichima jha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Kwa machiko chaba nalya mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule. Pangabhehe jhe na mabumunda ghighalekilwe ngedule, amu ngedule jhojhoha panakate jhino na mu kilambo chino choha. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Lichiko lyene namuilobholela yana hino, kubhehe, ndenda naha nhwalo gwa ilebhe yandendi Bhambo Chapanga pamoita ku kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Ukombocho ghongo ubhaha nginyililo mu mabhoko ghino na muibhonge hino ya kumiho, kupala inkombocha lilaghilo lya Bhambo Chapanga munnomo gwino machiko ghoha. Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga ammohite mu kilambo chuku Michile kwa lubhoko lwake lulubhii na makakala. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Yene, mipalwa nkomboka unyagho ghongo kwa kipinde chikibhekitwe kwa kila chaka.”<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo kwa mwana jwa litibho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />Mucha ngajhendilila kwalobhole bhando, “Bhambo Chapanga papakuhikicha mu kilambo chuku Kaanane na kumpe mangota kilambo chenie ngita chalapila kwa akahoko bhino, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />ipalwa mupiikiya litambiko Bhambo Chapanga kila mwana munalome jwa litibho. Na kubhoka muipugho hino kinyama chukutumbula kubhelukwa chankambako nakibha cha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Nambo liponda lyankambako lilitumbwi kubhelukwa namulinkombola kwa kulepa litohe lya limbelele, anda naijhe natwekula ntandala. Na kila mwana munalome jwa litibho namunkombola. <verse eid="EXO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />Machiko ghighahika mwana gwino anda ankonyite nike mana jha lende? Munnobholela kubhehe, ‘Tukomboka Bhambo Chapanga kwa lubhoko lwake lubhiii na makalala akatubhohite ku kilambo chuku Michile na kwenio twakibha akabhanda. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Falao kwa lighoho lyake ngakana kutulekekeya, pena Bhambo Chapanga ngakoma kila mwana jwa litibho ku kilambo chuku Michile, mwana jwa mundo na inyama. Yene nenga nimpikiya litambiko Bhambo Chapanga kila mwana jwankambako jwa litibho lya ipugho yango, na kila mwana jwa litibho jwa yanango nanakombola. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Kilebhe chenje nakibha ngita nginyililo mu mabhoko ghino na pa kibhonge chino, kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga akatubhohite ku kilambo chuku Michile kwa lubhoko lwake lulubhii na makakala.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luheke lwa lihunde na luheke lwa mwotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Falao pabhalekekiya Akaichilahele bhajhende, Chapanga akalongwii jhe ndela jhipetela ku kilambo cha Akafiliche, pamonga na ndela jhenie kubhe nyipe hake. Bhambo Chapanga akalongi, “Anda pabhii na ngondo, bhakoto kuhengeleka miojho na kubhujha ku Michile.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Bhahe, Chapanga ngabhapeticha Akaichilahele mu ndela jha kutindila kupete kunjenga, kujhenda ku mbwane jha Chamu. Akaichilahele ngabhabhoka ku kukilambo chuku Michile kongo bhikilenganiki kwa ngondo.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Mucha ngatoila ihupa ya Uchupo ngita Uchupo chalaghila nukuwe jhe. Akalapanikiye Akaichilahele, kukulonge, “Chakaka Chapanga papakuhika kummoha mu kilambo chenje, ipalwa mmoka pamba na ihupa yango.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Peniya, Akaichilahele ngabhabhoka ku Sukosi, ngabhabheka kighono kwenio ku Etamu, muupela jha kunjenga. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Kipinde cha muhe Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalongwicha kwa luheke lwa lihunde mu ndela jhabhe, na kilo ngabhalongwicha kwa luheke lwa mwotu kwamulikila, kupala bhatyanga kilo na muhe. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Luheke lwa lihunde kwalongoya kipinde cha muhe na gwa mwotu kwalongoya kipinde cha kilo, yene ikalekite ng'o kwalongoya Akaichilahele.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">Kujhomboka mbwane jha Chamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Malobholele Akaichilahele bhabhujhe unyuma, na bhabheke kighono pahina na Pi Hahilote, pakate jha muche gwa Megidole na mbwane jha Chamu, palonge jha mbwane Chefone. Peniya nammeka kighono pahina na mbwane. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Falao ngalongila kubhehe, ‘Akaichilahele bhilyungalyunga tugha, nhwalo njenga jhahibhikiye kubhoka.’ <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Peniya, nenga nanitenda Falao abhe nalighoho, najwenie nankengamila mangota. Na nenga chinikipatila ung'alicho kwa kunkomelekeya Falao jwene na akakomana ngondo bhake. Na Akamichile nabhamanya kubhehe nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga.” Bhahe, Akaichilahele ngabhateila ngita chabhalobholilwa.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Falao, munahota nkolongwa jwa Akamichile, pajhohina kubhehe Akaichilahele bhatilite, jwene na akatumiche bhake ngabhaghalambwika malango ghabhe, ngabhalongila, “Bho, chenje nike? Anda twalekekekiye Akaichilahele bhakibhokele, abhii jhe jhonge kabhele jwa kututumikila!” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Peniya, Falao ngalenganikiya mutuka jhake jha ngondo na akakomana ngondo bhake. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Ngatola mutuka yake yambone ya ngondo miya chita pamonga na mutuka henge yoha ya ngondo yuku Michile yilongochwa na akatumiche bha ngondo. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Bhambo Chapanga ngantenda Falao, munahota nkolongwa jwa ku Michile kubhehe na lighoho, na jwenie ngankengamila Akaichilahele, bhibhabhokite ku Michile changajhoghopa. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Akamichile pamonga na falache yabhe yoha na mutuka ya ngondo na bhakwela falache, ngabhapengelila Akaichilahele, ngabhakolila bhabhekite kighono muupele jha mbwane, pahina na Pi Hahilote, palonge jha Mbwane Chefone.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Akaichilahele pibhaghalabwika unyuma nu kummona Falao na akakomana ngondo bhake, ngabhahechwika hake ngibhannelila Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Ngabhannobholila Mucha, “Bho, kukilambo chuku Michile pakibha jhe na chehemo jha kuchikana, ade twe tuhwele kunjenga? Kilebhe ghane chimutubhoikiya ku Michile? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Tukannobholi jhe patukibha ku Michile, ‘Tukannobholii mwe mutuleke twatumikii Akamichile?’ Mbaha kwatumikii Akamichile kuliku kuwele kunjenga kone.”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Mucha ngabhajhangwila, “Mangajhoghopa jhe ntama nganganga! Deleno nannola Bhambo Chapanga champa kunkombola. Akamichile bhamba namabhone ng'o kabhele. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Bhambo Chapanga nankombola mangota, mipalwa ntama nuu tugha.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nhwalo gwanike minnelela? Malobholele Akaichilahele bhajhendele na mwanja gwabhe. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Tondobheya nkongocho gwino panane jha mbwane. Mache naghabhaghanika kongo na kongo na Akaichilahele ngabhajhombwika pajhomo. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Nenga chinatenda Akamichile kubhehe na miyojho minonoho, nabhankengama Akaichilahele pakate jha mbwane, peniya chinikipatila ung'alicho nhwalo gwa kukomelekelwa kwa Falao na akakomana ngondo bhake na mutuka yake ya ngondo pamonga na akakwela falache. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Pambakunhotola Falao na akakomana ngondo bhake na akakwela falache na mutuka yabhe ya ngondo, nabhamanya kubhe nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Peniya, ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga jwakibha ajhemite palonge jha nchambe gwa Akaichilahele ngabhujha unyuma jhabhe. Hele lukelekete lwa lihunde ngaibhoka palonge na kubhujha unyuma jhabhe, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />ngaitama panakate jha Akaichilahele na Akamichile. Kilo ndaa lihunde lela ngalyabhekila lubhendo Akamichile, nambo lyakamulikile Akaichilahele kilo. Yene, akibha jhe jwakammandiki nnyake kilo ndaa.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Peniya Mucha ngatondobhiya lubhoko lwake panane jha mbwane, Bhambo Chapanga ngaghakangita mache gha mu mbwane kwa upepo nkolonga kuhumii kulihumi lyobha. Ngaubhaghanicha mbwane chehemo ibhele na pakate ngapapitila undope nnyomo. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Akaichilahele ngabhajhombwika panakate jha mbwane chehemo nyomo, nhwalo mache ghakaghabhanike upande gwa lubhoko lwa ulelo na ngejha. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Akamichile ngabhankengima momo pamonga na falache yabhe na mutuka yabhe ya ngondo na akakwela falache bhoha. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Pikubhandikila kuchegha, Bhambo Chapanga ngalingulila akakomana ngondo bha Akamichile kubhoke mu luheke lwa mwotu na luheke lwa lihunde, ngabhabhila mu mbwelelo ngolongwa. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Maghuludumo gha mutuka yabhe ngaghatindila kwa kukwakamila hake. Akamichile ngabhalongila, “Twatile Akaichilahele! Nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga abhakengalila.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Tondobheya lubhoko lwino panane jha mbwane, kupala mache ghakonganike na kwayekelela Akamichile pamonga na mutuka yabhe na akakwela falache bhabhe.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Yene, Mucha ngatondobhiya lubhoko lwake panane jha mbwane, pakuchila mbwane ngaibhila njelembo ngita makacho. Akamichile ngibhajhigha kughatila mache, nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngabhakangila mu mbwane. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Mache ngaghayekelela mutuka pamonga na akakwela falache na akakomana ngondo bhoha bha Falao bhibhakengimila Akaichilahele ngabhawelila momo umbwane. Akahighii jhe Umichile hilu jhumo. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Nambo Akaichilahele ngabhajhombwika pajhomo panakate jha mbwane, mache ghakibha upande gwa lubhoko lwalelo na ngejha.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Lichiko lyene Bhambo Chapanga ngabhakombwila Akaichilahele mu mabhoko gha Akamichile, na Akaichilahele ngabhabhona malelo gha Akamichile muupele jha mbwane. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Akaichilahele pibhalola kilebhe chenio chukujhoghoha chateila Bhambo Chapanga kwa Akamichile, ngabhannomba Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhabha na kihobholelo na Bhambo Chapanga na Mucha ntumiche gwake.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Nhwambo gwa Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Peniya, Mucha pamonga na Akaichilehele ngabhanyembe nhwambo ghongo Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">Ninyembe nhwambo gwa kunnomba Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo abhahotwi kwa kihindo Akamichile bhoha, Bhambo Chapanga abhakangii umbwane</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">falache na akakwela falache.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Bhambo Chapanga ndi makakala ghango na uhotolo gwango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">na jwene ndi jwangombwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">ndi Chapanga gwango naninnomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">na Chapanga jwa tate gwango naninnyinamila.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Bhambo Chapanga ijhoghopa jhe ku ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">Na Bhambo Chapanga ndi liina lyake.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />“Mutuka na akakomana ngondo bha Falao abhataghi umbwane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">akatumiche bhake bhakahagwile bhamilitwe mu mbwane jha Chamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Chehemo jhinyolike jhamilite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">bhamilitwe umbwane ngita lighanga.”<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga lubhoko lwino lwalelo lumanyikina kwa makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">lwenio lwatimba akamakoko.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Kwa ukolo gwino gwamahele makomelekeya akamakoko bhino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">makalekekiye lilaka lino na lyene lyatiniya akamakoko bhino ngita mapepetahe.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Kwa uhuke gwa umbulo jhino mache ngaghalundikana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">matuhe gha mbwane ngaghajhema ngita lipamanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">mache gha chehemo jhinyolike panakate jha mbwane ngaghaghanda.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Likoko ngalongila, Chanakengima na kwapukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">chamaghana ilebhe yabhe nu kutola chochoha chinikipala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Naholomola upanga gwango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">na kwakomelekeya kwa lubhoko lwango.<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Nambo mwenga ngamupoghecha upepo gwino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">na mbwane ngajhamila ghina makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">ngabhadidimila ngita lighanga lina kutopa.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />Mwe Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">ghane panakate jha ichapanga jwabhii tela na mwenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Ndi ghane jwabhii ngita mwenga jwa nyahinyahi hake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Jhumijhoghoha kwa itendwa ya nyahinyahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">ghane jwaitenda ikangacho ngita mwenga? <verse eid="EXO 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Makatondobhii lubhoko lwino lwalelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">na nnema ngagwamila akamakoko bhito.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />“Kwa upalo gwino nkolo mwalongwiye bhando bhamakombwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">kwa makakala ghino mwalongwiye ade pa kitamo chino cha nyahinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Bhando bha ilambo henge ngabhajhohine na kulendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">Akafilichite ngabhabha na lipyanda hake.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Ilongoche yuku Edomu nabhajhoghopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">akatumiche bhuku Moabo ngibhalendima kwa bwoghohe hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">na bhando bhoha bhu ku Kaanane ngabhahengelika miyojho hake.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Iticho na mbwelelo yajhingilile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Nhwalo gwa ukolo gwa makakala ghino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">bhabhii nuu ngita lighanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">ade bhando bhino Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga, bhapete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">hena, ade bhando bhino bhamwankombwile bhapete.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Mwenga namwaleta bhando bhino na kwabheka bhatame pa kitombe chino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">pala panhagwila mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga pabhe matamo ghino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">Chehemo jha nyahinyahi ma Bhambo Chapanga panchengita kwa mabhoko ghino.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Mwe ma Bhambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:18">milongocha machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwambo gwa Miliamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Falache yake Falao na mutuka yake ya ngondo na akakwela falache bhake ngabhakengima na kuhika chehemo nnyomo mu mbwane, Bhambo Chapanga ngaghaleka mache gha umbwane ghakongane na kwamila. Nambo Akaichilahele ngabhatyanga pajhomo umbwane.<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Miliamo nnombo gwake Alune, jwakibha nnondole mwikeghe jwa Chapanga, ngatola kankole mu lubhoko lwake, na akakeghe bhoha ngabhakengima kongo bhihona ng'oma na kuhina. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miliamo ngabhalongwiya kujhemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">“Munnyembele Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo ahotwi kwa ukolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">falache na akakwela fachache bhake abhataghii umbwane.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mache mabhabhaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhalongwiya Akaichilahele kubhoke ku mbwane jha ku Chamu ade kunjenga jha ku Chuli. Ngabhatyanga kwa machiko matato bhakaghabwe jhe mache.<verse eid="EXO 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Pabhahikita chehemo jhikemwa Mala, ngabhaghakolila mache nambo bhakahotwi jhe kunywe mache gheniya nhwalo ghakibha mabhabhaho. Yene chehemo jhenie ikemwa Mala, mana jhake, “Kubhabha.” <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Bhahe, bhando bhoha ngabhankokilekela Mucha kulonge, “Ngohe natunywa nike?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Peniya, Mucha ngannelila Bhambo Chapanga, na Bhambo Chapanga ngannangiya kimbengembenge, Mucha ngakitumbukiya umache, papa mache ngaghabha ghambone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Kwenio Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapela nhwilo na lilaghalikilo Akaichilahele, na kwajhigha, <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />na Bhambo Chapanga ngabhalobholila, “Anda nnyokanakii mbone lilobhe lyango nenga Bhambo Chapanga gwino, na kutenda ghighabhi tela palonge jhango, na kuechimu nhwilo na malaghilo ghango, bhahe naninnete jhe malwalo ghoghoha ghinaletila Akamichile. Nhwalo nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga jwaninnamicha mangota.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Peniya Akaichilahele ngabhahika chehemo jhikemwa Elimu kwenio kukibha na yembwe kome na ibhele na mikongo makome chaba jha mitende. Ngabhabheka kighono chabhe pahina na mache.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Mabumunda ghighakemwa mana na ngwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Akaichilahele ngabhabhoka ku Elimu, ngabhahika kunjenga jha Chini lyalibhi panakate jha Elimu na Chinae, lyene lyakibha lichiko lya kome nu nhwano mwehe gwa ubhele kubhoke lichiko lyabhabhokita ku kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Bhahe, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhankokelekela Mucha na Alune kwenio kunjenga. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Ngabhalongila, “Mbaha Bhambo Chapanga ngatukomele ku kilambo chuku Michile kutukibha tutama, ngatulya nyama na mabumunda nu kujhukuta. Nambo mangota mutuletite twe twabhoha kunjenga kone kutukoma kwa njala!”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nyokanikiya, nenga naponekeya mabumunda ngita hula kuhumi kunane kumahunde. Kila lichiko bhando nabhabhoka na kulokota chakulye cha lichiko limo. Kwa ndela jhenie mbakwalola anda nabhakengema lilaghakilo lyango amu jhe. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Nambo lichiko lya chita bhalokota chakulye cha machiko mabhele nu kuteleka.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Peniya, Mucha na Alune ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele bhoha, “Kimiye cheno, ndi namanya kubhe Bhambo Chapanga ndi jwammohita ku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Kabhele kilabho lukela namuubhona ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ajhohine makokoleko ghino ghamikokoleka. Twe ndi ghane ade mutukokolekele?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Mucha ngajhendelila kulonge, “Kimiye, Bhambo Chapanga nampela nyama na lukela nampela mabumunda nnyeghe nnyukute, nhwalo jwene ajhohine makokoleko ghimikokolekela. Twe meneke ade mitukokolekele? Nkoto kutukokoleke twenga mukokelekela Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Peniya Mucha ngannobholila Alune, “Malobholele Akaichilahele bhoha bhakonganike pamonga palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga nhwalo ajhohine chibhikokoleka.”<verse eid="EXO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Kipinde Alune palongila na Akaichilahele, bhando bhoha ngabhalola kwenio kunjenga, papa ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngaubhonikina kunane kumahunde.<verse eid="EXO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Nighajhohine makokoleko gha Akaichilahele. Bhahe, malobholela kimiye nabhalya nyama, na lukela nabhalya mabumunda ghibhapala. Peniya namanya kubhehe ne ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino.”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Bhahe, paihikita kimiye malongo gha ngwale ngaghahika, ngaiyekelila ighono ya Akaichilahele. Lukela mangame ngaghapitila nghatindila kighono chabhe choha. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Mangame gheniya pighakupwika, pahe kunjenga ngaihighilika ilebhe inying'inyaho na majhojhoho. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Akaichilahele pibhalolita kilebhe chenie ngabhakangicha nu kukonyana, “Chenje ndi kilebhe ghane?” Bhakamanyii jhe chene ndi nike.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Bhahe, Mucha ngabhalobholila, “Lende ndi libumunda lyampekii Bhambo Chapanga nlyeghe.”<verse eid="EXO 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Bhambo Chapanga alaghalikii naha, kila mundo alokota chikikwela kulyegha, nalokota ibaba ibhele kila mundo kwa nhwalo ya yana mundo.<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Akaichilahele ngabhateila yene, bhange ngabhalokwita twe na bhange yapengwa. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Nambo bhoha pubhapemita chibhalokwita, ngabhamanya kubhehe kila jwalokwita twe akibha tela na jwalokwita yapengwa, kila jhumo akalokwite chikinkwela kulyegha.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Mucha ngabhalobholila bhando, “Mundo jhojhoha angahighaya jhe chochoha ade lukela.”<verse eid="EXO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Nambo bhando bhange bhakannyokanikii jhe Mucha, bhange ngabhakihighakiya ade lukela. Nambo lukela ngakibhokina kihundite nu kubhoha mbeko. Mucha ngabhayomela hake. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Bhahe, lukela kila mundo ngalokwita chikinkwela kulyegha. Lyobha palibhalita ngilii chakulya chikihighala ngakimung'unyuka.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Lichiko lya chita, Akaichilahele ngabhalokwita chakulya pabhele kwa chela chibhalobholilwa, kila mundo ibaba incheche. Na ighogholo ya Akaichilahele ngabhanyendela Mucha, na kunnobholela kilebhe chene. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Mucha ngabhalobholila, “Ghongo ndi nhwilo gwa Bhambo Chapanga. Kilabho ndi Lichiko lya Kupomolela lya nyahinyahi lya Bhambo Chapanga. Yene makatutu amu kujhocha chakulya cha deleno na chikihighala mmeka nnyangana kilabho.” <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Bhahe, ngabhatenda yene ngabhahighiya chenge ade kilabho ngita chalaghila Mucha. Lukela bhaikolii jhe mbeko hilu kununga. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Peniya Mucha ngabhalobholila “Nnyengane chikihighilike nhwalo deleno ndi Lichiko lya Kupomolela lya Bhambo Chapanga. Dele nampata jhe chakulyegha panja jha kighono. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Kwa machiko chita nannokota chakulya chenie, nambo lichiko lya chaba, yane Lichiko lya Kupomolela, nakubhehe jhe na chochoha.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Lichiko lya chaba bhange bhakajhahwi kupalaha chakulyegha, nambo kibhii jhe chabhajhambuli. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Ngohe nankana, ade ligha kujhokaniki nhwilo na malaghalikilo ghango? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Nkomboka nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga jwanimpekii Lichiko lya Kupomolela, ndi nhwalo mu lichiko lya chita nimpekii mabumunda gha machiko mabhele. Kila mundo ahighilika pakajhake mulichiko lyene lya chaba na apalwa jhe kubhoka pakajhabhe.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Yene, lichiko lya chaba bhando bhakahengite jhe lihengo.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Akaichilahele ngabhakema mabumunda gheniya “Mana.” Yakibha mijhebhejhaho ngita mbejho ya mapemba mahuo mbu na kunogha kwake ngita libumunda lijhebhejhaho lililenganikilwe kwa bhuche. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Mucha ngalongila, “Lende ndi lilaghalikilo lya Bhambo Chapanga, ntola kibaba chimo cha mana kibhekwa ku nhwalo gwa kibhelukwa chikipakuhika, kupala bhaghabhona mabumunda ghinimpila kunjenga kipinde chinimmohita ku kilambo chuku Michile.” <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Mucha ngannobholila Alune, “Ntola ligudiliya na nnekela kibaba chimo ya mana na kuibheka palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ibhekwa kwa nhwalo gwa ibheluko hito ihika.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha, ndi Alune pahikita na kubheka mu Lichanduko lya Lilaghano. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Akaichilahele ngabhalila mana kwa yaka makome ncheche, ade pabhahikita mupakane mwa Kaanane mu kilambo chibhatama bhando. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Chakulya cha mana kipemo cha ibaba nane, kikibha kipemo chikilengana na kipemo chikiyobhakile cha Efa.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Mache ghipita pilindalabho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 20:1-13">Kibhalango 20:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Kubhoke kunjenga jha Chine, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhatyangita chehemo jhimo ade jhenge ngita chabhalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga, ngabhabheka kighono ku Lefidimo. Nambo kwenio kwakibha jhe na mache gha kunywegha. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Yene, bhando ngabhakokelekela Mucha ngabhalonge, “Mutupe mache gha kunywegha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Mucha ngajhangwila, “Nike chimingokelekela nenga? Kilebhe ghane minyigha Bhambo Chapanga naha?”<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Nambo bhando bhakibha na nyota hake, ngabhajhendelela kunkokeleke Mucha kulonge, “Kilebhe ghane chimitubhohiki ku Michile? Bho, mpakutukoma twenga na yana hito na ipugho hito kwa nyota?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Peniya, Mucha ngannelila Bhambo Chapanga akilonge, “Nandenda nike kwa bhando bhamba? Ngohe bhabhandakii kunkong'onda maghanga.”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Bhambo Chapanga nganyangwila Mucha, “Peta mumalongo gha bhando matola ighogholo na nnongolela palonge, hele ntola nkongocho mulubhoko lwino lola lwa mbulila lukemba Naile. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Kwenio nenga nanyema palonge jhino pilindalabho lya Holebo, na mwenga nambula lindalabho lyene na mache naghapita mwenio na bhando nabhanywa.” Peniya Mucha ngateila yene palonge jha ighogholo ya Akaichilahele.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Bhahe, chehemo jhenie Mucha ngapakema, “Macha,” mana jhake “Kujhigha,” na Meliba, mana jhake “Kukokelekeya,” nhwalo Akaichilahele bhakankokalikii na kunyigha Chapanga, bhalongila, “Bho, chakaka Bhambo Chapanga abhii pamonga na twenga?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhahoto Akameleke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Akameleke ngabhahika na kwajhingilila Akaichilahele kwenio ku Lefidimo. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Mucha ngannobholila Yochuwa, “Nhaghule akanalome nnyende nabho makakomane na Akameleke. Kilabho nannyema pikilegheleghe cha kitombe kongo nkamwile nkongocho ghola gwa Chapanga.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Bhahe, Yochuwa ngateila ngita chalaghilwa na Mucha, ngajhenda kukomana na Akameleke. Yene Mucha na Alune na Hule ngabhakwela pikilegheleghe cha kukitombe. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Mucha patondobhiya lubhoko kunane, Akaichilahele ngabhahotola kwabula Akameleke. Nambo pahulwiya lubhoko Akameleke ngabhahotola kwabula Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Nambo mabhoko gha Mucha pighatotakila, Alune na Hule ngabhaheghakiya lighanga pahina na Mucha na jwene ngatamila. Peniya ngabhajhinula mabhoko ghake jhumo lubhoko lwalelo na jhonge lwangejha. Yene mabhoko gha Mucha ngaihighilika nganganga ade palitipika lyobha. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Yene, Yochuwa na bhando bhake ngabhahotola kwabula Akameleke.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Makajhandike kilebhe chenje lakwahotola Akameleke mu kitabo kibhehe chukukombokela. Kabhele munnobholela Yochuwa mbakwakomelekeya pyepye Akameleke pannema.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Mucha ngachengita chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko na kukikema, “Bhambo Chapanga ndi Bendela jhango,” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Mucha ngalongila, “Ntondobhiya bendela jha Bhambo Chapanga! Bhambo Chapanga nakomana na Akamaleke kibheluko kwa kibheluko machiko ghoha ghangapeta!”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Yetulo ityangii Mucha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Bhahe, Yetulo, nkoano mundo Mucha, jwakibha mpiya litambiko jwa ku Mediane, ngajhoha ilebhe ya Chapanga ya ntendela Mucha na Akaichilahele pibhabhoha mu kilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Yene, Yetulo ngajhenda kwa Mucha abhii na Chipulo nhwana gwa Mucha kwa Mucha. Nhwalo Mucha akannekite kwa tatemundo Yetulo nkoano mundo, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />pamonga na yana ibhele ya Mucha. Mwana jwa litibho akemitwa Gelishomu. Mucha akampeki liina lende nhwalo akalongii, “Ndilile mu kilambo cha kighene.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Jwaubhele akemitwa Eliezeli, kwa nhwalo Mucha akalongi, “Chapanga jwa tate gwango ndi jwandangatii nenga, ngotoka kukomwa na Falao.” <verse eid="EXO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Bhahe, Yetulo ngahika pamonga na nhwana mundo Mucha na yana ibhele, ngakolila Mucha kunjenga pabhekite kighono pahina na kitombe cha Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Mucha palobholilwa kubhehe nkoano gwake pamonga na nhwana gwake na yana yake ibhele bhihika, <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />ngabhoka na kujhenda kumpoke nkoano mundo, ngalita na kunkumbatila. Ngibhajhambuchina na peniya ngabhajhingila mu Lihema lya Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Mucha nganchimulila nkoano mundo ilebhe yoha Bhambo Chapanga yabhatendila Falao na Akamichile nhwalo gwa Akaichilahele. Hele nganobholila malagho ghoha ghighapitii mu mwanja na Bhambo Chapanga chabhakombwila. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yetulo ngahanganichwa hake kwa ghoha ghatei Bhambo Chapanga nhwalo gwa Akaichilahele, kwa kwakombola mu mabhoko gha Akamichile. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Peniya Yetulo ngalongila, “Alombwe Bhambo Chapanga jwankombwila mu mabhoko gha Akamichile na kubhoka muubhanda gwa Falao. Alombe Bhambo Chapanga jwakombwile bhando kubhoka mu mabhoko gha Akamichile. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Ngohe nimanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga ndi nkolongwa kupeta ichapanga yoha, nhwalo abhakombwile bhando bhamba mu mabhoko gha Akamichile, bhando bheniya bhantendila ilebhe yangandango. <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Peniya, nkoano gwa Mucha, ngannetila Chapanga litambiko lya kukomelekeya na matambiko ghange. Alune ngahika na ighogholo ya Akaichilahele na kulye pamonga na Yetulo kunhwalo jha kunnomba Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhaghulilwa kwa akakenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 1:9-18">Kombokela 1:9-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Lichiko lyalikengima, Mucha ngatama kuhadabula malola gha Akaichilahele, na bhene bhajhakuntindikiya kongo bhajhemita kuhumi lukela ade kimiye. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Yetulo nkoano gwa Mucha palolita ilebhe yoha yatendita Mucha kwa Akaichilahele, ngakonyita, “Kilebhe ghane mwatende bhando yene? Kilebhe ghane chimitemu kanjika kongo bhando bhanyemilii kuhumi lukela ade kimiye?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Mucha nganyangwila, “Nhwalo bhando bhihika kwa nenga kupala bhamanye chakipala Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Nhwalo, anda bhabhii na bhulo ghoghoha bhihika kwa nenga, nanenga nahadabula na kwabhola mihilo na malaghalikilo gha Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Bhahe, Yetulo ngannobholila Mucha, “Mwe majhoghana bhando. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Mwenga mikitoto jhajhe, lihengo lyene linonoho mihoto jhe kuhenga kanjika. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Ngohe unyokanakiye chinongela, na Chapanga atangatila, mwenga nnyendelela kulonge na Chapanga na kunnobholela Chapanga malola ghabhe. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Mabhola mihilo na malaghalikilo gha Chapanga na kwalangi chibhipalwa kutama na kuhenga. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Kabhele nhaghula bhando bhubhabhii na uhotolo panakate jhabhe, bhando bhubhinyinami Chapanga na bhibhahobholeka na bhubhikana chwinda, bheniya ndi bhipalwa kulongocha malongo gha bhando maelufo na makunde gha bhando makome kome na makunde gha bhando makome nhwano na likunde lya bhando likome limo. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Bheniya, ndi nabhatemula malagho gha bhando kila lichiko. Ghighalimba nabhannetela mwenga, nambo majhojhoho nabhatemula bhene. Kukutenda naha, lihengo lino nalibha lijhojhoho kwa kwakutangatila nabho. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Anda ndehi naha, ngita Chapanga chaalaghii pena mwe nantokelela jhe na bhando bhoha nabhahotola kubhujha ukajhabhe njelembo.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Bhahe, Mucha ngateila ngita nkoano mundo chalongila. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Mucha ngahaghula bhando bhubhabhii na uhotolo panakate jha Akaichilahele, ngabhatenda kubhe akatumiche bha nchambe bha bhando maelufo na bhando mamiyamamiya na bhando makome nhwano na bhando makome kome na likome. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Bheniya ngabhatemulina bhando kila lichiko. nambo ghighalimba bhannetila Mucha na majhojhoho ngabhatemulina bhene.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Yene, Mucha ngabhatabhukina na Yetulo nkoano mundo, na jwene nkoano mundo ngabhujhita ku kilambo chake.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele ku kitombe Chinae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Lichiko lya kutumbula lya mwehe gwa utato Akaichilahele kuhumi pibhabhokita mu kilambo chuku Michile, ngabhahikita kunjenga jha Chinae. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Pubhabhokita ku Lefidimu kuhika kunjenga ku Chinae, ngabhabheka kighono palonge jha kitombe Chinae. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Bhahe, Mucha ngakwelita kukongana na kukilegheleghe cha kitombe cha Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:3">Kwenio Bhambo Chapanga ngakemita Mucha kuhumi ku kitombe chela ngannobholila, “Naha ndi namalobholela ibheluko ya Yakobu, bhena Akaichilahele.”<verse eid="EXO 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />Mabhene nnolite chinatendila Akamichile, nikankwapwii mangota ngita kingocho chikighegha yana yake kwa mapapanilo ghake, nganinnetita kwa nenga. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Ngohe anda nnyokanikiye lilobhe lyango na kulikamu lilaghano lyango, namma mabhando bhango bhukuhaghulilwa kupeta ilambo yoha, nhwalo nnema ghoha ndi gwango. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Mangota namma kwango unahota nkolongwa na upiya litambiko na kilambo cha nyahinyahi. Malobhe ghanga ndi mipalwa kwalobholela Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Bhahe, Mucha ngahelila, nakwakema ighogholo bha Akaichilahele na kwalobholela malobhe ghoha ghalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Bhando bhoha ngabhajhangwila kwa pamonga, “Natutenda kila kilebhe chalongile Bhambo Chapanga.” Peniya, Mucha ngannobholila Bhambo Chapanga malobhe ghanga.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nahika kwino mu lihunde tyoo, kupala bhando bhajhoha pinilonge na mwenga, na Akaichilahele bhahoto kunnyokanikiya na kunhobholela machiko ghoha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">Peniya Mucha ngannobholila Bhambo Chapanga ghibhalongila bhando.<verse eid="EXO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nnyenda kwa bhando ubhalobholelele bhakijhelebhule deleno na kilabho. Mwalobholela bhapula ngobho yabhe, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />pamalabho bhakilenganikiya, nhwalo lichiko lyene ndi Bhambo Chapanga nahuluka kuhuma kitombe chaku Chinae na bhando bhoha nabhammona. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Kabhele mwabhekela bhando lulembo kutindii kitombe. Namalakalila bhakotoka kukwela kunane ku kitombe, hilu kupapaha muupele jha kitombe. Mundo jhojhoha jwapakupapaha kitombe chakaka nakomwa. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Mundo jhojhoha akoto kumpapaha mundo jweno, jweno nakomwa kwa maghanga amu mahonga abhaha mundo amu kinyama nalama jhe. Kipinde lipenenga palipakulela changapomolela, bhando bhoha nabhaheghelela pikitombe.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Bhahe, Mucha ngahelila na kwajhendela bhando, bhakijhelebhule, na bhene ngabhapulita ngobho yabhe. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Peniya, ngabhalobholila bhando bhoha, “Pamalabho mikilenganikiya na munalome jhojhoha angagholoka jhe na mwikeghe.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Bhahe, pamalabho lukela nakupitila nakumetameta na nnindimilo na mbamba na lihunde tyoo kunane ku kitombe. Helahela ngaijhokanikika lilobhe likolongwa lya lipenenga, lyene ngalyalendemecha kila mundo jwabhi pikighono. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhalongwiya bhando kuhumii ku kighono, ngabhajhawila kukongana na Chapanga, na bhene ngabhajhema muupele jha kitombe. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Kitombe ngakiyekelilwa na lyohe nhwalo gwa Chapanga ahuluka panane jhake mu mwotu. Lyohe lya mwotu gwenio ngaluukilila kunane ngita lyohe lilipita mulitanule likolongwa na kitombe choha ngakilendima hake, <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />lilobhe lya lipenenga ngalichochita hake, peniya Mucha ngalongila na Chapanga. Chapanga ngajhangwila kwa mbamba. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Bhambo Chapanga ngahulwike kukilegheleghe cha kitombe chenie, ngakemita Mucha ajhende kukitombe, Mucha ngakwelita kukitombe. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nhelela makahibhilikiye bhando bhangahomba jhe lulembo kumbala kummona, anda nahi jhe bhamahena, nabhawa. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Ata akapiya matambiko bhibhamandikila bhipalwa bhakijhelebhuha hote. Anda nahi jhe nenga Bhambo Chapanga chinimbula.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Mucha ngannobholila Bhambo Chapanga, “Bhando bhamba bhihoto ng'o kukwela kitombe Chinae, nhwalo mabhene ngamutulobholela kubhehe makatubhekii mupaka kutindii kitombe na kutubheka kutale ngita chehemo nyahinyahi.”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nhelele makantole Alune uhike nako. Nambo mahibhiliila akapiya matambiko na bhando bhange kuhika kongo, anda nahi jhe chinimbula.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Bhahe, Mucha ngahelila na kwalobholela Akaichilahele ilebhe yalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo kome</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Kombokela 5:1-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Chapanga ngalongila na ghanga ndi ghalongila, <verse eid="EXO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, jhunimohita ku kilambo chuku Michile, kwamikibha makabhanda.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Mangaijhinami jhe ichapanga henge nambo nenga tugha.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Manganandanikii jhe Chapanga na ichapanga yukubhacha amu chochoha chakibhii kunane kwa Chapanga, hilu chikibhii mu nnema amu umache pahe jha nnema. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Mangaijhinamii jhe hilu kuitumikila ichapanga. Nhwalo nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga gwino jwamii na wiho. Jhunihadabula yana kwa nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwa akatate gwabhe, ade kibheluko chuutato na cha ncheche. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Nambo anda mimbala nakamula mihilo jhango, na nenga nanangiya upalo gwango nkolo kwa ibheluko elufo ya bhala bhibhambala, na kukamuu malaghilo ghango.”<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />Mangalikema jhe jhajhe liina lya Bhambo Chapanga gwino. Nhwalo nenga Bhambo Chapanga naneka jhe kunhadabula mundo jwalikema liina lyango jhajhe.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />Mulikomboka Lichiko lya Kupomolela, na mulijhelebhula. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Machiko chita nhenga mahengo na ghange. <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />Nambo Lichiko lya chaba, ndi Lichiko lya Kupomolela lya nenga Bhambo Chapanga gwino. Lichiko lyene nkotoka kuhenga lihengo lyolyoha mwenga hilu mwana gwino, hilu kamwale gwino hilu ntumiche gwino munalome amu mwikeghe, hilu kinyama chino cha kukoleka hilu nng'ene jwabhii nkate jha miche jhino. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Nhwalo machiko chita nenga Bhambo Chapanga nikapangine kunane kwa Chapanga na nnema na mbwane na yoha yaibhii, yene nikapomolii lichiko lya chaba. Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngalipela mota lichiko lya Kupomolela na ngalijhelewila.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Mwatembekeya tate gwino na majhe gwino, nantama machiko twe mu kilambo chinimpela nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.” <verse eid="EXO 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Mangakoma jhe.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Mangatenda jhe ngongola.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Mangajhibha jhe.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Mangalonge jhe uwange kwa nnyino.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Manganoghe jhe nyumba jha nnyino, hilu nhwana mundo, hilu ntumiche gwake munalome amu mwikeghe, hilu ng'ombi jwake hilu maponda ghake na chochoha chabhii nacho nnyino.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhipwelela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 5:22-33">Kombokela 5:22-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Bhando ngabhajhogwipa na kulendema pibhajhohina nnindimilo na mbamba na lipenenga palihonitwa na pakitombe pahukita lyohe, peniya ngabhajhemita kutale. <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />Ngabhannobholila Mucha, “Chonde nnongele na twenga natunyokanikiya, nambo nkotokunneka Chapanga alonge na twenga, anda nahi jhe natuwa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Mucha ngabhalobholila, “Mangajhoghopa jhe, nhwalo Chapanga ahikite kunnyigha kupala nnyendelela kunnyokanikiya jwene machiko ghoha ghangapeta na nkotokutenda uhakaho.” <verse eid="EXO 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Nambo bhando ngabhajhendilila kujhema kutale kipinde Mucha paliheghalila lihunde lela lyakibha Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghalikilo lya chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Malobholela ghanga Akaichilahele, ‘Mabhene nnolite kubhehe nikalongii na mangota kuhumii kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Nenga ndi jwa kunnyinamila kanjika, hilu mangalenganiki jhe ichapanga ya madine gha feza hilu ichapanga ya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Mangota naunjengela chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ka mandope chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko na panane jhake naundambikila mambelele ghino amu ng'ombi hino ngita litambiko lyukukomelekeya na lya uteeke. Ntenda yene kila chehemo pimbakuhaghula kupala mangota unnyinamila nenga, papa nahika na kwape mota. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Anda chehemo jhenie nanchenga kwa maghanga, bhahe maghanga gheniya nkoto kubhacha. Nhwalo anda ntumii yombo ya kubhachila maghanga namuitenda ikoto kujheketelwa palonge jhango. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Mangatengenecha jhe ngache chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko, nhwalo mundo jwa pahe naghabhona makengele ghino.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo kunhwalo gwa akabhanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Kombokela 15:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Ghanga ndi malaghalikilo ghimipalwa malobholela Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />Anda munhemile mmanda Mwibulaniya nantumikila kwa yaka chita, nambo chaka cha chaba nabhaa mahulo nu kubhoka changa malepo ghoghoha. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Anda anhemililwa changatolela mwikeghe, abhoka kanjika. Nambo anda ahikita nu nhwana mundo, abhoka nuhwanamundo. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Anda munahota gwake akantolekii mwikeghe, nu kupata yana ikeghe pange jhe inalome, bhahe, mwikeghe jwenio na yana yake nabhaha ya munahota gwake, na mmanda jwenio nabhoka kanjika. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Nambo mmanda jwenio anda alongi, nimpala munahota gwake, nu nhwana mundo na yana yake anda mbaijhe kujhenda nukubhehe mahulo, <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />bhahe, munahota gwake ampeleka chehemo palonge jha Chapanga. Kwenio najhemekwa pannyango nukuhotola lichikilo lyake kwa luchungulo. Jwenio najhendelela kubhehe mmanda utamo gwake gwoha.”<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />Mundo anda anchulwiche kamwale gwake kubhehe mmanda, kamwale jwenio nalekekelwa jhe mahulo ngita chibhabhehe akabhanda akanalome. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Anda munahota jwenio jwanhemile abhaha jhumo jwa akakeghe bhake, peniya ngalekita kumpala, munahota jwenio nannekela tate gwake ankombole. Munahota jwenio ahoto jhe kunchulucha kwa bhando bha ilambo henge, nhwalo nahobholeka jhe. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Anda mundo anhemile mmanda mwikeghe nu kuntolanikiya mwana mundo, jwanhemile kamwale jwenio antendela ngita mwana mundo. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Anda antolii mwikeghe jhonge, angaleka jhe kumpe chakulya nhwanamundo jhukutumbula na ngobho nukujhendele kugholoka nako ngita chateila pibhatolina. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Anda nu kumpe jhe mambu gheniya matato, bhahe, mwikeghe jwenio akibhokela nu kubhehe mahulo changamalepo ghoghoha.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo kwa bhando bhibhakomana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwambula nnyake nu kunkoma na jwenie ipalwa akomwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Nambo anda ntei kwa namii jhe, peniya nkoma jwenio atilila chehemo pinipahagwile kupala abhaha ghome kwenio. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Nambo mundo anda anyingilile namiye nu kunkoma, ata abhutukila chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, mumwoye kwenio nu munkome.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwapakumbula tate mundo amu majhemundo, ipalwa akomwa.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Jwampukii mundo kupala kunchulucha nu kuntenda mmanda gwake, ipalwa akomwa.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Jhojhoha jwannyope likoto tate mundo amu majhe mundo, ipalwa akomwa.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Anda bhando bhabhele bhakomine, na jhumo ambulite nnyake kwa lighanga amu lingume changankoma, nambo ankocholine ade kulwalwa nu kugholoka pakindanda, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />anda jwenio jwambulitwe abhiinjelembo pandina na kuhoto kuchepelela kwa nkongocho, jwenio jwakochuline nnyake nalekekewa. Nambo nanepa machiko ghagholwike pikindanda, na ipalwa anwaha ade papa kulama.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Anda mundo ambulite mmanda gwake munalome anda jhe mwikeghe kwa luyato nu kunkoma papa, ipalwa ahadabulwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Nambo mmanda jwenio abhii ghome kwa lichiko limo amu mabhele, munahota gwake nahadabulwa jhe. Nhwalo kunwaha mmanda jwenio tela nukuhadabulwa.”<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />Anda akanalome bhakomine nu kunkocholana mwikeghe jhuna ndumbo ade ndumbo jhake kuhangabhika, panga kibhengo chenge, jhola jwankochwile mwikeghe jwenio nalepechwa malepo ngita chapala unganamundo na nnyomola mihalo chapakunhadabula. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Nambo anda ghapitii indokole henge kwa mwikeghe jwenio, jwatei gheniya malepo ghake ughome kwa ughome. <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />liho kwa liho na lino kwa lino na lubhoko kwa lubhoko na lugholo kwa lugholo, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />kujhochwa mwotu kwa kujhochwa mwotu na libhanga kwa libhanga na lindulumiya kwa lindulumiya.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />Mundo anda ambulite mmanda gwake munalome amu mwikeghe nu kulihangabhana liho lyake, annekekeya mahulo ngita malepo gha liho lyake. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Hele, anda ambulite ade kunkolopola lino mmanda gwake munalome amu mwikeghe, annekekeya mahulo kwa kunnepa kunhwalo jha lino lyake.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo ku nhwalo gwa bhibhakoleka inyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />Ng'ombi anda ankungite mundo kwa linyelo nu kunkoma, ng'ombi jwenio nakomwa kwa maghanga na nyama jhake mangalye jhe. Nkolo ng'ombi nabhajhe na lilemwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Nambo anda ng'ombi jwenio ayobhalii kwakunga manyelo bhando, nkolo ng'ombi ngalobholilwa nambo ankongiti jhe, anda ng'ombi jwenio akomite mundo kabhele ade abhulwa maghanga na nkolo ng'ombi akomwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Nambo, mundo jwenio anda alepichwe malepo kupala kughombola ughome gwake, nkolo ng'ombi ipalwa alepa malepo ghoha ghighapalwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Ng'ombi anda ankungite manyelo mwana munalome amu mwikeghe, luhadabulo lwake lolo. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Anda ng'ombi ankungite manyelo mmanda munalome amu mwikeghe, nkolo ng'ombi nanepa nkolo mmanda jwenio mbijha ipande makome matato, na ng'ombi jwenio ipalwa akomwe kwa kubulwa maghanga.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />Mundo anda alilekite libhomba lyangahyekelela amu ahembite libhomba ahyekelii jhe, peniya ng'ombi amu liponda litumbukile mwenio, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />jwahembita libhomba, ipalwa annepa nkolo kinyama chenio, na kinyama chikiwile kibhaha chake jwenio jwahembite libhomba. <verse eid="EXO 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />Ng'ombi jwa mundo anda ankungite ng'ombi jwa mundo jhonge nu kunkoma, pena, nabhachulucha ng'ombi jwabhii ghome jhola, nu kubhaghana mbijha yake, helahela nabhabhaghana nyama jha ng'ombi jwawii jhola. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Nambo anda ng'ombi jwenio akayobhalile kwakunga ajhabhe manyelo na nkolo ankongite jhe, nkolo ng'ombi ipalwa alepwa ng'ombi jhonge. Na ng'ombi jwawile nahighalika kubhehe jwake.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Lilaghalikilo likunnepa nnyino jwannemwiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />Mundo anda ajhibhite ng'ombi amu limbelele na kuchinja amu kunchulucha, jwenio alepechwa ng'ombi nhwano kwa kila ng'ombi na mambelele ncheche kwa kila limbelele. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Mwiye anda bhankolii ajhibha munyumba, nu kummula ade kuwegha, jwakomite abhehe jhe na matakalilo. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Nambo mwiye jwenio anda akamwilwe lyobha likapitagha nu kukomwa, jwenio jwankomite nabhaha na matakalilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">Mwiye jwenio ipalwa alepechwa. Anda akwetii jhe kilebhe chukulepa, jwene achuluchwa kughombola bwiye gwake. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />“Anda kinyama chikijhibhitwe bhakikolii kwa jwajhibhite chamela ghome, peniya jwajhibhite alepechwa pabhele, ibhaha ng'ombi amu liponda amu limbelele.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Mundo anda alekekii inyama yake mung'onda gwa michabibo, amu inyama yake alichikii munng'onda gwa nnyake, jwenio nalepa ilebhe yambone kulepechela ilyeghwitwe yumunghonda amu kulepa ng'onda gwake gwa michabibo.”<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />Peniya anda mundo abhabhakii nng'onda gwake nu kujhendelela ade kutiniya ilebhe ya mundo jhonge ibhii munng'onda, anda jhe nng'onda gwoha utinike, jwabhabhakii mwoto jwenio ipalwa alepa malepo kwa ilebhe itinike.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Mundo annekii nnyake mbijha amu ilebhe antunjile, anda kikwatulilwe unyumba jhake, jwakwatwile akamwilwe ipalwa alepa pabhele kwa ilebhe yakwatwile. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Nambo jwakwatwile amanyikine jhe, nkolo nyumba aheghelela chehemo jhuku nnyinamila Chapanga kupala kulangiya jwenio abhii jhe mulukwatulo lya ilebhe ya nnyake.<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Anda pabhii na mitaho kunhwalo gwa ng'ombi amu liponda amu limbelele amu ngobho amu kilebhe chochoha chikiobhite, na kila mundo ilonge chake, bheniya bhipalwa bhaletwa chehemo jha kunnyinamila Chapanga. Chapanga nanangiya jwalemwite, na jhonio nanepa nnyake pabhele.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Mundo anda ampeki liponda nnyake amu ng'ombi amu limbelele amu kipugho chenge chochoha ankoleke, anda kiwile amu akochilwe amu atolitwe changabhona mundo, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />ipalwa ajhenda chehemo pakunnyinamila Chapanga na kulapila kulangii abhii jhe mulukwatulo lwenio, anda nkolo kinyama chenie akajheketile kulapila kwenio, na nnyake jwenio nalepa jhe malepo ghoghoha. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Nambo anda kinyama kikibha kikwatulilwe kwa jwenio jwakwatwile, ipalwa anepa nkolo kinyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Anda kinyama chenie kikomitwe na kinyama chukujhoghoha chukumanyahe, mundo jwenio jwakolika ipalwa aleta nyama jhiighalike ngita uchaide. Nalepa jhe malepo ghoghoha ghala nhwalo kinyama chenio kilegwitwe na kinyama chukumanyahe.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Mundo anda ajhaike kinyama kwa nnyake, na kinyama chenio anda kikocholilwe amu kiwile na nkolo kinyama abhii jhe, jwajhaike ipalwa annepa nkolo kinyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Nambo anda nkolo kinyama abhii papa, mmanya jwajhaike jhola nalepa jhe chochoha chela. Anda kinyama kikibha chukukodicha, jwenie nkolo kinyama napokela tugha mbijha yuku kodicha.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo gha kutama na bhando mbone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Mundo anda annoite kamwale jwangakongana na munalome na jwangatolelwa, nu kugholoka nako, ipalwa annepela inyaghabhule nu kuntolela kamwale jwenio. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Nambo anda tate jwa kamwale jwenio akanite kuntolanikicha kamwale jwake, mundo jwenio ipalwa alepa inyaghabhule kwa kamwale jwangakongana na munalome.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Manganneka jhe mwikeghe jhojhoha nhwabhe alame.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwaitenda ngongola na kinyama ipalwa akomwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Mundo jhojhoha jwaipiikiya litambiko ichapanga henge kunneka kumbiikiya ne Bhambo Chapanga, jwenio ipalwa akomwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Mangammone jhe nng'ene amu kung'aha, nhwalo mangota hele mikibha akaghene kukilambo chuku Michile. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Mangang'aha jhe nawela amu mundo nkebha. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Anda mabhonile bheniya na bheniya anda bhannelile nenga, chakaka kulela kwabhe nannyoha, <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />na lilaka lyango nalibhaha likolongwa, nankomwa kungondo, na akahana bhino nabhabha akanawela na yana ino naibhaha ikebha.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Anda munyaikiche mbijha mundo jhojhoha pakate jha bhando bhango akanhocho, mangannongama jhe hilu mangantocha jhe mbijha yukujhonjekeya. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Anda ntoile ngobho ya nnyino ngita pone, mipalwa mmujhichila lyobha nukutipika jhe, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />nhwalo ngobho jhake ndi jhejhe tugha, ndi jhapakukiyeka. Miwacha nakiyeka nike? Anda annelile kupala utangatilo, chakaka naninnyokanikiya nu kuntangatila nhwalo nenga mmii na kiya.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Mangannigha jhe Chapanga, hilu kunnigha ntumiche gwino.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Mangaleka jhe kupiya lipungu lyango kubhoke mujholoke gwa ilebhe na divaye jhino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">Umbela nenga yana hino inalome yalitibho.<verse eid="EXO 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Ntenda hele naha kwa inyama yalitibho lya ng'ombi na mambelele ghino gha nkambako. Mikileka kinyama cha litibho na majhe mundo kwa machiko chaba, na lichiko lya nane unetela nenga.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Mangota namma ndi mabhando bhanhagwile. Yene, mangalye jhe nyama jha kinyama chikikomitwe na kinyama chukumanyahe. Nyama jwenio mitaghila ghimbwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Matendelo ghighapwa kuntende mundo na kinyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Mangachimulila jhe mihalo jhuwange. Nkoto kuntangatila mundo mmoho kukupiya uchaide ghuwange. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Mangahutilwa jhe na lilongo lya bhando bhanganandela na kuhenga ghanganandela, hilu mangautilwa jhe na lilongo lya bhando kukupiya uchaide ghuwange paudamo gwa mihalo kupala kuibhangana uchakaka. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Mangahegheme jhe mundo nhwocho mu mihalo jhake.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Anda muiwene ng'ombi amu liponda lya likoko lino lihobhite, mupeleka kwa jwenie. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Anda mulikolii liponda lya mundo jwanchimwa ligwile na nhwigho gwake, mtangatila mundo jwenio kulijhinula liponda lyake hilu mangalileka jhe nu kujhenda.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Mangayelangana jhe mu mihalo jha mundo nhwocho. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Mangahadabu jhe mundo kuwange hilu mangakoma jhe bhando bhangalemwa amu bhambone, nhwalo nenga nanekekeya jhe mundo jwanganandela. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Mangapoke jhe chwinda, nhwalo chwinda jhatenda bhando bhakoto kulola na kwatenda bhahadabula changapalwa.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Mangantende jhe gwanganandela nng'ene, nhwalo mangota mabhene umanye pimibhehe maghene, mana mikibha akaghene kukilambo chuku Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaka chaba na lichiko lya chaba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />Kila chaka mu kipinde cha yaka chita, nampanda mu mighonda jhino nu kuhuna mahuno ghake. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Nambo chaka cha chaba, mileka mighondo jhino changapanda mbejho, kupala akahocho bhibhabhii pakate jhino bhalokota chakulya chikiighalike mwenio. Na henge ipakuighala milekela inyama yukumanyahe ilya. Ntenda hele naha mu mighonda jha michabibo na micheitune.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Kwa machiko chita nhenga mahengo ghino, nambo lichiko lya chaba mpomolela, kupala akabhanda bhino na akatumiche akaghene bhapomolela na ng'ombi hino na maponda ghino ghapomolela hele.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Mughakamula ghoha ghininnobholile. Mangajhinamii ichapanga henge ata maina ghabhe mangaghalonge jhe. Peniya henga gheniya ghoha ghaninobholile, hilu mangailonge jhe.”<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minyagho mikolongwa mitato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 34:18-26">Kubhoka 34:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">Kombokela 16:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Kila chaka mmeka minyagho patato kupala umba ichima nenga. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Mmeka unyagho gwa mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule ngita chininaghila. Milyangana mabumunda jhangangedule kwa kipinde cha machiko chaba ghighapangwitwe kwa mwehe gwa Abibo, yane mwehe gwa ncheche, nhwalo kwa mwehe gwenio ghummokita ku Michile. Mundo jhojhoha angaika jhe kunnyinamila changakilebhe mulubhoko.<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Unyagho ghongo utendeka kubhoke mumahuno gha kutumbula kubhoke muilebhe jhimpatite munng'onda gwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">Na unyagho ghongo chautendika mu mahuno ghino gha kujhomolela kubhoke munng'onda gwino.<verse eid="EXO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Kila chaka patato akanalome nabhakongana nnonge jhango ne Nabhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Pumpiya litambiko li kinyama mangaleta jhe pamonga na kabumunda kikalekwii ngedule. Na mahuta ntiniya mangahighaya jhe mahuta gha kinyama cha unyagho gwango ade lichiko lilikengama lukela.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Kila chaka nneta mahuno ghakutumbula kuhuma chehemo jhukunyinamii nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">Mangatutu jhe kinyama cha litohe li limbelele amu litohe lya mbuhe mu mabhele gha majhemundo.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghano na malaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Jhokanikiya, nenga nintuma ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga annongolele umwanja kupala annonde nu kuntenda nhwikengane kukilambo chininenganikile. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Mnyokanikiya nu kuntembekeya chimpakunnobholela, hilu mangankanii jhe, jwenio nannekeke jhe uhakaho gwino, nhwalo ne ndi jhunintumite. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Nambo anda munyokanakiye nu kutenda ghoha ghannaghalikiye, nangomana na akamakoko bhino. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Ntumiche jwango jwa kunane kwa Chapanga nannongoya nu kuntenda nhwika kukilambo cha Akaamole na Akaahite na Akaahive na Akayebuche, na nenga nanakoma bheniya bhoha. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Kwenio mangalita jhe nnonge jha ichapanga yabhe nu kuijhinamila, hilu mangajhigha jhe ilebhe yabhe. Nambo namuikomelekeya njwe na kuhangabhana heke ibhajhinamila.<verse eid="EXO 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />“Unyinamila nenga tugha Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino, nannenga nanimpela mota ilebhe na mache namoya hele malwalo ghoha pakate jhino. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Abhii jhe mwikeghe jhojhoha jwapakutengekela ndumbo hilu kubhehe ntonga mukilambo chino. Nane nanimpela machiko twe gha kulama.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Nameka bhando bhibhankana, bhanyoghope hake. Peniya, natenda akamakoko bhino bhaghalambuke nu kuntila. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Nambeleka manyigwa palonge jhino kwabhenga akamakoko bhino, Akahive na Akakaanane na Akahite bhabhoke palonge jhino. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Nambo nabhenga jhe bhando bheniya kwa chaka chimo, kupala kilambo changaigha jhe jhajhe na inyama yukumanyahe kujhonjeke kubhehe ndii hake nu kunyingilii mangota. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Bheniya nanabhenga kachokokachoko ade pumpa kujhonjekeka nu kubhehe twe nukujhenela mukilambo chenio. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />Mipaka jha kilambo chino ibhaha kubhoke kumbwane jha Chamo ade kumbwane jha Meditelaniya, nu kubhoke kunjenga ade kulukemba Efulate, nhwalo nimpeke makakala kwahoto bhando bhikilambo chenio, na mangota namabhenga na bhene nabhantila. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Mangabheka jhe lilaghano lyolyoha lela pamonga na bheniya, mangabheka jhe lilaghano lyolyoha na bheniya hilu ichapanga jhabhe. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Mangaleka jhe bhatame mukilambo chino kupala bhajhingiye muhakaho, nhwalo anda mijhinamii ichapanga jhabhe, chakaka gwenio naubhaha ntambo ghukunkoma.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Akaichilahele bhijheketela lilaghano lya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nhwikangane kwango kukitombe, mwenga na Alune na Nadabo na Abiu, pamonga na akanahota chabine bha Akaichilahele, ntama nu kunnyinamila. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Mwe ma Mucha kanjika ndo ndi yumbakunheghelela, nambo bhange bhanganheghelela jhe, na Akaichilahele bhangahika jhe kukitombe pamonga na mwenga.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Bhahe, Mucha ngajhenda kwalobholela bhando bhoha malobhe na malaghalikilo ghoha Chapanga ghabhalobholile. Bhando bhoha pamonga ngabhalongila, “Mihalo jhoha jhalonge Chapanga natuikamulila.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Mucha ngajhandika malaghalikilo ghoha ghalaghilwa na Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Ngajhimuka putepute kilabho jhake, ngachengita chehemo jhukupiikiya litambiko kwa maghanga muupele jha kitombe ngajhemika heke ya maghanga kome na ibhele, kila luheke lumo tela na likabila limo lya Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhatuma achikangombo bha Akaichilahele bhakapiikiye Bhambo Chapanga litambiko lyukukomelekeya kwa kunchinjii matole gha ng'ombi makambako nu kulye ngita litambiko lya uteeke. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Mucha ngatoila nucho jha myahe jha inyama yene na kubheka mu mabakule, na nucho jhenge ngamichila chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko jhenio. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Peniya, ngatoila kitabo chajhandike malaghalikilo ghoha ghalaghilwa na Chapanga, ngachoma kanonoya palonge jha bhando bhoha. Nabhene ngabhalongila, “Gheniya ghoha ghalonge Bhambo Chapanga natughakamula, natwe natubhaha bhando bhukuntembekeya.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Mucha ngatola myahe jhikibha mu mabakule ghala na kwamichii bhando, nu kulonge, “Myahe jhenje ilangii mulijheketile lilaghano lyenio, Chapanga lyabhekita pamonga na mangota pampilangina malaghalikilo ghanga ghoha.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Peniya, Mucha na Alune na Nadabo na Abiho na akanahota chabine bha Akaichilahele ngabhahowika kukitombe, <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />na bhene ngabhammona Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele. Pahe pajhemite pakibha kilebhe kikolongwa chikitenganichwe kwa maghanga ghighakemwa johale gha lange jha buluu ghighang'ala ngita lihunde. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Chapanga akabhengwite jhe bhando bheniya akatumiche ya Akaichilahele. Chakaka ngabhammona Chapanga, ngabhalila nu kunywelekeya pamonga.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha pikitombe chu ku Chinae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nhwike kwango kunane kukitombe kone. Unendela peniya na nenga nanimpela ibao ibhele ya maghanga, yenio ijhandikwe malaghalikilo na mihilo, kupala mabhola Akaichilahele.” <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Peniya Mucha ngajhenda pamonga na ntumiche gwake Jochuwa, ngajhenda kitombe cha Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Kabula jhukubhoka, Mucha ngabhalobholila akanahota bheniya, “Mutulendelela pamba ade putupakubhujha. Alune na Huli bhabhii pamonga na mangota, mundo jhojhoha jwabhii na malola, ajhendela bheniya.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Mucha ngajhenda kululegheleghe lwa kitombe, na lihunde ngaliyekilila kitombe chenio. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Ung'alicho gwa Chapanga ngauika nu kuyekelela kitombe chenio kwa kipinde cha machiko chita. Lichiko lya chaba Chapanga ngankema Mucha kubhoke panakate jha lihunde lyenio. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Akaichilahele pibhalola gheniya panane jha kitombe ngibhabhona ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ukibha ngita mwotu nkolongwa ghujhaka kwenio. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Mucha ngajhingila mu lihunde lyenio. Ngatama kwenio kwa kipinde cha machiko makome ncheche, muhe na kilo.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Litambiko ku nhwalo gwa hema lya nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:4-9">Kubhoka 35:4-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Malobholele Akaichilahele bhalete hupo, na mwenga nampokela. Nampokela kuhumii kwa bhando bhibhapiya changakangwa. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Mpokela hupo henge, chaabo na madine gha feza na Shaba, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />luche itengenichwe kwa mangoma gha mambelele gha lange jha buluu na chambalao, na ngele na ngobho nhuu ina kuhalala na ngobho itengenichwe kwa mangoma gha mbuhe, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />na mambendela gha kinyama chu umbwane chkikiemwa mupomboo ghighapakwii lange ngele na mambendela gha mbuhe na mbau jha nkongo ghukemwa nchhita, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />na mahuta ku nhwalo jha mule na ndimbililo ya mahuta ghukupakaya nu ubane ghukunungila petelele, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />na maghanga gha bei ngolongwa ghighakemwa shohamo na maghanga ghange, ku nhwalo jha kulembelekeya ngobho jhawala mpiya litambiko panganga na kinpuko cha panganga. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Helahela Akaichilahele bhatengenecha Lihema li Nyahinyahi, kupala nenga ndame panakate jhabhe. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Ntengenecha Lihema lyenio na ilebhe yake yoha ngita limbakunnangiya.”<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichanduko lya Lilaghano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:1-9">Kubhoka 37:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />Akaichilahele bhatengenecha lichanduko lya mbau ya nchita, lilibhii na utandamaho gwake ubhaha chentimeta miya jhimo na likome limo na upana gwake chentimita chitine na chita na kukola kwake kubhaha chentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Milikilima lichanduko lyenie kwa chaabo jhambone nkate na panja nu kulibhinikila chaabo chehemo jhoha. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Peniya militengenechela pete ncheche nu kuwalicha mu makongono ghake, kila lukongono pete jhimo. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Ntengenecha nchegha gwa nnchita nu kukilima chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Michegha jhenio mijhingiya mu pete ibhii pande ibhele ya lichanduko, nhwalo gwa kugheghela lyenio Lichanduko. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Michegha jhenie iighala momo mu pete, jhangabhoka ng'o mwenio. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Nkate jha lichanduko lyenie mmeka ibao ibhele ya maghanga imbakumpe, inyandike mihilo jhango.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Peniya, panane jha lichanduko ntendekeya kiyekelelo cha chaabo jhamaha chikibhii na utandamalo gwake chentimita miya jhimo na likome limo nupana gwake chentimita chitine na chita nuutandamalo gwake chentimita chetine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Helahela nantendekeya ulandano gwa ihumbe ibhele ina mapapanilo kukuyana mukipala, ikemwa makelube, mibheka mujhomokelo gwa kiyekelo kongo na kongo. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Kihumbe chimo kukijhomokela kiyekelelo na chenge kukijhomokela. Mibheka ihumbe yenio ilombane mujhomokelo mu kiyekelo, bhabha kilebhe chimo na chenie kiyekelelo chenio kongo na kongo. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Ihumbe yenio nailoleyana, mapapanilo ghake ghabhaha anda ghimbuluka na kughubika kiyekelelo, miho ghabhe ghalolekeya kiyekelelo chenie. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Nkate jha lichanduko mmeka ibao ibhele ya maghanga nu kubheka kiyekelelo panane jhake. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Nenga nangongana na mwenga peniya, nu kubhoka panane jha kiyekelelo chenie panakate jha ihumbe yenio ibhii panane jha lichanduko, nanongela namwenga peniya nu kumpe mihilo jhoha jha kwalobholela Akaichilahele.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mecha jha mabumunda ghu kumpiikiya litambiko Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:10-16">Kubhoka 37:10-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Ntengenecha mecha jha nkongo gwa nchita, kutandamala kwake kubhaha chentimita makome nane na nane na upana gwake chentimita makome ncheche na ncheche na ukolongwa gwake chentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Mecha jhenie muikilima chaabo jhambone na kutindikii lubiniko lwa chaabo chehemo jhoha. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Peniya, ntindikiya ntengo ghu ubao gwake chentimita chitine na chita, kupala ilebhe yangagwe pahe jhe, kubhoka peniya nkilima chaabo jhambone chehemo jhoha. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Mitengenechela pete ncheche ya chaabo na kuijhingiya muimbokotole yoha mu makongono ghake. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Pete yenie ibhaha pahina na nkoghoto ghutindii mecha na ibhaha yukamulii nchegha jhukugheghe mecha jhenio. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Ntengenecha nchegha jha nkongo gwa nchita nu kupakaya chaabo, michegha jhenie ibhaha jhukugheghe mecha. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Ntengenecha chaane na ikombe yukubheke ubane pamecha na majhage na yombo yukubhekela matambiko ghukunywegha. Yombo yenio yoha ntendekeya kwa chaabo jhambone. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Mecha jhenio mibheka nnonge jha lichanduko lya lilaghano, na panane jha mecha jhenie mmeka mabumunda ghala ghighapiitwa litambiko palonge jhango, machiko ghoha ghangapeta.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilebhe chu kubheke lumule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">Kubhoka 37:17-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Ntengenecha kilebhe chukubheke lumule kwa chaabo jhambone. Kinala chake na kijhemo chake kibhaha kilebhe chimo, ndambi ya kilebhe chenio ndi ikombe yukubheke mahuta na itumba ya malobha ghake, yoha iyanwa mu kilebhe chimo tugha cha chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Mandabhe chita ipitila kila upande gwa kijhemo, mandabhe matato upande ghumo na ndambe itato ghonge upande. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Mu kila lutambe kubhaha ikombe itato ilandana ngita malobha gha mlozi, kila lutambe lumo lundumbache lwake na lilobha lyake. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Na mu kijhemo chenio kubhaha ikombe ncheche ilandana na malobha gha mlozi, pamonga na ndumbache yake ya malobha. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Panakate puipitii mandabhe ghala chita, pahe jhake pabhaha na kihundo chimochimo. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Ihundo yenie na mandabhe ghake ibhaha kilebhe chimo na kilebhe chenio, na choha kiyanwa kwa chaabo jhambone. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Helahela ntengenecha mule chaba nhwalo jha kilebhe chenie nu kubheka panane jhake kupala imulikila nnonge. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Hele ntengenecha nkache nchokombe ghukupiikiya utambe na yahane yakubhehe liho kwa chaabo jhambone. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Ntumiya kilo makome matato nu nhwano jha chaabo jhambone kutendekeya kilebhe chenio na yombo yake. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Chakaka ntendekeya maha tela na chinnaghalikilwa kukitombe kola”<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Lihema lyukunyinamila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kubhoka 36:8-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Pamonga na ghenia ntendekeya Lihema li Nyahinyahi kwa mapanjiya kome gha ngobho nhuo ghina kuhalala ghibhachonite kukulembelekeya kwa luche ya lange jha buluu na chambalau na ngele. Mapanjiya gheniya nnemba kwa kuchonelela micholo ya ihumbe ina mapapanilo ikemwa makelube, lihengo lyenio ahenga jwamanyii kutendekeya. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Kila lipanjiya libhaha nu utandamaho gwake mita kome niibhele na upana gwake mita ibhele. Mapanjiya gheniya ghabhaha na kipimo chimo. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Na nnombanicha mapanjiya nhwano ghabhaha kipande chimo, na mapanjiya nhwano ghabhaha kipande chenge. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Nchonelela kikamulilo cha lange ya buluu miniko jha lipanjiya likujhomolela pikipande chukutumbula, hele nchonelela kumwicho jha miniko jha panja jha lipanjiya. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Mmeka ikamulilo amchine mulipanjiya limo na ikamulilo henge amchine mulipanjiya lenge, ikamulilo jhenie iloleyana. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Peniya, ntendekeya ibanilo amchine ya chaabo yukutabhila kupala kulombanicha ipande ibhele ya mapanjiya gheniya, yene Lihema libhaha kilebhe chimo.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Kabhele tendekeya kiyekelelo chi Lihema lya mapanjiya kome na limo kwa mangoma gha mbuhe. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Mapanjiya kome na limo gheniya, naghabhaha na kipimo chimo utandamaho gwake mita kome niitato na upana gwake mita ibhele. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Maghalombanicha pamonga mapanjiya gheniya nhwano, na mapanjiya chita pamonga. Lipanjiya lya chita lela milibhilinga mala pabhele nnonge jha Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Peniya, mitendekeya ikamulilo amchine mulipanjiya likujhomolela na kipande chukutumbula, na ikamulilo amchine mulipanjiya likujhomolela lya mu kipande chuubhele. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Ntendekeya ibanilo amchine ya shaba yukutabhila nu kujhingiya muikamulilo amchine gheniya kupala kilombwa ipande ibhele mapanjiya, yene kukitenda Lihema libhaha na lipanjiya limo. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Nucho jha kipande cha lipanjiya chela chikihighilike mikikobheka kunyuma jha Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Mapanjiya gha lihema ghabhaha na utandamaho gwa mita jhimo na lipanjiya lilihighilile lining'inila pande yoha mulubhaho lwa Lihema kupala kuyekelela.”<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />Hele ntendekeya iyekelelo ibhele ya Lihema, chimo chilimbendela lijhebhejhalo lya limbelele lyankambako na chenge chilimbendela lijhebhejhelo lya kinyama chumache na nkilima lange ngele.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Ntendekeya felemu ya mbau ya nkongo gwa nchita nu kujhemeka kupala kujhinuli gwema Lihema li Nyahinyahi.” <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Kila luheke lubhaha nutandamaho gwa mita ncheche, upana gwake nnombanicha kipande cha sentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Kila luheke mmacha pahe jhake anda nnombaniche ibhaha makongono mabhele kupala ijhema mbone. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Heke makome mabhele mitendekeya upande gwa kuchine mwa lihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />na itamilo yake makome ncheche itendekewa kwa madine gha feza ipakubhekwa pahe jha heke yenio. Kila heke ibhaha na yukutamila ibhele. Mbanda itendekewa kupala kubhonekana maha ni itamilo yenie. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Upande gwa kachikachine gwa Lihema, ntendekeya heke henge makome mabhele, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />itamilo yake makome ncheche ntendekeya kwa madine gha feza, kila heke itamilo ibhele ya pahe. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Upande ghukunyuma ghubhii kulitipikii lyobha jha Lihema, ntendekeya heke chita. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Helahela ntendekeya heke ibhele yu muimbokotole. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Heke ibhele yenie ya muupele ilombana pahe na kunane ikobhokelo yukutumbula yumuupele yoha itendwa hele kupala ilengane. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Yene ibhaha na heke nane na makongono ghake kome na chita gha madine gha feza. Makongono mabhele kila pahe jha heke.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />Helahela ntendekeya mighomba nhwano jha nkongo gwa nchita, kupala kulombanicha heke mukila upande gwa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />na mighomba nhwano kunhwalo gwa kulombanicha upande ghonge gwa Lihema, na mighomba nhwano jhenge nhwalo gwa heke ibhii upande gwa kunyuma gwa Lihema lilibhii upande kulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Nng'omba gwa pakate ubhaha nucho jha Lihema upeta pakate kubhoke kumwicho ade kumwicho jha Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Heke yoha muikilima chaabo nu kubheka ikobhekelo ya chaabo ipakukamulila mighomba jhenie, hele mikilima chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Yene mikitendekeya Lihema lyenio ngita chininangiya kola kukitombe. <verse eid="EXO 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Ntendekeya lipanjiya lenge lina kuhalala kwa ngobho nhuo. Lipanjiya lyenio nnoka ihumbe ina mapapanilo kuupunde panane jhake, nnoka kwa luche ya lange ya buluu na chambalau na ngele. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Nkobheka lipanjiya muheke ncheche ya nkongo gwa nchita yankilime chaabo, ikobhekelo ibhaha ya chaabo na mmeka itamilo ncheche gha madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Anda milikobike lipanjiya lyenio mwikobhekelo nkate jha Lihema lyenio, peniya milileta Lichanduko lya Lilaghano kongo mmekite ibao ibhele ya maghanga nkate jhake, na kulibheka kunyuma jhi lipanjiya lyenio. Lipanjiya lyenio libhaghanicha Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi na Chehemo jha Nyahinyahi Hake. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Peniya mmeka kiyekelelo panane jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Mmeke mecha panja jha lipanjiya upandi gwa kachikachine na lumule upandi gwa kuchine mwa Lihema.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Munnyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi ntendekeya lipanjiya likendao lilitengenichwe kwa ngobho nhuo lilokwitwe kwa luche ya lange ya buluu na chambalau na ngele, nu kulembelekelwa kwa upunde hake. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Helehela ntendekeya heke nhwano ya nkongo gwa nchita nu kukilima chaabo. Heke yene ibhaha na kikobhakelo cha chaabo, kila luheke lubhaha nikitamilo cha shaba.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Kulenganikiya chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko kwa nkongo gwa nchita</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Kubhoka 38:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Ntendekeya chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko kwa mbau gwa nkongo gwa nchita. Chehemo jhenie ilenganila pande yoha utandamaho gwake mita ibhele na nucho upana gwake mita ibhele na nucho. Na kimo chake mita jhimo na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Mu kila kimbokotole chehemo jheniye pa kupiikiya litambiko, ntendekeye imbetule ipakubhehe kilebhe chimo nu chehemo jhenie pa kupiikiya litambiko. Chehemo jhoha nkilima shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Ntendekeya yombo yake, ibhegha yukukengela malio na lichepeto kujhole malio na mabakule yukulelela na hyoma yukughalambukii nyama na ijhonjo yukujhipulii mwotu. Yombo yoha yenio ntendekeya kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Peniya, chehemo pakupiikiya litambiko lwenio ntendekeye lwaho lwa shaba na kunhwalicha pete ncheche, jhimo mu kila kimbetule. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Lwaho lwenio namubheka pahe jha luminiko kupala uhikila pakate jha chehemo pakupiikiya litambiko jhenie. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Hele, ntendekeya mighomba jha nchegha jhikugheghe chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko na jhenio mikilima kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Mighomba jhenio mijhingiya ikobhokelo yenie kila upande chehemo pakupiikiya litambiko, kipinde chukughegha. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Ntendekeya chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko kwa mbau na nkate jhake libhaa hwaa, tela na nnandanikilo ghuninangiya kukitombe kola.”<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo ghukutendekeya lwane lwa kukonganikila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 38:9-20">Kubhoka 38:9-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Ntengenecha lwane lwa Lihema lya nyahinyahi lya kukonganikila. Upande gwa kuchine cha lwane kubhaha na ngobho jhitengenichwe kwa ngobho nhuo jhina kuhalala, ibhaha na utandamaho gwa mita makome ncheche na ncheche kuupandi ghumo. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Mapanjiya gheniya ghakamulilwa na heke makome mabhele gha shaba na itamilo ya shaba. Nambo itabhilo yake na ikobhekelo itendekilwe kwa madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Ibhaha hele naha kwa upandi gwa kachikachine, utandamaho gwa mapanjiya mita makome ncheche na ncheche, na heke jhake makome mabhele ya chaba, nambo ikobhokelo yake naibhaha ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Upandi ghulitipikii lyobha mu lihema lya kukonganikila kubhaha na lwalo lwa mita makome mabhele niibhele na chabine nunhwano na heke yake kome na itamilo yake kome. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Upandi ghulihumii lyobha kubhii nnyango, lipanjiya libhaha na upana gwa mita makome mabhele niibhele. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Lipanjiya lya upandi ghumo gwa nnyango ubhaha nuupana gwa mita chita na nucho, pamonga na heke itato na itamilo yake itato. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Hele, upandi gwa ubhele gwa nnyango, lipanjiya lyake libhaha mita chita na nucho, pamonga na heke itato na itamilo yake itato. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Nnyango gwenio gwa kujhingili mu lwane ubhaha na lipanjiya, kutandamala kwake mita ticha, ngobho nhuo jhina kuhalala hake jhilembelekiwe kwa ngojhe ya lange jha buluu na chambalau na ngele. Lipanjiya lyenie likamuliwa na heke ncheche na itamilo ncheche. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Heke yoha kutindii lwane ikamulilwa na mighomba jha feza, itabhilo yake ibhaha ya feza na itamilo yake ibhaha ya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Lwane jhenie kutandamala kwake kubhaha mita makome ncheche na ncheche, ujhanuko gwake mita makome mabhele niibhele na ukolongwa gwake mita ibhele na nucho. Lipanjiya lyake libhaha lya ngobho nhuo jhina kuhalala na itamilo ya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Yombo yoha yukutumii mu Lihema lya kukonganikila, pamonga na ighinge yoha ya lwane ipalwa ibha ya shaba.”<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namuna ya kubheka mbone mule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 24:1-4">Akalabhe 24:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Malaghila Akaichilahele bhannetela mahuta ghighajhaka mbone hake gha micheitune, kunhwalo gwa mule, kupala mule ijhaka machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Alune na yana yake bhabheka mule jhenie upandi gwa panja gwa lipanjiya, palonge jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, nkate jhake ibhi ipande ya maghanga ghighajhandikwe mihilo. Mule yene ijhaka muda ghoha kutumbuli kimiye ade lukela. Akaichilahele bhoha na ibheluko yabhe bhaukamula nhwilo ghongo machiko ghoha ghangapeta.”<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Ngobho ya akapiya matambiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:1-7">Kubhoka 39:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />Namwe Mucha munnete kwango nnongo gwino Alune pamonga na yana yake bhibhahaghulilwe pakate jha Akaichilahele, Nadabo na Abihu na Eleazale na Itamale, kupala bhandumikile ngita akapiya matambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Munchonela Alune ngobho ya upiya litambiko ya nyahinyahi kupala impela ung'alicho na ichima. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Malaghila akamapunde bhoha bhinabholite, bhanchonele Alune ngobho kupala abhekwe palonge kwa lihengo lya upiya litambiko gwango. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Malobholela bhantengenechela ilebhe henge, kanpuko kapanganga na ngobho jhikuhekele nganga na kichibao na kanjo na lijoho lililembitwe na kilemba nu luhunga. Alune na yana yake bhawala kupala bhandumikila ngita akapiya matambiko bhango. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Akamapunde bheniya bhatumila ngojhe itengenichwe kwa mangoma gha mambelele gha lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele na ngojhe ya chaabo na ngobho nhuo ina kuhalala jhikulokwa.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />Mapunde bhatendekeya kichibao chakuwala mpiya litambiko cha ngobho nhuo jhilembelekiwe kwa ngojhe ya lange jha chaabo na lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele jhilokwitwe na kulembelekelwa kwa upunde. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Kibhaha na ngojhe ibhele yukutabhii mu mabhegha ghichonitwe mu malombolo ghake mabhele. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Luhunga lulukamulila itengenechwa kwa ilebhe yeye, kwa ngobho nhuo ya kuhalala nu kulembelekelwa kwa ngojhe ya chaabo ya lange buluu na chambalau na ngele kukulokwa nukubhehe kilebhe chimo na kichibao chenio. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />“Peniya ntola maghanga mabhele ghighakemwa saludonike, gheniya mijhandika kukulemba panane jhake maina gha yana ya Akaichilahele yane Yakobo. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Maina chita mulighanga likutumbula na maina ghighaighalike mulighanga lenge, mahina ghakengama tela mu kubhelukwa kwabhe. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Mughajhandika maina kukulemba panane jha maghanga gheniya ngita punde palemba muhuli, peniya nnyingiya mukikamulilo chikitengenichwe kwa chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Maghanga mabhele gheniya naghabhekwa panane jha luhunga lwa kichibao ngita ukombokelo gwa makabila kome na mabhele gha Akaichilahele. Na Alune nawala maina gheniya mu mabhegha ghake nnonge jhango ne Bhambo Chapanga ngita ukombokelo gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Ntendekeya ikamulilo ibhele ya chaabo, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikupu mibhele jha chaabo jhina kuhalala jhilokwite ngita ngojhe. Ntabha mikupu jhenie mu ikamulilo yenio.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimpuko chukuwala panganga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:8-21">Kubhoka 39:8-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Nantendekeya kampuko chikuwala panganga kwa ngobho nhuo jhina kuhalala jhukuloka chikutemulila, kitengenechwa kuupunde hake ngita kichibao chela kwa nyuche ya lange ya chaabo na ya lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele yukulokwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Kimpuko chenie kikonjwa kibhaha telatela pande yoha ncheche. Upana gwake na utandamaho gwake sentimita makome mabhele niibhele. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Kilembwa kwa upunde michitale ncheche jha maghanga gha bei ngolongwa. Nchitale ghukutumbula nchonela maghanga gha akiki na lya topache na lya alumache ngele, <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />na nchitale gwa ubhele nnemba maghanga gha chumalide na chohale jha lange jha samawate na alumache, <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />na nchitale gwa utato nnemba maghanga gha Yachinto na akiki ngele na lya amesisito, <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />na nchitale gwa ncheche nnemba maghanga gha zabalajade na lya chohamu na lya yasipe, ghoha ghabhekwa mu ikamulilo ya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Pabhaha na maghanga kome na mabhele ghighajhandikwe na kulembwa maina kome na mabhele gha yana ya Yakobo. Kila lighanga lijhandikwa liina limo kukulembwa, kupala kulangiya makabila kome na mabhele gheniya. <verse eid="EXO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />Kunhwalo gwa kampuko kapanganga keniya, ntengenecha mikupu jha chaabo jhina kuhalala jhukuloka ngita ngojhe. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Helahela ntendekeya pete ibhele ya chaabo nhwalo gwa kampuko kapanganga nu kubheka mu malombolo mabhele gha kampuko keniya, <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />muikonga mikupu mibhele jha chaabo mupete yene mu kampuko kapanganga keniya. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Nyenja henge ibhele ya imikupu ya chaabo jhenio nnombanicha mu ikamulilo ibhi mu kichibao mu mabhegha upande gwa nnonge. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Hele, ntendekeya pete henge ibhele ya chaabo nu kubheka malemulilo gha pahe upande gwa nkate gwa kampuko kapanganga pahina na kichibao. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Peniya, ntendekeya pete henge ibhele ya chaabo na muibheka palonge mulilombolo lya pahe jha ipande ya kichibao nu luhunga pukilombanicha kichibao na luhunga lulutabha ku upunde. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Mitabha pete ya kampuko ka panganga pamonga na pete ya kichibao kwa ngojhe ya lange jha buluu, kupala kukibheka kimpuko chapanganga kitame panane jha luhunga changamboghombala.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Yene Alune pajhingii chehemo jha Nyahinyahi awala kampuko ka panganga keniya chikijhandikwe mahina gha yana ya Yakobo, kwa ndela jhenio nenga Bhambo Chapanga nanikomboka mangota machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Mu kimpuko chenio nnekela ilebhe ibhele ikemwa Ulimo na Sumimo, ghitumila akapiya matambiko kukonyekeya chapala Chapanga kupala Alune aghegha panganga jhake kila paika nnonge jhango. Kupala amanya ibhele yambala kwa Akaichilahele.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngobho henge yu upiya litambiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:22-31">Kubhoka 39:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Nchona likanjo jhukuwalii kichibao kwa ngojhe ya mangoma ghilimbelele jhilembelikii lange jha buluu tugha. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Ibhaha na chehemo yukupetecha muto panakate, na chehemo jhenio ntindikiya lupendicho lulupumitwe kupala lingajwepuka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Mu lilombolo lya pahe nnembelekeya ilebhe ngita makomamanga gha lange jha buluu na chambalau na ngele, hele pabhaha na mangengecha gha chaabo pakate jha malembo ghenio. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Likomamanga na mangengecha gha chaabo, likomamanga na mangengecha kutindii likanjo jhoha. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Alune nawala likanjo jhenio pandumikii lihengo lyake lya upiya litambiko na mangengecha gheniya ghajhokanikika kipinde pajhingii Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi nnonge jhango na kipinde pabhoka. Anda awalite mangengecha gheniya nakomwa jhe.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Peniya, ntendekeya kibate cha chaabo jhambone na nyandika malobhe ghanga ngita chibhonekana muhuli, ‘Jwabhoitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga.’ <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Kibate cha chaabo chenie mukitabha nnonge jha kilemba ku lughojhe lwa buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Alune nawala kibate chenie pa kibhonge chake, kupala ne Bhambo Chapanga nyeketela matambiko ghoha ghibhipiya Akaichilahele kipinde nabhalemwa chukumbikiya litambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Muntengenechela Alune likanjo litandamaho linhuo lililembitwe na kilemba kinhuo. Kabhele nntengenechela luhunga lunhuo lululembwitwe na jwaloka.”<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />Na mitengenechela yana ya Alune likanjo na luhunga na kilemba kupala bhabhonekana lembolembo na bhina kuhalala. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Muwalicha nnongo gwino Alune na yanamundo ngobho yenie, peniya mandonyekela mahuta gha micheitune na kwabheke mabhoko kupala kwape mota ngita akapiya matambiko bhango.<verse eid="EXO 28:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Kabhele machonela kabudula nhuo yenio kubhoke mukibhuno ade mumabhondo, kupala bhakihibhilila chibhabhile. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Alune na yana mundo bhawala kabudula yenio kila pibhajhingii mu Lihema lyanyahinyahi, pange jhe pibhabhandikila chehemo pa kupiikiya litambiko, kukamu lihengo ghu upiya litambiko chehemo jha Nyahinyahi. Kwa ndela jhenio bhilangii jhe chibhabhile nu kupala bhakoto kukomwa. Gheniya ghipalwa kukengemwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta Alune na ibheluko yake.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Malaghalikilo ghakwabheka kubhehe akapiya matambiko Alune na yanamundo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 8:1-36">Akalabhe 8:1-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Henge ndi ilebhe ipalwa atendelwa Alune na yana mundo kupala bhajheketele kuntumika ngita akapiya matambiko. Ntola litohe lya ng'ombi nkambako na mambelele ghankambako mabhele ghangalemala, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />na mabumunda ghangalekwe ngedule ghighaunyitwe kwa mahuta na maandache majhebhejhalo jhangalekwe ngedule, nambo jhipakitwe mahuta. Yenio yoha itendengenechwa kwa liunya lya ukobha gwa ngano. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Peniya, mmeka mabumunda gheniya mu kichukilo chimo nu kupiya litambiko kipinde chimo na litohe lela na mambelele mabhele ghala.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />“Peniya, mupeleka Alune na yanamundo pannyango gwa Lihema Lya Nyahinyahi na makuwicha mache ngita chibhayobhalile Akayahude. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Ntola ngobho henge, muhwalicha Alune ngobho yu upiya litambiko, likote na likanjo na kichibao kiweko chapanganga nu luhunga lwa kunkonga mukibhuno lulupumitwe kwa upunde. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Kabhele muwalicha kinyemba umuto na pananejhi kilemba chenio mmeka kibate cha chaabo chikijhandikwe, jwabhohitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Andannyomolii gheniya, ntola mahuta nu kumiminila Alune pamuto gwake.<verse eid="EXO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />“Peniya, matola yana ya Alune miwalicha makanjo manhuo. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />Hele, matabha luhunga mikibhuno na kwawalicha kopiya yabhe nhuo. Yene pimipakummeka Alune na yanamundo kubhehe akapiya matambiko. Bheniya nabhabha akapiya matambiko machiko ghoha ghangapeta.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Peniya nanneta litohe lya nng'ombi nnonge jha Lihema Lya Nyahinyahi. Alune na yanamundo nabhabheka mabhoko ghabhe panane jha muto gwa ng'ombi jwenio. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Na kulichinja nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga pannyango ghu Lihema Lya Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Nkenga miyahe jhandina nu kuipakaya mumanyelo gha chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko na lukonje lwino na miyahe jhiighalile mijhitila pahe pa kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Kabhele ntola mahuta ghighayekele matumbo, pamonga na ibhende na ndutumba ibhele pamonga na mahuta ghake, mitiniya likitu panane pa kupiikiya litambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Nambo nyama jha likambako lyenio pamonga na limbendela na matumbo nnyochela panja jha kighono chino. Lyenio ndi litambiko lyu kubhoya uhakaho.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Peniya, ntola limo panakate jha mambelele ghankambako nu kunnobhole Alune na yanamundo bhabheka mabhoko ghabhe panane jha muto gwa limbelele lyene. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Na mwenga milichinja na miyahe jhake mimichila pa kupiikiya litambiko mumanyelo yoha. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Kabhele nheketa limbelele lyenie ipandeipande nu kujhoha matumbo ghake na makongono ghake, mibheka pamonga pubhii muto na ipande henge. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Ntiniya ilebhe yoha ilimbelele lyenie panane pa kupiikiya litambiko likukomelekeya ngita chimipiya litambiko, luumba lya litambiko lulupita pamoto lupakunhalalii nenga Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Ntola limbelele lenge lilihighilike, Alune na yanamundo bhabheka mabhoko ghabhe panane jha muto gwa limbelele lyenie. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Namwe mulichinja nu kukenga miyahe jhake jhandina nu kunpakaya Alune na yanamundo muilepelepe ya machikilo ghabhe gha ulelo na mumaghumba ghumulubhoko lwalelo na mumaghumba ghumulukongono lwabhe lwalelo. Na miyahe jhiighilile mmichila pa kupiikiya litambiko pande yoha ncheche. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Peniya, ntola miyahe jhandina jhiighalile panane pa kupiikiya litambiko pamonga na mahuta ghala mummichila Alune pamonga na ngobho yake, hele mamichila yana mundo na ngobho yabhe. Alune na yana mundo pamonga na ngobho yabhe nabhabha bhabhekwitwe palonge jhango.”<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Kabhele ntola mahuta gha limbelele lya nkambako lela na nkela gwake na mahuta ghighayekilii matumbo pamonga na kipande chambone cha kibhende na ndutumba yoha ibhele pamonga na mahuta ghake na libhondo lya ulelo. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Kubhoke mu kichukilo chela cha mabumunda ghangaleke ngedule, chikibhii nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, mitola libumunda limo pamonga na liandache limo lilihunyitwe kwa mahuta na liandache lijhebhejhalo limo. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Yenio yoha mukamuya Alune na yanamundo na bhene nabhajhinula kunane kubhehe ndi nginyililo jhukumbiikiya litambiko nenga Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Peniya, mitola kabhele kubhoke mumabhoko ghabhe nu kuitiniya panane pa kupiikiya litambiko lyukukomelekeya na ipiya luumba lwambone lupakuhalilicha nenga Bhambo Chapanga. Lyenio ndi litambiko lilipiywa kwa mwotu kwa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />“Peniya, mitola kidale cha limbelele chukummeke Alune palonge jhango na mijhinula mabhoko kunane ngita nginyililo chukumbiikiya nenga Bhambo Chapanga. Kidale chenie nakibhaha chino.”<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />Mpiya litambiko pabhekwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga kuhenga lihengo lya Chapanga, kidale na libhondo lya lilimbelele lya nkambako jhola jwatumika mulihengo lyenio lya kubhekwa nannyinula kunane ngita nginyililo jha kumbiikiya, na ilebhe yenio ndi ibhaha ya Alune na yana mundo. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Yene Akaichilahele machiko ghoha bhatola yenio kubhoke mu matambiko gha uteeke, nu kumpe Alune pamonga na yanamundo, gheniya ndi matambiko gha bhando bhuku Ichilahele ibhaipiya kwa Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Pukujhomwoka Alune, ngobho yake ya nyahinyahi ipelwa ibheluko yake, na bhene nabhawala lichiko lyabhe likumiminilwa mahuta nu kubhekelwa mabhoko. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Mwana gwa Alune jwapakubhujhii upiya litambiko gwa tatemundo, awala ngobho yenio machiko chaba mu Lihema lyanyahinyahi, kupala atumikila Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Ntola nyama jhilimbelele lyenio jwa litambiko nu kuteleka mulwane jhi Lihema Lya Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Peniya, mupela Alune pamonga na yanamundo, na bhene nabhalya pannyango gwa lihema lya nyahinyahi pamonga na mabumunda jhiighi mu kichukilo. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Nabhalya ilebhe yenie iipiitwa litambiko kunhwalo jha kujhelenichwa, nambo mundo jhonge ajheketilwa jhe kulye, nhwalo yenio ndi ya nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Nyama amu mabumunda anda ihighilike ade lukela, bhahe, mitiniya pamwotu, mangalye jhe nhwalo jhenio ndi ya nyahinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Yene ndi chimpakwatende Alune na yanamundo, nkengema ghoha ghuninnaghalikiye, matendela kwa kipinde cha machiko chaba. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Kila lichiko mpiya ng'ombi nkambako abha litambiko lijhelebhula uhakaho, kupala kubheka ujhelanicho na Chapanga, kukutenda yenie mulujhelebhula pa kupiikiya litambiko, peniya nnyitila mahuta pa kupiikiya litambiko kupala pajhelebulwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Kwa machiko chaba ntende ujhelanicho pa kupiikiya litambiko nu kujhelebhula, kujhomole kwa gheniya chehemo jhenio napabhaha pa nyahinyahi hake na chochoha chimpakupapaya nakibhaha cha nyahinyahi.”<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litambiko lya kila lichiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 28:1-8">Kibhalango 28:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Kila machiko kipinde choha chikiika, mpiya litambiko panane jha chehemo jhikupiikiya litambiko, matohe gha limbelele mabhele gha chaka chimo. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Litohe limo lya limbelele mpiya litambiko lukela na lenge mpiya kimiye. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Pamonga na litohe lyukutumbula, mpiya hele kilo jhimo jha ukobha ghuangalwinwe na mahuta ghambone gha cheitune lita jhimo, na lita jhimo jha divaye ngita litambiko likinywegho. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Na kimiye mitenda ngita chinteila lukela, milipiya limbelele lela lubhele lilitambiko pamonga na litambiko yakulya na kinywegho, luumba lwa litambiko lwenio lulupita pamwotu lumbakunhalalicha ne Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Litambiko lyukukomelekeya naipiywa kila lichiko, kibheluko ade kibheluko, nnonge jhango nenga Bhambo Chapanga, nnonge jha nnyango gwa lihema lya nyahinyahi. Mwenio nenga nangongana na bhando bhango nu kulonge namangota. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Peniya ndi pambakukongana na Akaichilahele nu ung'alo gwango napatenda chehemo jhenio kubhehe pa nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Kuyene, naniitenda Lihema lyanyahinyahi chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko ibhaha nyahinyahi, hele Alune na yanamundo bhandumikila ngita akapiya matambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Nandama panakate jha Akaichilahele, nanenga nama Chapanga gwabhe. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Pena ndi nabhamanya kubhehe Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwabhe, jhunimmohita kubhoke mukilambo chuku Michile, kupala ndamepamo panakate jhabhe. Nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwabhe.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Mecha jhukututukii ubane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Kubhoka 37:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Ntendekeya lichanduko kwa mbau jha nkongo gwa nchita kupala ntutukiya ubane. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Lichanduko lyenio likututukiya ubane libhaha telatela pande yoha, kutandamala na upana gwake ibhaha sentimita makome ncheche nunhwano ukolo gwake ubhaha sentimita makome ticha. Imbokotole yoha yukunane ibhonekana kilebhe chimo jha chehemo jhenio chehemo jhukututukiya ubane. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Lichanduko lyenie yekelela chaabo pande yoha yukunane na pande yoha mumapamanda na manyelo ghake, mitindikiya miniko ya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Mitengenechela michegha mibhele jha chaabo na kuibheka pahe jha miniko yake mupande yoha ibhele ilolekehana na ikamulilo yukugheghela. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Mighomba jhenio ntendekeya kwa nkongo gwa nchita nu kuyekelela chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Chehemo jhenio jha kupiikiya matambiko gheniya ubhekwa palonge jha lipanjiya muupele jha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano. Peniya ndi pimbakukongana na mwenga. <verse eid="EXO 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />Kila lukela Alune pajhingila kulenganikiya mule lulubhii mwenio, jwenio ndi atutukiya ubane ghunungila petelele panane jhake. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Kabhele natutukiya ubane kimiye papamba mule. Hupo yenio jha ubane litendwa kila lichiko lyangalekwa jhe muibheluko ino yoha. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Mu lichanduko lyenio mangatutukii jhe ubane gwangabhe nyahinyahi na mangapiya hilu litambiko likukomeleya amu hupo ya mbonje hilu kujhitila panane jhake hupo ya kinywegho. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Mala jhimo kila chaka Alune ipalwa ajhelebhula chehemo jhikupiikiya hupo yenio kukupakaya myahe. Atenda ujhelenicho gwa kubhokeya uhakaho kwa myahe kwa kila chaka muibheluko ino yoha nhwalo chehemo jhenio jhikupiikiya ndi nyahinyahi hake kwa nenga Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchango kwa lihema lya nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Kila pipakwabhalanga Akaichilahele, kila mundo ipalwa apiya nchango kunhwalo gwake jwenie kughombola ughome gwake, kupala pangabhejhe na malwalo mabhoho pakate jhabhe kukipinde chakwabhalanga. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Kila mundo jwapakubhalangwa ipalwa alepa mbijha tela na kipemo chikipangitwe mu lihema lya nyahinyahi. Lyenio ndi litambiko lyake lyapakunnepa. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Kila mundo jwapakubhalangwa, kuhumii jwa yaka makome mabhele nu kujhendelela, ipalwa ambiikiya litambiko lyenio. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Jhuna ilebhe mbwe angapiya jhe kupeta chiipalwa na nhwocho angalepele jhe kupiya nucho jhikipato chikipalwa kipinde chimimpiikiya hupo Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo jha kughombola ughome gwake. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Mwenga nampokela mbijha yenio ya kughombola ughome gwabhe kubhoke kwa Akaichilahele na mwenga mitumila kwa mahengo gha lihema lya nyahinyahi, na kilebhe chenio kibhaha nangomboka kwalonda Akaichilahele nnonge jhango, gheniya ndi malepo gha ughome gwino.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libakule likolongwa lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Ntendekeya libakule likolongwa lya shaba likukuhukiya lina kitamilo cha shaba, milibheka pakate jha lihema lya nyahinyahi na chehemo jhi kupiiikiya litambiko lyukukomelekeya nu mulitweleya mache. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Alune na yana mundo nabhagholola mabhoko na makongono ghabhe kutumii mache gheniya, <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />kabula jhukujhingii mu lihema lya nyahinyahi amu kubhandikila chehemo jhukumbiikiya litambiko lya kukomelekeya nenga Bhambo Chapanga, bhatenda yene kupala bhangawe jhe. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Bhipalwa kugholola mabhoko na makongono ghabhe kupala bhangaika kuwe jhe. Gheniya ghabhaha mihilo jha machiko ghoha ghangapeta kwabhe, kutumbulii Alune na kibheluko chake, kibheluko ade kibheluko.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namuna jha kulenganikiya mahuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Nantola ilebhe henge inungilila petelele hake, malelalela ghighakemwa manemane kilo chita na mdalachine ghunungila kilo itato na ukobha gwa mimeya ghunungilila ghulandana na mikota kilo itato, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />na jhenge aina jha mdalachine jhikemwa kida kilo chita, ipemo yenio yoha ibhaha lengalenga ngita ipemo ipangwitwe mu lihema lya nyahinyahi, helahela ntola lita ncheche ya mahuta gha micheitune. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Kubhoke muilebhe yenio mitendekeya mahuta gha nyahinyahi mighahangalana ngita chaitenda punde jwa manukatu, gheniya ghatumika kujhelebhulila ilebhe kunhwalo gwango. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Kwa mahuta gheniya mulimichila lihema lya nyahinyahi na Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />na mecha na yombo yake yoha, kinala chakubheke mule na yombo yoha, lichanduko lya kututukiya ubane, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />na chehemo jhukupiikiya matambiko ghu kukomelekeya na yombo yake yoha, libakule likolongwa na kitamilo chake. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Miitenda ilebhe yenio yoha ihenga lihengo lya Bhambo Chapanga na ibha nyahinyahi hake. Chochoha chimpakupapaya, nakibhaha nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Peniya mupakaya mamiminila mahuta Alune na yana mundo na kwajhelebhula kupala bhatumika ngita akapiya matambiko bhango. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Malobholela Akaichilahele kubhehe ghanga naghabhaha mahuta ghango gha nyahinyahi gha kupakala naghatumika mulihengo lyango muibheluko hino yoha. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Chonde mahuta gheniya angamiminilwa jhe mundo jwangabhehe mpiya litambiko, hilu ghangatengenechwa jhe mahuta ghange ngita ghanga, gheniya ndi mahuta gha nyahinyahi ghapalwa ghabhaha machiko ghoha kwino. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakutengenecha mahuta ngita gheniya amu kumiminila mundo jwangabhehe mpiya litambiko, mundo jwenio ipalwa abhekwa kutale na bhando bhango.”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulenganikii ubane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nantola ilebhe henge yukuhangalana ina kunogha ipemo yake ibhaha lengalenga, malelalela gha nkongo natafi na malelalela gha nkongo shekelete na malelalela gha nkongo gwa kalibena na ubane ghunungilila petelele. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Ntumila ilebhe yenio kutengenechela ubane ngita punde patengenecha manukatu, nnekela mwinyo ubhaha gwambone na nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Peniya nhyagha ubane gwenio nu kubhehe ukobha ghunakutema, utumika mu lihema lya Nyahinyahi nu kulipakaya Lichanduko lya Lilaghano, chehemo pimbakukongana na mwenga, gwenio ubhaha ubane gwa nyahinyahi hake kwino. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Pangabhehe jhe na mundo pakate jhino jwatengenecha ubane ngita gwenio, kwa nhwalo jhake jwenie. Nhwalo ubane gwenio ubhaha gwa nyahinyahi nnonge jhango. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Mundo jhojhoha jwapakukitengenechela ubane ngita gwenio nu kutumila ngita mahuta ghighanungulila petelele, nabhalangika jhe pakate jha bhando bhango.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Mapunde bhukutendekeya Lihema lyanyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:30-36:1">Kubhoka 35:30-36:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Nenga nihagwii Bezaleli mwana jwa Ule, na nchokolo jwa Ule, jwa likabila lya Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />na kuntweleya uhuke gwango. Nimpii malango na umanye na upunde gwa kila namuna, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />kupala kuumbula mahengo gha upunde na kutendekeya ilebhe ya chaabo na ilebhe ya madine gha feza na shaba. <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />Nimpile upunde kubhacha maghanga gha kulembelekeya nu kughabheka muibate na kuitumii mbau kwa mahengo gha kila namuna na kila umanye gwa upunde. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Hele nihagwii Olihabo mwana jwa Ahisamake, jwa likabila lya Dane, akamu mahengo pamonga na jwenio. Hele nimpilingine uhotolo nkolongwa bhange bhando nhwalo gwa mahengo ghange, kupala bhatendekeye ilebhe yoha yanalaghile itendwe. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Bhatengenecha Lihema li Nyahinyahi, na bhatengenecha Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na kiyekelelo chake, pamonga na ilebhe yake yoha, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />na mecha na yombo yake na kinala kilahalanao cha chaabo chukubheke mule na yombo yake, lichanduko lya kututukiya ubane, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />na lichanduko likupiikiya matambiko ghukukomelekeya na yombo yake yoha, libakule likolongwa lya mache na kitamilo chake, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />pamonga na ngobho ilokitwe maha upiya litambiko Alune na yana mundo bhibhapakuhenga mahengo gha upiya litambiko, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />na mahuta gha kupakala na ubane ghunungulila petelele hake nhwalo gwa chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi. Ilebhe yenie yoha itengenechwa tela na chinninaghalakiye.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichiko lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />Malobholela Akaichilahele naha, mangota milikomboka Lichiko lya Kupomolela, nhwalo lyenio ndi nginyililo panakate jhino na nenga ku ibheluko ino yoha kubhehe nenga ndi jhunihagwile mme mabhando bhango. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Mikamula mihilo jhango jha Lichiko lya Kupomolela na lyenio kwino libha lichiko lya nyahinyahi. Jhojhoha jwalihangabhana lichiko lyenio ikoto kujheketelwa nnonge jhango, ipalwa akomwa. Na mundo jwapakuhenga lihengo lyolyoha lichiko lyenio nabhalangilwa jhe mundo jwango. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Nhwenga mahengo kwa machiko chita, nambo lichiko lya chaba ndi Lichiko lya Kupomolela, ndi lichiko lyango lya nyahinyahi. Mundo jhojhoha jwahenga mahengo ghoghoha lichiko lyenie ipalwa akomwa. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Kuyene Akaichilahele bhalikomboka lichiko lya Kupomolela mu ibheluko yabhe yoha ngita nginyililo lya lilaghano lya machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Chenio nakibhaha nginyililo jha machiko ghoha pakate jha Akaichilahele na nenga, nhwalo nenga Bhambo Chapanga ngambangina nnema kwa machiko chita, nambo lichiko lya chaba ngangotwika kuhenga mahengo, ngambomolila.<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Bhambo Chapanga pajhomolila kulonge na Mucha pakitombe chuku Chinae, ngampila Mucha ibao ibhele ya maghanga, yenio ndi ngajhandika mihilo jwene Chapanga kwa lukonje lwake.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Kinyagho cha litohe lya ng'ombi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 9:6-29">Kombokela 9:6-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Bhando pibhamona Mucha atenda kiyoto hake kubhujha kuhuma kukitombe, ngabhakongina nnonge jha Alune nu kulonge, “Ngohe! Mututengenechele ichapanga ipakutulongocha, nhwalo tukimanyii jhe chikinkolii Mucha jwatubhoite kukilambo chuku Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Alune ngajhangwila, “Mukahule ndololo ya chaabo mumachikilo gha akaanabhino na yana ino ikeghe, unetele.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Bhahe, akakeghe bhoha ngabhahula ndololo yoha ya chaabo mumachikilo ghabhe, ngabhannetila Alune. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Jwene ngaitola na ngaitapiya, ngatengenicha litohe lya ng'ombi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 32:4">Bhando ngabhatondobhiya lilobhe, “Henge ndi ichapanga hito twe Akaichilahele! Bhamba ndi chapanga jwatubhoite kukilambo chuku Michile.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Peniya Alune nganchenge chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko litohe lela na ngatangicha, “Kilabho napabhaha na lichiko lya kuhangana kwino nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Kilabho jhake ngajhimwika putepute ngabhapiya matambiko ghukukomelekeya na matambiko ghukujhopa uteeke. Bhando ngabhatama pahe kulye nu kunywegha, peniya ngabhajhema nu kukina nukujhingi muhone.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Huluka pahe nhwalo bhando bhino bhimaletite kuhuma ku Michile bhakibhoghine bhene nukungana, <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />bhajhilekite ndela jwanalaghila, bhakitenganichile litohe lya ng'ombi lya chaabo kutapaya, na bheniya bhalijhinamii nu kulipiikiya matambiko bhilonge, ‘Hoko Ichilahele jhonjo ndi chapanga jwito jwatubhoite kukilambo chuku Michile!’ <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, namanye bhando bhamba, bhakwete mitwe mijhomo. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Ngohe, mangajhigha jhe kunhibhilila. Uneke nakome ku lilaka likolongwa, peniya natenda bhando bhajhingi kubhoke kwino mwenga.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Nambo Mucha ngampembila Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwake kwa kulonge, “Mwe Mabhambo Chapanga, nhwalo ghane lilaka lino lijhaka hake kwa bhando bhino bhibhabhoita kukilambo chuku Michile kwa makakala ghino makolongwa nu lubhoko lwino luna makakala? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Anda ntei yene, chakaka Akamichile bhilonge, ‘Chapanga gwabhe abhabhohite mu kilambo chito na kwakoma na kwakomelekeya njwenjwe pannema.’ Mwe Bhambo Chapanga ibhilikiya lilaka lino, nhwalo gwenio mmoho ghumpa kwatende bhando bhino. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Makomboka akatumiche bhino, Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu, bheniya malapila kwa mwojho gwino mabhene, nnongila, ‘Mbakwabheka ibheluko ino ibhaha twe ngita ndondo yukunane na kilambo chenje choha chinalaghila naniipela ibheluko ino kibhehe chino machiko ghoha ghangapeta.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Yene, Bhambo Chapanga ngakotwika kwatende bhando bhake ubhoho ghola gwalaghila chautenda.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Peniya, Mucha ngahulwika kuhuma kukitombe abhii na ibao ibhele ya maghanga mumabhoko ghake, ijhandikwe mihilo jha Chapanga pande yoha. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Ibao yenio ikatenganichwe na jwene Chapanga nu kujhandika mihilo jhake jwene Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yochuwa pajhohina njobhelo ya bhando, ngannobholila Mucha, “Ibhii njobhelelo ya ngondo ku kighono.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Nambo Mucha ngannyangwila, “Ngita njobhelo yakwahotola amu kulepela, nambo njobhelo inijhoha nenga ndi njobhelo ya bhando bhibhajhemba.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Papa pibhandikila tugha pikighono ngalibhona litohe lela na bhando bhakiina, peniya mwojho gwa Mucha ngujhaka hake kulilaka, ngaitaghila pahe ibao yenio, ngiikajhukila pahe jha pikitombe. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Peniya, ngatola litohe ngalitiniya mwotu ade kubhehe lihu, ngaunya lihu lyenio umache na ngalaghila Akaichilahele bhanyweghe. <verse eid="EXO 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Mucha ngankonyita Alune, “Bhannemwiye nike bhando bhamba ade kwajhingii mu uhakaho nkolongwa naha?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Alune ngajhangwila “Chonde manahota bhango lilaka lino lyakajhaka jhe kwa nenga natumiche bhino. Mamanye bhando bhamba chibhajhojwiki kuhenga ghanganandela. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Ngabhahikita nu kunnobholela, ‘Mututendekeye ichapanga ipakutulongocha, nhwalo Mucha jwatubhoita kukilambo chuku Michile tumanyii jhe chikinkolile.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Na nenga nganalobholila, kila mundo jwabhii na ndololo ya chaabo ailete. Bhahe, ngabhanetila, nanenga nganitapiya pamwotu, peniya, ngandendekiya litohe lyenio.”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Bhahe, Mucha palola bhando bheniya bhaghalwike na Alune ngabhalekita bhahenga chela chibhapala bhene nu kukiletela hone nnonge jha akamakoko bhabhe. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Mucha ngajhema nnonge jha nnyango gwa kighono nu kulonge, “Jhojhoha jwabhi upandi gwa Chapanga aike kwango.” Yana ya Akalabhe yoha ngiikongina pamonga nnonge jhake. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Mucha ngabhalobholila, “Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele ilonge naha, ‘Kila mundo atola upanga gwake mukibhono chake, atindila kila chehemo pakighono, kuhumii pannyango ghumo ade ghonge, na kila mundo ankoma nnongomundo, na nkochemundo na jwapahina jhake.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Akalabhe ngibhateila ngita chalaghii Mucha. Lichiko lyenio ngabhakomitwa bhando elufo itato. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Mucha ngalongila, “Deleno mukibhekite mabhene palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, nhwalo nkotwike jhe kuikoma yana ino na akalongobhino. Chapanga ampe mota deleno.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Kilabho jhake Mucha ngabhalobholila bhando, “Ntei uhakaho nkolongwa hake. Ngohe ninyendela Bhambo Chapanga kukitombe, nikannyopele panga jhe nanekekeya kukutenda uhakaho nkolongwa ghongo.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Peniya Mucha ngabhujha kwa Bhambo Chapanga nu ngannobholila, “Mwojho umina hake! Bhando bhamba bhatei uhakaho nkolongwa hake, bhikitengenechii bhene ichapanga ya chaabo nu kuijhinamila. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Nambo ngohe chonde nijhopa malekekeye uhakaho gwabhe. Anda mihoto jhe kulekekeya, nijhopa liina lyango umbute mukitabo chino cha mahina gha bhando bhino.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Nambo Bhambo Chapanga ngannyangwila Mucha, “Nambuta mukitabo chango liina lya mundo jhojhoha jwandendii uhakaho. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Ngohe nnyende makalongoche bhando ade chehemo jhininaghalikiye. Dola, ntumiche jwango jwa kunane kwa Chapanga nabhaha palonge jhino. Nambo lichiko lyambakuika kwahadabula, mbakwahadabula nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwabhe.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Bhambo Chapanga ngabhapelikila bhando ulwalo nkolongwa, nhwalo bhakannyopite Alune abhatengenechela litohe lya chaabo lela.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga alaghii Akaichilahele bhabhoke kukitombe chuku Chinae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nnyendele na mwanja gwa kubhoka pamba, mwenga na bhando bhino bhimabhoite kukilambo chuku Michile. Nnyendengane kukilambo chinalapanikiya Ulahimo na Ichaka na Yakobu nalobholila, ‘Ibheluko ino nanipela kilambo chenje.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Nanintuma ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga annongolele, na namabhenga Akakaanane na Akaamole na Akaahite na Akapeliche na Akaahive na Akayebuche. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Nnyendengane mu kilambo chikibhii chambone kulema nu kukoleka ipugho. Nambo nhwalo mangotamwe mitwe jhino mijhomo yene nilongohana jhe pamonga na mangotamwe, ngana kunkome undela.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Bhando ngabhalela nu kukokoleka pibhajhoha nhwalo gwenio mmoho, akibha jhe jwawalite yakukilemba pahyegha jhake. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Ngabhateila yene nhwalo Bhambo Chapanga akannobholile Mucha, “Malobholela Akaichilahele, ‘Mangotamwe mabhando bhimmii na mitwe mijhomo anda nongohinena mangotamwe, pange jhe kwa kipinde chandina, naninkoma. Yene nhwula ilebhe yakukilemba pahyegha kupala manye chimbakuntenda.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Peniya, Akaichilahele ngabhahula ilebhe yakukilemba pahyegha, pibhabhoka pakitombe Holebo yane Chinae.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihema lyanyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Akaichilahele pibhakibha mumwanja na kila pibhabheka kighono nhwalo ghu kupomolela, Mucha akibha na luhomo lwa kutola Lihema nu kukijhemeka panja jha kighono. Lihema lyenio ngalitina liina lya Lihema lyanyahinyahi. Mundo jhojhoha pabhehe na malola ghoghoha kwa Bhambo Chapanga ajhenda ku Lihema lyenio panja jha kighono. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Kila kipinde Mucha pajhenda mu Lihema lyenio, kila mundo ngajhemita pannyango gwa lihema lyake nu kunnolekeya Mucha ade pajhingila mu Lihema lyenio. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Kipinde Mucha pajhingila mu Lihema lyenio, luheke lwa lihunde lukibha lujhemita pannyango gwa Lihema lyanyahinyahi, na Bhambo Chapanga ngalonge na Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Bhando bhoha pibhalolita luheke lwa lihunde lujhemite pannyango gwa Lihema, kila mundo ngannyinamila pannyango gwa lihema lyake. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Yene ndi Bhambo Chapanga chakibha akilongila na Mucha kukulolekeyana, ngita mundo na nkoche mundo. Peniya Mucha ngabhujha kabhele kukighono. Na kangombo Yochuwa mwana jwa Nune jwakibha ntumiche gwake apitita jhe mu Lihema lyanyahinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga ilaghana kubhehe na bhando bhake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Mucha ngannobholila Bhambo Chapanga, “Dola! Mwenga nnongii, ‘Malongocha bhando bhamba,’ nambo unnobholii jhe ghane jhumpakuntuma andangatile. Na kubhehe umanye kwa liina lyango kubhehe mmii kunhalalicha. <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Deleno, chonde nimpembelekeya, anda chakaka unnyeketile, unangiye ndela jhino kupala nintumikila na nnyendelela kunnhalalicha. Helahela nkomboka mahagwii bhando bhamba kubhehe bhando bhino.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Chapanga ngalongila, “Nenga namwete nijhenda pamo na mwenga, nanimpepecha mwojho.”<verse eid="EXO 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Peniya, Mucha ngalongila, “Anda mwe mabhene milongohana jhe pamo na nenga, bhahe, mangatubhoha jhe, mutuleke pambano pano. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Mana bhando nabhamanya bhole kubhehe chakaka mihanganichwa mwojho nanenga, yane nenga na bhando bhino anda tulongohine jhe na twenga? Anda nnongohine pamonga na twenga naindenda nenga na bhando bhino tubhehe bhando bha kanjika pakate jha bhando bhoha bha pannema.”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Nhwalo nhalalicha palonge jhango, nane numanye liina lino, kilebhe chenje chunnyopite, nandenda.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Mucha ngalongila, “Chonde unangiye ung'alicho gwino kubhehe kwino.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Bhambo Chapanga nganyangwila, “Nambeta palonge jhino mbala umone chamii nambone nu kuhalala kwango, ngandangicha kubhehe, nenga ndi Bhambo Chapanga. Nenga nilangii umbone gwango kwa mundo jhojhoha jwapala ninnanigiye umbone nanimmonela kiya kwa mundo jwapanimmonela kiya. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Nambo mihoto jhe kumona kumiho jhango nhwalo abhii jhe mundo jwapakumona na kujhendele kubhehe ghome.” <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Peniya, Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Dola, ibhii chehemo pahina na nenga, peniya nannyema panane jha lighanga, <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />na ung'alicho gwango pumbakupeta, nimmeka mulugho lwa mulighanga nu kuyekelela kwa lubhoko lwango, ade pambakupeta. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Kubhoke peniya, nanulobhowa lubhoko lwango namwe namimona kunyuma. Nambo kumiho jhango mikubhona ng'o.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Ibao henge ijhandikwe mihilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Kombokela 10:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Mmache ipande ibhele ya maghanga ngita yela yukutumbula, na nenga nanyandika malobhe ghagha ghighakibha muibao yukutumbula yela inkajhulina. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Mukilenganikiye kupala kilabho lukela, nhwike kukongana na nenga panane jha kitombe chuku Chinae. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Mangalongohana jhe na mundo jhojhoha hilu angabhonekane jhe popoha pala pikitombe hilu limbelele amu ng'ombi mangaluchi jhe pahina na kitombe.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Peniya, Mucha ngabhacha ibao ibhele ya maghanga ngita yukutumbula. Ngajhenda putepute, ngahobhoka pikitombe chuku Chinae, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghilikiya, kongo abhii na ibao ibhele mulubhoko lwake.<verse eid="EXO 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Bhambo Chapanga ngahulwika mu lihunde, ngajhema pamonga na Mucha, ngalongila liina lyake, “Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Bhambo Chapanga, ngapetita nnonge jha Mucha ngalongila kabhele liina lyake, nenga ndi, “Bhambo Chapanga, nenga Bhambo Chapanga jhuna kiya na mota, nijhomboteka jhe kuyoma jhuna upalo na jhunihobholeka. <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />Nenga napala bhando maelufo gha ibheluko na kwalekekeya gwanganandela nu kulemwa na uhakaho. Nambo ata ikabhii bhole naleka jhe kwahadabula bhibhalemwa na kwahadabula yana na ichokolo uhakaho gwa akatatemundo, ade kibheluko cha utato na cha ncheche.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Papa Mucha ngalitita makilikite ade pahe palonge jha Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Mucha ngalongila, “Mwe Mabhambo gwango, anda chakaka nihuanganiche, ninnyopa ntyanga pamonga na twenga. Bhando bhamba mitwe jhabhe mijhomo, nambo mutulekekeye uhakaho gwito na malemwa ghito, mutupokele ngita bhando bhino mabhene.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilaghano libhekwa kabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 23:14-19">Kubhoka 23:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Kombokela 7:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">16:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Bhambo Chapanga ngonnobholila Mucha, Ngohe nibheka lilaghano na bhando bhuku Ichilahele. Nitenda ikangacho nnonge jhabhe gheniya ghinatendwa jhe pannema poha, hilu kilambo chochoha. Nambo bhando bhoha bhimitama panakate jhabhe nabhaibhona itendwa yango ikolongwa. Nhwalo nandenda kilebhe chikukangacha kunhwalo gwino. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Nkamula mihilo jhinimpe deleno. Mbakwabhenga nnonge jhino Akamole na Akakanane na Akahite na Akapeliche na Akahive na Akayebuche. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Mukilolekeye mangabheka jhe lilaghano na bhando bhikilambo chikimijhendelela, nhwalo lyenio lipakubhehe ntambo kwino. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Nambo mukatilulane chehemo jhabhe jhukupiikiya litambiko na kuhambughana heke yabhe yukujhinamila inyagho na kichapanga kikeghe kikemitwa, Ashela.<verse eid="EXO 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />“Manganyinamii jhe chapanga jhonge jhojhoha jhola, nhwalo nenga jhunimanyikina kwa liina lya, ‘Jhuna wiho,’ nhwalo anda munyinamii Chapanga jhonge nandenda kuyoma. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Mangabheka jhe majheketeleno ghoghoha na bhando bha kilambo chenio, nhwalo nabhaijhinamila ichapanga jhabhe nu kuijhopa, pibhakongana, na mangota nabhanalika nu kwakoloya kulye yakulya jhiitambikwii ichapanga yabhe. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Achikangombo bhino anda bhatolile achikabhale ya bhando bhena, bhibhajhinamii ichapanga jhabhe bhena nabhahuta achikangombo bhino, kukengama ichapanga jhabhe.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Mangatendekeya jhe ichapanga yuwange jha choma na kuijhinamila.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Kila chaka mmeka unyagho gwa mabumunda ghangalekelwa ngedule kwa machiko chaba kwa mwehi gwa Abibo. Namitenda yene ngita chininaghalikile, ipala kukomboka kubhehe mwehi gwenio ndi ghummokita ku Michile.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Kila mwana jhulitibho munalome ndi jwango, pamonga na mwana jhu litibho lya nkambako lya nyama ino yoha, jwa ng'ombi na jwa limbelele. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Mwana jwa litibho jwa liponda namukombola kwa kumpiikiya limbelele. Anda kulinkombo jhe milikoma kukulitwekuu ntandala. Yana ino inalome yiilitibho mbakuikombola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Hele mundo jhojhoha angaika jhe nnonge jhango mabhoko matopo.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Namuhenga mahengo ghino machiko chita, nambo lichiko lya chaba mpomolela, ata ikabhii kipinde chukulema amu mahuno.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Mmeka Unyagho gwa majuma na mahuno pimpakutumbuu kuhuna ngano, na unyagho gwa ichimba pikijhomolela chaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />“Patato kila chaka, akanalome bhoha nabhakonganika nnonge jhango nu kunyinamila nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwa Akaichilahele. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Nabhenga bhando bhibhatama mukilambo chenge nnonge jhino nu kujhonjekeya mipaka jhino. Abhii jhe mundo jwapakunoghelwa kilambo chino kipinde pimikongana kunyinamila nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga jwino patato kila chaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Mangambiikiya jhe litambiko lya myahe jha kinyama pamonga na mabumunda ghinekii ngedule, hilu matambiko gha Unyagho gwa Pachaka jhangaigha jhe ade lukela.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Mahuno ghino ghukutumbuu kuuna munng'onda gwino mileta kunyumba jhango nenga Bhambo Chapanga, Chapanga gwino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Mangatutu jhe litohe lya limbelele amu mbuhe kwa mabhele gha majhe mundo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, “Jhandika malobhe ghanga, kunhwalo gwa malobhe ghanga, mekite lilaghano na mwenga na bhando bhuku Ichilahele.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Mucha ngatamita kukitombe kwenio pamonga na Bhambo Chapanga machiko alobaine, muhe na kilo, alila jhe hilu kunywe kilebhe chochoha. Ngajhandika malobhe ghoha gha Lilaghano na mihilo kome jhela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:28">Mucha ngahulwika kubhoka kukitombe cha Chinae.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mucha ihuluka ku kitombe chuku Chinae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Mucha pahulwika kuhuma kukitombe chuku Chinae kongo abhii na ibao ibhele ijhandikwe malobhe kome gha Lilaghano mulubhoko lwake, amanyii jhe kubhehe kumiho jhake kukibha kung'anyima hake, nhwalo akibha alongila na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Alune na bhando bhoha pibhamona ngabhajhogwipa kunheghelela, nhwalo kumiho jhake kukibha kung'anyima hake. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Nambo Mucha ngankema Alune na ilongoche ya Akaichilahele bhajhende pahina na jwenio, peniya ngalonge nabho. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Kubhoka peniya, Akaichilahele bhoha ngabhaika pahina na jwenio, na jwenio ngabhape mihilo jhoha jhapokii kwa Chapanga pakibha pakitombe chuku Chinae. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Mucha pajhomolila kulonge na bhando ngayekelila kumiho kwa kitambala. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Nambo ngaibhila yene, Mucha kila kipinde pajhenda kulonge na Bhambo Chapanga ku Lihema lyanyahinyahi, ngabhohita kitambala chela ade papita panja. Na papita panja ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele ilebhe yoha yalaghalikilwe, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />na Akaichilahele ngabhaubhona kumiho jhake kukang'ala. Peniya Mucha ngayekelila kabhele kumiho jhake ade kipinde pajhenda kulonge na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Mihilo jha lichiko lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Mucha ngabhakonganicha Akaichilahele bhoha, na ngabhalobholila, “Henge ndi ilebhe Bhambo Chapanga yanaghalikiye kuhenga. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Nhenga mahengo ghino kwa machiko chita, nambo lichiko lya chaba libhaha Lichiko lya Kupomolela, lyenio libhekwitwe na Bhambo Chapanga. Mundo jhojhoha jwahenga lihengo lichiko lyenio nakomwa. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Mangakungana jhe ata mwotu munyumba hino Lichiko li Kupomolela.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nchango kwa nhwalo jha Lihema lya nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:1-9">Kubhoka 25:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Mucha ngabhalobholila bhando bhoha bhuku Ichilahele, “Chenje ndi kilebhe chanaghalikiye Bhambo Chapanga mukihenga. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Mpiya matambiko kubhoke mu ilebhe ino kwa kumpe Bhambo Chapanga. Kila mundo jwakwete mwojho gwaumbone apiya nchango gwa matambiko kwa Bhambo Chapanga, chaabo na madine gha feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />luche lwa kibuluu na chambalau na ngele, ngobho nhuo ina kuhalala na ngobho ilokitwe kwa mangoma gha mbuhe, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />na mambendela gha mambelele gha lipongo ghighakilimwe lange ngele na mambendela gha kinyama chamumache, na mbau ya nchita, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />na mahuta gha mcheitune kwa nhwalo gwa mule, na ilebhe yukunungila mu mahuta ghukumiminila kwa nhwalo gwa ubane ghuningila petelele, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />na maghanga gha selidoniki na maghanga ghange gha bei ngolongwa ghakulembekeya kichibao nu npuko gwa panganga.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilebhe yiipalwa mu Lihema li Nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:32-43">Kubhoka 39:32-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Kila mundo jwabhii punde jwa lihengo lyolyoha lela pakate jhino, aika kuhenga ilebhe yoha yanaghalikilwe na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />Ntendekeya Lihema li Nyahinyahi, kiyekelelo chake na itabhilo yake na mighomba na mbaghalo na itamilo yake, <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />lichanduko lya lilaghano pamonga na mikamulilo jhake, kiyekelelo hele kikemwa chehemo jhikulekekewa uhakaho, na lipanjiya lya Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi hake, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />mecha na mikamulilo jhake pamonga na yombo yake yoha na mabumunda ghighapihitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />kinala chukubheke mule pamonga na yombo yake yoha, mule na mahuta ghake, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />Lichanduko lya kututukiya ubane na mikamulilo jhake, na mahuta gha kumiminila na ubane ghu kunungilila petelele, lipanjiya lya panniango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi, <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />na chehemo jhikupiikiya matambiko gha kukomelekeya pamonga na lwaho lwa shaba, mikamulilo jhake pamonga na yombo yake yoha, libakule likolongwa na kitamilo chake, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />mapanjiya gha lwane na heke yake na itamilo yake na lipanjiya lya pannyango gwa lwane, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />Ighinge ya Lihema li Nyahinyahi na ya lwane pamonga na ngojhe yakwe, <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />na ngobho ipumitwe kukuhalala hake nhwalo gwa lihengo lya Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi. Yenio ndi ngobho ya nyahinyahi kwa mpiya litambiko Alune na yana mundo, kunhwalo gwa lihengo lyabhe lya upiya litambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhileta michangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Peniya bhando bhoha bhaku Ichilahele ngabhabhoka palonge jha Mucha nu kubhujha michimba yabhe. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Kila mundo jwakangitwe umwojho ghake ngampikiiya Bhambo Chapanga nchango gwake nhwalo gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi, pamonga na mahengo ghoha na ngobho yake ya nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Yene bhoha bhina mwojho gwaumbone ghukubhoha, akanalome na akakeghe, ngabhaleta ilebhe ya chaabo na pete na ndololo na mikupo na ilebhe henge ya chaabo, kila mundo ngampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Kila mundo ngaleta kila kilebhe chakibha nacho ngita mangoma gha mambelele gha lange kibuluu na chambalau na ngele, pange jhe ngobho nhuo ya mbuuu amu mambendela gha kinyama cha mumache na mambendela ghighakilimwe lange ngele. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Kila mundo jwahotwi kupiya mbijha amu shaba ngaleta kwa Chapanga ngita litambiko lyake. Kabhele mundo jhojhoha jwakibha na mbau ya nkongo nchita ngaleta hele. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Akakeghe bhoha bhubhakibha na upunde gwa koloka ngabhaleta ngobho ibhapumite kwa mangoma gha lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele kwa mangoma manhuo mbu. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Na akakeghe bhoha bhubhamanyii kuloka, ngabhalokita mangoma gha mbuhe. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Ilongoche ngabhaleta maghanga gha bei ngolongwa cha shohamo na maghanga ghange gha bei ngolongwa ghukulembekeya kichibao na npuko gwa panganga, <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />na hele ngabhaleta ilebhe inungila kunhwalo gwa mahuta gha mule na ubane ghuna kunungulila hake. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Akaichihele bhoha, na akanalome na akakeghe, kukupala kwabhe ngabhaletita ilebhe yenio ngita hupo kwa Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo gwa lihengo lyolyoha lyanaghii Mucha lihengwe.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapunde gwa Lihema lyanyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 31:1-11">Kubhoka 31:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Peniya Mucha ngabhalobholila Akaichilahele, “Dolangana! Bhambo Chapanga ahagwii Bezaleli, mwana gwa Ule, yane nchokolo jwa Hule, kubhoka mu likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Antwelii likakala lyake nu kumpe kumanya na malango na kuhenga kila lihengo lya upunde, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />ahumbula lihengo lyukutumii malango nu kutendekeya ilebhe ya chaabo na madine gha feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />abhache maghanga gha kulembekeya na mbau kwa nhwalo gwa mahengo ghange ghoha gha upunde. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Kabhele Chapanga ampii malango jwenio na Oliabo, mwana gwa Ahisamake, jwa likabila lya Dane, abhola bhando bhange. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Bhapii kumanya ghu kuhenga kila lihengo li upunde amu ghukulembelekeya gwa koluka kwa luche lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele na ngobho nhuo mbuu ina kuhalala yukuloka, kukitumii upunde gwa kila mundo jhojhoha jwamanyii upunde.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Kuyene, Bezaleli na Oliabo, pamonga na kila mundo Bhambo Chapanga jwampii uhotolo na malango ghu kumanya kuhenga mahengo ghoha mu kutendekeya Lihema lya nyahinyahi, nahenga mahengo kulengana na Bhambo Chapanga ghalaghalikile.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhando bhileta michangu twe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Bhahe, Mucha ngankema Bezaleli na Oliabo na kila mundo jwapatite umanye kubhoke kwa Bhambo Chapanga na kila mundo jwahenga lihengo jwapalita jwene. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Bheniya ngabhapokela ilebhe yoha kubhoke kwa Mucha yaipiitwa na Akaichilahele kwa nhwalo gwa lihengo lya Lihema li Nyahinyahi. Yene bhando ngibhajhendelila kunnete michangu Mucha kila lukela. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Bhando bhibhakibha bhahengita lihengo lya kutendekeya Lihema li Nyahinyahi, ngabhajhenda, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />nu kunnobholela Mucha, “Bhando bhaletite ilebhe mbwe hake kopeta hela yalaghila Bhambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Bhahe, Mucha ngalaghila, “Mundo jhojhoha, abhe munalome amu mwikeghe angaleta kabhele jhe michangu kunhwalo jha Lihema li Nyahinyahi.” Bhando ngabhaleka kuleta ilebhe, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />nhwalo yaye ibhakaletite ngikwela ku lihengo lyenie nu kuhighila!<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya Lihema li Nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Kubhoka 26:1-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Akanalome bhoha bhukumanya ngabhatendikiya Lihema li Nyahinyahi kwa mapanjiya kome ghikitambala chambone kihuo, ghighatenganichwe kukoloka na mangoma gha mambelele gha lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele, nu kulembelekeya ihumbe ina mapapanilo ikemwa makelube. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Kutandamala kwa kila lipanjiya ikibha mita kome niibhele na upana gwake mita ibhele. Mapanjiya ghoha ghakibha kipemo chimo. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Bhando bheniya ngabhalombanicha mapanjiya nhwano kubhehe limo, na kutenda hele naha kwa ghange nhwano. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Ngabhatendekeya lipogholo ya lange jha kibuluu mulilombolo lya lipanjiya li kujhomolela li kipande chukutumbula, na lipogholo longe mu lipanjiya li kujhomolela li kipande chu ubhele. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Ngabhabheka mapogholo makome nhwano mu lipanjiya li kutumbula li kipande chukutumbula, na mapogholo makome nhwano muminiko jha lipanjiya lya ubhele, mapogholo yoha ngalolikihine. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Kubhoke peniya ngabhatendekeya ikobhekelo makome nhwano ya chaabo kupala kulombe ipande ibhele yela ya mapanjiya, yene Lihema ngibhila kilebhe chimo.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Peniya ngabhatendekeya kiyekelelo chi Lihema kwa mapanjiya kome na limo jha mangoma gha mbuhe. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Kila lipanjiya lyakibha kutandamala kwake mita kome niitato, na upana gwake mita ibhele. Mapanjiya ghoha kome na limo ghakibha ndi kipemo chimo. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Bhahe, ngabhalombanicha mapanjiya nhwano pamonga, na mapanjiya chita pamonga. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Kubhoke peniya ngabhabheka miniko makome nhwano muluminiko lwa lipanjiya li kujhomolela li kipande chu kutumbula, na ngojhe makome nhwano muluminiko lwa kipande cha ubhele. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Peniya ngabhatenginicha mapogholo makome nhwano gha shaba kupala kulombe ipande ibhele ya mapanjiya, na yenio ngiibhila lipanjiya limo lya kiyekelelo. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Pubhajhomolila ghene, ngabhatendekeya iyekelelo ibhele, chimo cha limbendela lileghelao li limbelele lipongo lina lange ngele, na chenge chi limbendela lya kinyama cha mumache.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Kubhoke peniya ngatendekeya felemo kwa mbau jha nkongo gwa nchita gwa kujhemekela Lihema li Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Kila lifelemo likibha kutandamala kwake mita ncheche na upana gwake chentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Kila lifelemo ikibha napande ibhele yu kulombela. Felemo yoha ya Lihema ngaitendeke mbanda ibhele. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Felemo yenio ya Lihema ngitenginichwa yene, kwa makome mabhele upande gwa kuchine, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />ngabhatengenicha na itamilo makome ncheche gha madine gha feza pahe jha mafelemo makome mabhele na itamilo pahe jha kila lifelemo kupala ikamulila mbanda yake ibhele. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Na upande gwa ubhele, yane kachikachine ghu Lihema ngabhatendekeya mafelemo makome mabhele, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na itamilo yake makome ncheche ya madine gha feza, itamilo ibhele pahe jha kila lifelemo. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Upande gwa kunyuma, yane ghulitipikii lyobha mu Lihema, ngabhatendekeya mafelemo chita. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Ngabhatendekeya mafelemo mabhele nhwalo gwa imbokotole ya lihema ibhele ya kunyuma. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Mafelemo mabhele gha imbokotole ngaikamulila kubhoke pahe ade kunane mupete yu kutumbula. Mafelemo mabhele gheniya ghatengenichwe kwa ndela jhenio. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Yene pakibha na mafelemo nane na itamilo yake, ya madine gha feza kome na chita, itamilo ibhele pahe jha kila lifelemo.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Hele ngabhatendekeya mighomba nhwano jha nkongo nchita, nhwalo gwa mafelemo gha upande ghumo gwa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />mighomba nhwano kwa nhwalo upande ghonge gwa Lihema, na mighomba nhwano kwa nhwalo jha mafelemo gha upande gwa kunyuma gwa Lihema, chikibhii ghulitipikii lyobha. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Ngabhatendekeya nghomba gwa panakate ghuikii panakate jha Lihema lyenio, ngaikongina panakate kubhoke kumwicho ade kumwicho. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Mafelemo ghoha ngabhapakiya chaabo, ngabhatendekeya napete ya chaabo yu ukamulila mbaghalo yenio, hele ngabhapakiya chaabo.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Ngabhatendekeya lipanjiya lya ngobho nhuo nu kulembelekeya kwa nyuche ya lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele. Lipanjiya lyenio ngililembelekiwa ihumbe ilandana na makelube ina mapapanilo kwa upunde hake. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Kubhoka peniya ngabhatendekeya heke ncheche ya nkongo gwa nchita, ngabhapakiya chaabo na kubheka ikobhekelo ya chaabo. Hele ngabhatendekeya itamilo ncheche kwa madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Kabhele, kwa nhwalo gwa nnyango gwa Lihema, ngabhatendekeya lipanjiya kwa ngobho nhuo nu kukulokwa kwa upunde kwa nyuche ya lange jha kibuluu na chambalao na ngele, <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />na heke yake nhwano ikibha na ikobhekelo yake, yikakilimwe chaabo kuhuma kunane ade pahe. Nambo itamilo yake ikibha ya shaba, na heke yoha ngipakwitwa shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya Lichanduko lya Lilaghano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kubhoka 25:10-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Bezaleli ngatendekeya lichanduko lya Lilaghano kwa mbau ya nkongo nchita miya jhimo na likome limo, kutandamala kwake kukibha chetimita chitine na chita na kubhoka pahe ade kunane chetimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Ngalipakiya chaabo jhamaha nkate na panja, nu kutendekeya lubiniko lwa chaabo kutindila pande yoha. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Peniya ngatendekiya pete ncheche ya chaabo kunhwalo gwa kupetechela nchegha yukugheghela Lichanduko, ngabheka ijhemeleo yake, kila kijhemo pete jhimo. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Ngatendekeya minchegha jha nkongo gwa nchita nu kupakaya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Ngaiwalicha pete mighomba jhenio ibhii mu pande ibhele ya lichanduko, kwa nhwalo ghu kugheghela. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Ngatenginicha kiyekelelo cha chaabo jhamaha hele pakemitwa chehemo jhuku lekekeya uhakaho, kutandamala kwake chentimita miya jhimo na likome limo nu upana gwake chentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Helahela ngatendekeya ihumbe ina mapapanilo ibhele kukuyana chaabo nukubheka upande ghumo na upande ghonge panane jha kiyekelelo chake, <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />kihumbe chimo kumwicho kongo na chenge kongo. Ihumbe yenio ina mapapanilo ngibhujhila mu kiyekelelo chenio, ibhii telatela na kiyekelelo. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Ihumbe yenie ikibha mwiye na mwiye, mapapanilo ghabhe ghaatambulwe kukiyekele kiyekelelo cha lichanduko, na kumiho jhabhe iliti kiyekelelo cha lichanduko.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mecha jhukubheke mabumunda ghighapiwa palonge jha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Kubhoka 25:23-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Kabhele Bezaleli ngatendekeya mecha jha mbau jha nkongo gwa nchita kutandamala kwake makome nane na nane na upana gwake chentimita makome ncheche na ncheche na ukolo gwake chentimita chitine na chita. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Peniya ngapakiya chaabo jhamaha na kuitendikiya lubiniko lwa chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Ngaitindikiya mbau ukolo gwake milimeta makome chaba nunhwano kubheka lubiniko lwa chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Ngaitendekeye pete ncheche ya chaabo na kuibheka mu pande yake ncheche mu makongono. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Pete yenie yu kukamulila michegha jhakugheghela jhibhii pahina na ghola miniko gwa mbau. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Ngatengenicha michegha mibhele jha nkongo gwa nchita gwa kugheghela Lichanduko, ngapakiya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Ngatendikiya yombo ya chaabo jhamaha jhu kubheka panane jha mecha, yane yukulelela na ikombe na komiche nabakule kwa nhwalo gwa matambiko ghukunyegha.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya kinala cha mule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Kubhoka 25:31-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Peniya Bezaleli ngatendekeya kilana chukubheke mule kwa chaabo jhamaha. Kitamilo chake na kijhemo chikinala chenio kikibha chimo pamonga na ikombe yake, ndumbache yake na malobha ghake. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Mandabhe chita ghakibha mukinala chenio, mandabhe matato upande ghumo na mandabhe matato upandi ghonge. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Mu kila lindabhe kukibha na ikombe itato ilandana na malobha gha mloze, kila limo na ndumbache jhake na lilobha lyake. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Na muminiko kukibha na ikombe ncheche ilandana na malobha gha mloze, pamonga na ndumbache yake na malobha ghake. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Chehemo jhela jhipitii ndabhe itato jha pahe kwa kila upande, pakibha na ndumbache jhimo. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Ndumbache yenie na ndabhe ikibha kilebhe chimo na kinala chenio, na yoha ngiiyanitwa kwa chaabo jhamaha. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Hele ngatendekeya mule chaba, mikache na yahane yake kwa chaabo jhamaha. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Kinala chenio na ilebhe yake yoha, akatumii kilo makome matato nu nhwano ya chaabo jhambone kutengenechela.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lichanduko likututukii ubane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 30:1-5">Kubhoka 30:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Bhahe, Bezaleli ngatenginicha lichanduko likututukii ubane kwa mbau ya nkongo gwa nchita. Kichanduko chenio kikibha pande yoha ncheche ilengana kwa chentimita makome ncheche nunhwano na upana gwake na utandamalo na ukolo gwake chentimita makome ticha. Imbetule ya kichanduko chenio ikibha kilebhe chimo na chehemo jhenio jhukupiikiya. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Kichanduko choha ngakipakiya chaabo jhamaha, chehemo jhukunane, hele chehemo ilipamanda na imbetuli yake, ngatendikiya miniko ya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Ngatendekeya pete ibhele ya chaabo pahe jha miniko mu pande ibhele ilolekeyana. Pete yenie ngaitumika kukamuli michegha jhu kugheghela. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Peniya ngatendekeya michegha mibhele jha nkongo gwa nchita nu kupakaya chaabo.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya mahuta kupakaya bhando na ilebhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 30:22-38">Kubhoka 30:22-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Ngatendekiya mahuta ghamaha ghukupaka, na ubane gwamaha ghunhangalwinwe maha ghigha tengenichwe na punde jwatengenecha manukatu.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Lichanduko likupiikiya matambiko ghukukomelekela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Kubhoka 27:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Bezaleli ngatendikiya lichanduko likupiikiya matambiko gha kukomelekelwa. Lichanduko jhenio kutandamala kwake kukibha telatela, mita ibhele na lobo kwa mita ibhele na ukolo gwake mita jhimo na nucho. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Mu kila upande gwa lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko lyenio ngabheka kimbeketule pakibha na manyelo lilikibha kitenginichwe kubhoke mulichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko lyenio na kubhehe kilebhe chimo. Lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko lyoha ngalipakiywa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Helehela ngatendikiya ilebhe yoha kwa shaba, kunhwalo jha lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko. Ngatendikiya ibhegha na lichepeto na mabakule na yoma yu kughalambukila nyama na ijhonjo yukujhipulii mwotu nu kujhole maliho. Yombo yake yoha ngatenginicha kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Peniya, ngalenganikiya lwaho lwa shaba ngalubheka pahe jha luminiko pakate jha lichanduko lyenie. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Mu imbokotole ncheche ngatendekeya pete ncheche ya shaba yukugheghe lichanduko lyenio. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Ngatendekeya mighomba jha nkongo nchita jhu kugheghe kichanduko chenio nu kupakaya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Ngabhekita mighomba jhenio mu pete mu kila kimbokotole cha lichanduko lyenio. Lichanduko lyenio likatengenichwe kwa mbau nkate jhake pakibha napwache.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya libakule likolongwa lya Shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 30:18">Kubhoka 30:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Peniya Bezaleli ngatendekiya libakule likolongwa lya shaba na kitamilo chake chkikibha cha shaba, libakule lyenio likatenganichwe kwa ipande ya lindala lya shaba itumika na akakeghe bhibhahengita lihengo mu lihema lya nyahinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya lwane kutindii Lihema li Nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:9-19">Kubhoka 27:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Peniya ngatendikiya lwane. Na mapanjiya gha upande gwa kuchine mwa Lihema lya lwane ikibha ngobho nhuo jha mbuu na kutandamala kwake mita makome ncheche na ncheche, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />na yenie ikamulilwa na heke makome mabhele ya shaba na itamilo makome mabhele gha shaba. Nambo ikobhekelo yake na ngenge yake ikibha jha madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Lipanjiya lya upandi gwa kachikachine kutandamala kwake kukibha mita makome ncheche na ncheche, na heke yake makome mabhele ya shaba, nambo ikobhekelo ya heke yenio na ngenge ikibha ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Na upande gwa kulitipikii lyobha kukibha na lipanjiya kutandamala kwake mita makome mabhele niibhele na heke yake kome na itamilo yake kome. Ikobhekelo ya heke na ngenge yake ikibha ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Upandi gwa ghulipitii lyobha, kukibha na nnyango, na upana gwake ukibha mita makome mabhele niibhele. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Lipanjiya lya kila upandi gwa nnyango lyakibha upana gwake mita chita na nucho, pamonga na heke itato na itamilo yake itato. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Na upande ghonge hele ukibha na lipanjiya ujhanuko gwake mita chita na nucho, pamonga na heke itato na itamilo yake itato. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Mapanjiya ghoha kutindii lwane ghakibha gha ngobho nhuo gha mbuu ghukulokwa maha. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Itako yake yoha ya heke ikibha ya shaba, nambo ikobhekelo ya heke yenio ikibha ya madine gha feza. Heke yake yoha na ikobhakelo ikibha ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Lipanjiya lya nnyango gwa lwane likatengenichwe kwa ngobho nhuo jha mbuu na kulembelekeya kwa luche ya lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele. Na lyenio kutandamala kwake mita ticha na ukola kwake mita ibhele, tela na mapanjiya gha lwane. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Hele heke yake ikibha ncheche na itamilo ncheche ya shaba, kunane jha heke yenio kukabhekitwe madine gha feza, ikamulilo yake ikibha ya madine gha feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Ighinge yake yoha ya Lihema na ya lwane ikibha ya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilebhe itumika kutendekeya Lihema lya Nyanyahi na lwane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Henge ndi ilebhe itumika kutendeke Lihema li Nyahinyahi, mwenio likabhekwitwe Lichanduko lya Lilaghano na lilikibha na ibao ibhele ya maghanga ikajhandikwe mihilo jha Chapanga. Ichabo yenio ipangitwe na Akalawe kwa mihilo jha Mucha, kakatumiche gwa Isamale, mwana jwa mpiya litambiko Alune.<verse eid="EXO 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bezaleli, mwana gwa Ule, nchokolo jwa Hule, jwa likabila lya Yuda, ngateila kila kilebhe Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Ngatangatilwa na Oliabo mwana jwa Ahisamiki, jwa likabila lya Dane, punde jhukutendeke ngobho nhuo nu kulembeke nyuche ya buluu na chambalau na ngele na punde jhukubhacha maghanga nu kulemba mumaghanga.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Chaabo yoha jhibhampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga kunhwalo gwa kutendekeya Lihema li Nyahinyahi ikibha kilo miya nane na chabine na chaba na ghilamo miya itato, tela na ipemo ipangitwa mu Lihema li Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Madine gha feza ghibhachangita Akaichilahele bhibhabhalwingwe ikibha kilo elufo itato na kome na chaba na ghilamo miya chaba na amuchine, tela na ipemo ipangitwa mu Lihema li Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Kila mundo munalome ngabhalangilwa kutumbuli yaka makome mabhele na jhimo nu kujhendelela ngapiita nchango gwaake gwa madine gha feza ghilamo nhwano, na akanalome bhoha bhibhabhalingwe bhakibha lake chita na elufo itato na miya nhwano na amuchine. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Kilo elufo itato ya madine gha feza ngaitumika kutendekeya itamilo miya jhimo ya Lihema li Nyahinyahi na lipanjiya, tela na kilo makome matato kila kitamilo chimo. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Kilo kome na chaba na ghilamo makome chaba nu nhwano jhiighalike, ngaitumika kutengenechela ikobhekelo ya heke na iyekelelo ya heke yenio. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Shaba jhoha Akaichilahele jhibhampiikiya Bhambo Chapanga, ikibha kilo elufo ibhele miya jhimo na ichiline na ncheche. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Bezaleli ngatumila shaba jhenio kutengenechela itamilo ya nnyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi, lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko cha shaba pamonga na lwaho lwake lwa shaba na yombo yoha ya lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />pamonga na itamilo ya lwane itendikwii Lihema li Nyahinyahi na ya nnyango gwa lwane, na ighinge yoha ya Lihema lya nyahinyahi na ya lwane.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya ngobho ya kuwala mpiya litambiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Kubhoka 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Bezaleli na Oliabo ngabhanchone Alune ngobho ya lembulembu kwa kutumii nyuche ya mangoma gha mambelele gha lange jha buluu, chambalau na ngele Alune ngobho yukuntumikii chegele hemo jha nyahinyahi Bhambo Chapanga mu Lihema lilibhi Nyahinyahi, ngita pannaghila Mucha.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Ngabhanchone kichibao kwa ngobho nhuo mbuu kulembelekeya kwa nyuche ya chaabo na mangoma gha mambelele gha lange jha buluu na chambalau na ngele. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Ngabhayanita chaabo nu kueketa nyuche inying'inyile kupala kuloka pamonga na nyuche ya lange jha buluu, ya chambalau na ngele, nu koloka nyuche yenio kuupunde mu ngobho nhuo mbuu. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Kichibao chenie kiwalilwa na luhunga ibhele mu malombolo ghake mabhele kupala kuitabha mumabhegha. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Luhunga lulukamulila kwa upunde panane jhake kupala kutabha lukibha kilebhe chimo telatela na kichibao chenio, na ngalutenganichwa kwa ilebhe yeye, chaabo, nyuche ya buluu, na chambalau na ngele, nu kulembelekeya mu ngobho nhuo mbuu kukolokwa, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Peniya, ngabhaleta maghanga gha sadolunike nu kubheka ikobhokelo ya chaabo. Na panane jha maghanga gheniya ngibhajhandika maina kome na mabhele gha yana ya Yakobu, ngita muhule chiujhandikwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Ngabhabheka ilebhe yenie mu luhunga lwa mumabhegha gha kichibao chenio, kupala kombokela yana kome na ibhele ya Yakobu, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya kimpuko ka panganga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:15-30">Kubhoka 28:15-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Mapunde ngibhatenginicha kimpuko ka panganga ngita chibhatenginicha kichibao, kwa ngobho nhuo mbuu nu kulembelekeya chaabo na nyuche ya lange jha buluu na lange jha chambalau na lange ngele. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Kipuko chenio ngakikonjitwa na kikibha na pande ncheche ilenganila, utandamaho na upana gwake ukibha chentimita makome mabhele na ibhele. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Kampuko keniya kikalembelikiwii ku michitale ncheche jha maghanga gha bei ngolongwa, nchitale ghukutumbula ukibha gwa maghanga gha akiki na topache na alumache ngele, <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />nchitale gwu ubhele ukibha na madine gha chumalide na maghanga gha jhohale gha lange jha samawate na alumache, <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />nchitale gwa utato ukibha na maghanga gha yachito, jha akiki ngele na amesisito, <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />na nchitale gwa ncheche ukibha gwa maghanga gha zabalajade, ya chohamu na yasipe, ghoha ngaghabhekitwa muibanilo ya chaabo. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Bhahe, pakibha na maghanga kome na mabhele ghighandikwe mahina kome na mabhele gha yana ya Yakobu. Ghakibha ghajhandikwe ngita pibhajhandika muhule, kila lighanga likajhandikwe liina limo kombokela yana kome na ibhele. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Ngabhatenginicha mikupo jha chaabo jhambone kunhwalo gwa kampuko ka panganga. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Ngabhatenginicha ibanilo ibhele ya chaabo, nu kubheka pete yene mumalombolo mabhele ghu kunane gha kampuko keniya. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Mikupo mibhele jha chaabo jhenio ngabhabanila mupete yenio mukampuko ka panganga. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Nyenja ibhele yela jha imikupu ya chaabo ngalombanicha muibainilo ibhele hela ngibhibheka ikamulane na ipande ibhele yumabhegha ya kichibao, upande gwa nnonge. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Ngabhatenginicha pete henge ibhele ya chaabo upande gwa pahe nkate jha kichibao chenio, na kubheka palonge munyenje ibhele ya pahe jha kichibao, chehemo jhilombanicha nu luhunga lola lululokwitwe kwa upunde hake. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Peniya ngabhatengenecha pete henge ibhele ya chaabo nu kubheka nnonge munyenje ya pahe muipande kichibao, chehemo pukulombanicha na luhunga lukoloka ku upunde hake. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Ngabhatabhita kimpuko cha panganga panane pikichibao na kulombanicha na pete ya kichibao ku lughojhe lwa lange jha buluu, kupala kampuko keniya kangamboghombala jhe nambo kitamii luhunga lululokitwe ku upunde hake, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendekeya ngobho henge yu kuwala mpiya litambiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:31-43">Kubhoka 28:31-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Ngabhatendekeya likanjo lya lange jha kibuluu jhu kuwalii nkate jha kichibao. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Likanjo lyenie ikibha na chehemo jha kupeteche muto panakate, na jhenie ngabhatindikiya lupendecho lwa koloka kupala ingajhepuka jhe. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Muminiko jha pahe jha likanjo ngabhapuma malembelekeo gha makongamanga gha lange jha buluu, ya chambalau na lange ngele, na ngobho nhuo mbuu. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Peniya ngabhatendekeya mangengecha gha chaabo, na ngabhajhepanicha likomamanga limo na lingengecha limo kutindii muminiko jha likanjo lyenio. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Yene, mangengecha na likomamanga ngighakengamana kutindi miniko jha likanjo lyenio, ngita Bhambo Chapanga pannaghalikila Mucha.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Hele ngabhachonila magwanda Alune na yanamundo likote lya ngobho nhuo ya mbuu. <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />Kwa kitambala kinhuo ngabhatenginicha kilemba na kopiya na kaputula kukolokwa, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />na hunga ya nyuche nhuo mbuu yukolokwa kwa nyuche ya lange jha kibuluu na chambalau na ngele nu kolokwa kukulembekeya, ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 39:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Peniya, ngabhatenginicha kibate cha chaabo ku nhwalo jha hingo jha nyahinyahi na kujhandika panane jhake ngita punde jwatendekeya muhuli, “Jwapihitwe kwa Bhambo Chapanga.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Ngibhatabhalila nnonge jha kilemba kulughojhe lwa lange jha kibuluu, ngita Bhambo Chapanga pannaghila Mucha.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujhomolela lihengo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:10-19">Kubhoka 35:10-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Bhahe, lihengo lyoha lyukutengenecha Lihema li Nyahinyahi ngibhajhomolila. Akaichilahele ngabhajhomolila ghoha ngita Bhambo Chapanga channaghila Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Ngabhannetila Mucha Lihema li Nyahinyahi na yombo yake yoha, itabhilo yake na mafelemo ghake na mbaghalo yake na heke yake na itamilo yake, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />na kiyekelelo chikitendekwii kwa mambendela gha mambelele ghankambaku na mbuhe kikilimwe lange ngele, lipanjiya lya Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />lichanduko lya Lilaghano, na heke jha nchegha jhukugheghe na kiyekelelo chake, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />mecha na yombo yake yoha, na mabumunda jhiipiitwa palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />kilebhe cha chaabo jhambone jhukubheke mule na mule yake na yombo yake yoha pamonga na mahuta gha mule, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />lichanduko lya chaabo na mahuta ghukupakaya na ubane ghununguli petelele, lipanjiya lya nnyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />lichanduko likupiikiya matambiko cha shaba na lwaho lwake lwa shaba, mighomba jhake na yombo yake yoha, na libakule likolongwa na kitamilo chake, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />mapanjiya gha lwane na heke yake na itamilo yake na lipanjiya lya nnyango gwa lwane na ngojhe yake na ighinge yake na yombo yoha ipakutumika mu Lihema li Nyahinyahi, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />na ngobho yoha ilokwitwe maha hake nhwalo ghu kutumikii Chehemo Jha Nyahinyahi, yane ngobho ya nyahinyahi ya mpiya litambiko Alune, na yana mundo kwa lihengo lyenio lya upiya litambiko. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Akaichilahele ngabhateila kila kilebhe ngita Bhambo Chapanga pannaghila Mucha. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Mucha ngakagwila kila kilebhe, na ngamanya kubhehe bhakibha bhatehi kila kilebhe ngita Bhambo Chapanga chalaghila. Yene Mucha ngabhajhope mota kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Lihema li Nyahinyahi litendwa kujhemikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Bhambo Chapanga ngannobholila Mucha, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Lichiko lyu kutumbula lya mwehe ghukutumbula, milijhemeka Lihema li Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Nkate jha Lihema lyenio mmeka Lichanduko lya Malaghano lilibhi na mihilo kome na peniya mmeka lipanjiya nnonge jhake. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Nnyingiya mecha na kupanga yombo panane jhake. Mijhingiya kinala cha mule chela nu kubheka mule yake panane jhake. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Lichanduko lya chaabo likututukiya ubane mibheka nnonge jha lichanduko lya malaghano, peniya nkobheka lipanjiya pannyango ghu Lihema li Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko lyakukomelekeya mmeka nnonge jha nnyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Libakule likolongwa likukii mache milibheka panakate jha Lihema li Nyahinyahi nu lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko nu kulitwele mache. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Nanchenga lwane na kukobheka lipanjiya pa nnyango gwake.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Peniya mulibheka palonge jha Bhambo Chapanga Lihema li Nyahinyahi pamonga na yombo yake yoha kukimiminila mahuta gha mota na chenio nalibha nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Kabhele nalijheketelwa palonge jhango lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko na yombo yake yoha kukumiminila mahuta, na lyenio nalibha ijhelewike hake. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Helehela mijhelebhula kundela jhejhe libakule likolongwa likukii mache na kitamilo chake.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Munkema Alune na yana mundo iike pannyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi, peniya namajhoghecha mache ngita chiipalwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Muwalicha Alune ngobho yambone yu upiya litambiko, mumiminila mahuta nu kukutenda yene munnyemeka palonge jha Bhambo, kupala abha mpiya litambiko. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Mikema yanamundo na kuwalicha makanjo ghala. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Peniya mamiminila mahuta ngita chimiminila tategwabhe, kupala bheniya bhatumika ngita akapiya matambiko. Kwamiminila kwenio kwabheka kubhehe mupiya litambiko machiko ghoha muibheluko yabhe yoha.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Bhahe, Mucha ngatenda kila kilebhe telatela na malaghilo gha Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Mu lichiko likutumbula lya mwehe ghukutumbula chaka cha ubhele kuhumii pibhabhokita ku Michile, Lihema li Nyahinyahi ngalijhemikwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Mucha na ajhake ngibhabheka itamilo yake, ngabhajhinula mafelemo ghake, ngalombanicha na mbaghalo yake nu kujhemeka heke yake. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Ngatandiya lipanjiya ngilitindii Lihema li Nyahinyahi nu kubheka kiyekelelo cha Lihema panane jhake, ngita chalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Peniya, Mucha ngatola ibao ibhele ya maghanga na kuibheka mu Lichanduko lya Lilaghano. Na ngaipetecha heke mupete ya lichanduko nu kubheka kiyekelelo panane jha lichanduko lyenie. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Bhahe, Mucha ngabheka Lichanduko Lilaghano mu Lihema na kukobheka lipanjiya, kukutenda yenio ngaliibhilikiya Lichanduko li lilaghano ngita chalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Mucha ngabheka mecha nnonge jha Lihema li Nyahinyahi, upandi gwa kachikachine mwa lipanjiya, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />na panane jhake ngapanga mabumunda ghighapiwa kwa Bhambo Chapanga, ngita chalaghila na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Ngabhekita kinala cha mule nkate jha Lihema li Nyahinyahi, upandi gwa kuchine, mwiye na mwiye jha mecha. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Mwenio, nnonge jha Bhambo Chapanga, ngapamba mule yake, ngita chalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Mucha ngabhekita lichanduko lya chaabo lya kututukii ubane mu lihema, nnonge jha lipanjiya, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />nu kututukiya ubane ghunungila panane jhake, ngita chalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Ngakobheka lipanjiya pannyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi lya Bhambo Chapanga, <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />nnonge jha nnyango gwa Lihema li Nyahinyahi ngabhabheka lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko ghukukomelekeya. Ngapanga panane jhake matambiko ghukukomelekeya na matambiko gha ukobha, ngita chalaghilwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Ngabheka libakule likukii mache panakate jha Lihema na chehemo jha kupiikiya litambiko, kutwele mache ghukuwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Mucha na Alune na yana yabhe, bhoha ngabhakuwa mabhoko ghabhe na makongono peniya, <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />kila pibhajhingila nkate jha Lihema li nyahinyahi amu pibhajhenda pa kupiikiya litambiko ghukukomelekeya bhapalitwa bhakuwa mache, ngita Mucha chalaghilwa na Bhambo Chapanga. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Peniya, Mucha ngatendekiya lwane lwa kukitindi Lihema li Nyahinyahi na lichanduko lya kupiikiya litambiko ghukukomelekeya, nu kubheka mapanjiya mu nnyango gwa lwane. Yene, Mucha ngajhomolila mahengo ghoha.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihunde panane jha Lihema li Nyahinyahi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 9:15-23">Kibhalango 9:15-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Peniya, lihunde ngaliyekelela Lihema li Nyahinyahi, na ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ngautwelila mu lihema li nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Yene Mucha akahotwi ng'o kujhingi mu Lihema li Nyahinyahi nhwalo lihunde lyenie ngilitama panane jhake, na ung'alicho gwa Bhambo Chapanga ukatweli mwenio. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Mumwanja gwabhe gwoha Akaichilahele, bhakatumbwii jhe mwanja ade lihunde lyenie pilijhinulilwa kubhoka panane jha Lihema li nyahinyahi. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Anda lihunde lyenie lijhinulwii jhe bheniya bhabhokita jhe bhalendilila ade kipinde pilijhinulilwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Mu mwanja gwabhe gwoha, Akaichilahele muhe bhakahotwii kulibhona lihunde lya Bhambo Chapanga panane jha Lihema li Nyahinyahi, na kilo ngabhaubhona mwotu ukajhaka lihunde panane jha lihema li nyahinyahi.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>